msgid ""
"It has been some time ago that changes in the Bible text were received from "
"the Cloud."
msgstr "Zadutsa nthawi kuchokera pamene zosintha za mawu a Baibulo zinalandiridwa kuchokera ku Cloud."

msgid ""
"This will right itself in a little time if you are connected to the Internet."
msgstr "Izi zidzakonzeka zokha posachedwa ngati mwalumikizidwa pa intaneti."

msgid "If not please do a Send/receive action."
msgstr "Ngati sichoncho, chonde chitani Tumiza/Landira."

msgid ""
"There are pending changes in the Bible text that have not yet been sent to "
"the Cloud for some time."
msgstr "Pali zosintha zomwe zikudikira mu mawu a Baibulo zomwe sizinatumizidwe ku Cloud kwa kanthawi."

msgid "The Cloud already had some changes in this chapter."
msgstr "Cloud inali ndi zosintha zina kale mu mutu uwu."

msgid "You sent some changes for this chapter too."
msgstr "Inunso munatumiza zosintha zina za mutu uwu."

msgid "The Cloud merged the two."
msgstr "Cloud yaphatikiza zonse ziwirizo."

msgid "Most likely this is okay."
msgstr "Zikuoneka kuti zili bwino."

msgid "You may want to check the result of the merge, whether it is correct."
msgstr "Mungafune kuyang'ana zotsatira za kuphatikizako ngati zili zolondola."

msgid "You have now connected to Bibledit Cloud."
msgstr "Tsopano mwalumikizidwa ku Bibledit Cloud."

msgid ""
"While you were disconnected from Bibledit Cloud, you made some changes in "
"the Bible text on your device."
msgstr "Pamene simunalumikizidwe ku Bibledit Cloud, munapanga zosintha zina mu mawu a Baibulo pa chipangizo chanu."

msgid "These changes will not be saved to Bibledit Cloud."
msgstr "Zosintha zimenezi sizidzasungidwa ku Bibledit Cloud."

msgid "The unsaved text is below."
msgstr "Mawu osasungidwa ali pansipa."

msgid ""
"While sending Bible text to Bibledit Cloud, you did not have write access to "
"this chapter."
msgstr "Potumiza mawu a Baibulo ku Bibledit Cloud, munalibe chilolezo cholemba mu mutu uwu."

msgid "You may want to check whether this is correct."
msgstr "Mungafune kuyang'ana ngati izi zili zolondola."

msgid "Check whether Bible text was saved"
msgstr "Yang'anani ngati mawu a Baibulo asungidwa"

msgid "Bibledit saved the Bible text below."
msgstr "Bibledit yasunga mawu a Baibulo omwe ali pansipa."

msgid "But Bibledit is not entirely sure that all went well."
msgstr "Koma Bibledit siikutsimikiza kwenikweni kuti zonse zinayenda bwino."

msgid "You may want to check whether the Bible text was saved correctly."
msgstr "Mungafune kuyang'ana ngati mawu a Baibulo asungidwa molondola."

msgid "The text in bold was added."
msgstr "Mawu olembedwa mowoneka bwino awonjezedwa."

msgid "The text in strikethrough was removed."
msgstr "Mawu ofufutidwa ndi mzere achotsedwa."

