msgstr "Bibledit imazindikira mabuku kudzera mu chizindikiro cha id ndi mitu kudzera mu chizindikiro cha c."

msgid "It also recognizes plain text."
msgstr "Imazindikiranso mawu osavuta."

msgid "It does that one chapter at a time."
msgstr "Imachita izi mutu umodzi pa nthawi."

msgid ""
"It imports the text into the book and chapter indicated by the passage "
