msgstr "Imatenga mawuwo kupita m'buku ndi mutu womwe wasonyezedwa ndi chowongolera cha ndime pamwamba pa zenera."

msgid ""
"It considers numbers at the start of a line of text to be verse numbers."
msgstr "Imawona manambala kumayambiriro kwa mzere wa mawu kukhala manambala a mavesi."

msgid "It does not discover verse numbers somewhere else in the text."
msgstr "Siipeza manambala a mavesi kwina kulikonse m'mawu."

msgid "After importing some text, it is recommended to run the checks on it."
msgstr "Mukatenga mawu, tikulimbikitsa kuyang'ana mawuwo."

msgid "An imported chapter overwrites the chapter already in the Bible."
msgstr "Mutu womwe watengedwa umalemba pamwamba pa mutu womwe uli kale mu Baibulo."

msgid ""
"If you import for example Genesis chapter 1, it will overwrite Genesis 1 if "
