msgstr "Mwachitsanzo, ngati mutenga Genesis mutu 1, udzalemba pamwamba pa Genesis 1 ngati mutuwo unali kale mu Baibulo."

msgid "It will not overwrite anything else."
msgstr "Sudzalemba pamwamba pa china chilichonse."

msgid "If Genesis 1 was not yet there, it will be created."
msgstr "Ngati Genesis 1 inalibe, idzapangidwa."

msgid ""
"You can import one chapter, or several chapters, or one book, or several "
