msgstr "Mutha kutenga mutu umodzi, kapena mitu ingapo, kapena buku limodzi, kapena mabuku angapo, zonse nthawi imodzi."

msgid "The text to be imported should be in Unicode UTF-8 format."
msgstr "Mawu oti atengedwe ayenera kukhala mu mtundu wa Unicode UTF-8."

