msgstr "Zoikamo zimagwira ntchito pa kuyang'ana kosiyanasiyana kwa kapangidwe ka chiganizo."

msgid "Enter all possible capitals in the text of the Bible."
msgstr "Lowetsani zilembo zonse zazikulu zomwe zingakhalepo mu mawu a Baibulo."

msgid "Separate them by a space."
msgstr "Zipatuleni ndi mpata."

msgid "Enter all possible small letters in the text of the Bible."
msgstr "Lowetsani zilembo zonse zazing'ono zomwe zingakhalepo mu mawu a Baibulo."

msgid "Enter all possible punctuation marks at the end of a sentence."
msgstr "Lowetsani zizindikiro zonse zolembera zomwe zingakhalepo kumapeto kwa chiganizo."

msgid "Enter all possible punctuation marks within a sentence."
msgstr "Lowetsani zizindikiro zonse zolembera zomwe zingakhalepo mkati mwa chiganizo."

msgid ""
"Enter all possible characters that should be allowed within a sentence."
msgstr "Lowetsani zilembo zonse zomwe ziyenera kuloledwa mkati mwa chiganizo."

msgid ""
"The characters will be treated by the checks algorithm to be valid in any "
"context."
msgstr "Zilembozi zidzawonedwa ndi njira yoyang'anira kukhala zovomerezeka pamalo aliwonse."

msgid ""
"Enter the names, starting with a capital, that may occur after mid-sentence "
"punctuation."
msgstr "Lowetsani mayina, oyamba ndi chilembo chachikulu, omwe angabwere pambuyo pa zizindikiro za pakati pa chiganizo."

msgid ""
"Enter all possible markers that start a new line but do not necessarily "
"start a new sentence."
msgstr "Lowetsani zizindikiro zonse zomwe zimayamba mzere watsopano koma sizimayamba chiganizo chatsopano."

