msgid "This page lists the notifications of the changes in the Bible text."
msgstr "Tsambali likulemba zidziwitso za zosintha mu mawu a Baibulo."

msgid "Use the up and down arrow keys to navigate through the entries."
msgstr "Gwiritsani ntchito mafungulo a mivi ya pamwamba ndi pansi kuti muyende pa zolembedwa."

msgid "Press the delete key to remove the selected entry."
msgstr "Kanikizani fungulo la delete kuti muchotse cholembedwa chosankhidwa."

msgid "Or click the 🗑."
msgstr "Kapena dinani 🗑."

msgid "Or swipe it to the left."
msgstr "Kapena chisunthireni kumanzere."

msgid ""
"Use the left and right arrow keys to expand or collapse the selected entry."
msgstr "Gwiritsani ntchito mafungulo a mivi ya kumanzere ndi kumanja kuti mutsegule kapena kutseka cholembedwa chosankhidwa."

msgid "Or click the 📁."
msgstr "Kapena dinani 📁."

msgid "Or swipe it to the right."
msgstr "Kapena chisunthireni kumanja."

msgid "The expanded entry provides more information and options."
msgstr "Cholembedwa chotsegulidwa chimapereka zambiri ndi zosankha."

msgid ""
"It displays all the Consultation Notes that refer to the passage of the "
"Change Notification."
msgstr "Chimawonetsa Zolemba zonse za Upangiri zomwe zimalozera ku ndime ya Chidziwitso cha Kusintha."

msgid "If you are subscribed to a note, you can unsubscribe."
msgstr "Ngati mwalembetsa kulandira cholemba, mutha kusiya kuchilandira."

msgid "If a note is assigned to you, you can unassign it."
msgstr "Ngati cholemba chaperekedwa kwa inu, mutha kuchichotsa kwa inu."

msgid "When you have a Manager role, you can delete a note."
msgstr "Mukakhala ndi udindo wa Woyang'anira, mutha kuchotsa cholemba."

msgid ""
"You can create a new Consultation Note with a query about the change in the "
"text of the Bible."
msgstr "Mutha kupanga Cholemba chatsopano cha Upangiri chokhala ndi funso lokhudza kusintha kwa mawu a Baibulo."

msgid "This page with change notifications is for you."
msgstr "Tsambali la zidziwitso za zosintha ndi lanu."

msgid "Your colleagues have their own lists."
msgstr "Anzanu ogwira nawo ntchito ali ndi mndandanda wawo."

msgid "Every day it will detect changes in the Bibles."
msgstr "Tsiku lililonse lidzapeza zosintha mu Mabaibulo."

msgid ""
"It will then generate new change notifications based on those changes."
msgstr "Kenako lidzapanga zidziwitso zatsopano za zosintha potengera zosinthazo."

msgid "It will add these new change notifications to the list."
msgstr "Lidzawonjezera zidziwitso zatsopano za zosintha pa mndandanda."

msgid "The change notifications fall into several categories:"
msgstr "Zidziwitso za zosintha zagawidwa m'magulu angapo:"

msgid ""
"Those marked with a smiley face are notifications of changes made by you."
msgstr "Zolembedwa ndi nkhope yosangalala ndi zidziwitso za zosintha zopangidwa ndi inu."

msgid ""
"Those marked with the name of a user are notifications of changes made by "
"this user."
msgstr "Zolembedwa ndi dzina la wogwiritsa ntchito ndi zidziwitso za zosintha zopangidwa ndi wogwiritsa ntchitoyu."

msgid ""
"Those marked with a book symbol are notifications of changes in the Bible "
"text."
msgstr "Zolembedwa ndi chizindikiro cha buku ndi zidziwitso za zosintha mu mawu a Baibulo."

msgid ""
"They are the result of the combined edits of all users working on this Bible."
msgstr "Ndi zotsatira za zosintha zophatikizidwa za ogwiritsa ntchito onse omwe akugwira ntchito pa Baibulo ili."

msgid ""
"Each category can be enabled or disabled separately in your notifications."
msgstr "Gulu lililonse likhoza kuyatsidwa kapena kuzimitsidwa padera mu zidziwitso zanu."

msgid "Bible translation is a collaborative effort."
msgstr "Kumasulira Baibulo ndi ntchito ya mgwirizano."

msgid ""
"Changes you enter may be updated by others or merged with their changes."
msgstr "Zosintha zomwe mukulowetsa zingasinthidwe ndi ena kapena kuphatikizidwa ndi zosintha zawo."

msgid ""
"The different categories of change notifications enable you to find out "
"whether a change is now in the Bible text."
msgstr "Magulu osiyanasiyana a zidziwitso za zosintha amakuthandizani kudziwa ngati kusintha kuli kale mu mawu a Baibulo."

msgid "Bibledit tracks the changes in the text of the Bibles."
msgstr "Bibledit imatsata zosintha mu mawu a Mabaibulo."

msgid "It generates lists of them every day."
msgstr "Imapanga mndandanda wa izo tsiku lililonse."

msgid "Generate them now."
msgstr "Zipangeni tsopano."

msgid "Lists with changes can be downloaded."
msgstr "Mndandanda wa zosintha ukhoza kutsitsidwa."

msgid ""
"Bibledit emails lists with the changes to users who have enabled that "
"notification."
msgstr "Bibledit imatumiza ndi imelo mndandanda wa zosintha kwa ogwiritsa ntchito omwe ayatsa chidziwitso chimenecho."

msgid ""
"It generates change notifications online for users who have enabled that "
"notification."
msgstr "Imapanga zidziwitso za zosintha pa intaneti kwa ogwiritsa ntchito omwe ayatsa chidziwitso chimenecho."

msgid "Notifications."
msgstr "Zidziwitso."

msgid ""
"The users who have enabled change notification are listed below, with the "
"number of changes waiting for their review."
msgstr "Ogwiritsa ntchito omwe ayatsa zidziwitso za zosintha alembedwa pansipa, ndi chiwerengero cha zosintha zomwe zikudikira kuwunikiridwa ndi iwo."

msgid "Changes are recorded in the journal."
msgstr "Zosintha zimalembedwa mu chipika."

msgid ""
"When the Bible text gets pushed to an external git repository, the changes "
"will be visible there."
msgstr "Mawu a Baibulo akakankhidwira ku nkhokwe ya git yakunja, zosintha zidzawoneka kumeneko."

msgid "User"
msgstr "Wogwiritsa ntchito"

msgid "Number of changes"
msgstr "Chiwerengero cha zosintha"

