msgstr "Dinani 🗑 kuti muchotse malo ogwirira ntchito."

msgid "Click ✎ to edit the workspace."
msgstr "Dinani ✎ kuti musinthe malo ogwirira ntchito."

msgid "Click ⎘ to copy the workspace to a new one."
msgstr "Dinani ⎘ kuti mukopere malo ogwirira ntchito kupita ku atsopano."

msgid "Click ✉ to send the workspace to all users."
msgstr "Dinani ✉ kuti mutumize malo ogwirira ntchito kwa ogwiritsa ntchito onse."

