msgid "This page is for configuring the layout of a workspace."
msgstr "Tsambali ndi lokonzera kapangidwe ka malo ogwirira ntchito."

msgid ""
"A workspace enables you to display parts of Bibledit or websites side-by-"
"side."
msgstr "Malo ogwirira ntchito amakulolani kuwonetsa mbali za Bibledit kapena mawebusayiti moyandikana."

msgid "There are three rows:"
msgstr "Pali mizere itatu:"

msgid "A top row, a center row, and a bottom row."
msgstr "Mzere wapamwamba, mzere wapakati, ndi mzere wapansi."

msgid "Each row has five columns."
msgstr "Mzere uliwonse uli ndi mizati isanu."

msgid "Thus there are 15 possible positions."
msgstr "Choncho pali malo 15 omwe angakhalepo."

