msgid ""
"The first time to synchronize the Bible in Bibledit with the project in "
"Paratext, the system needs to have an authoritative copy of Bible data that "
"overwrites the other."
msgstr "Nthawi yoyamba kugwirizanitsa Baibulo mu Bibledit ndi pulojekiti mu Paratext, dongosolo limafunika kukhala ndi kopi yovomerezeka ya deta ya Baibulo yomwe imalemba pamwamba pa inayo."

msgid ""
"Either the Bible books in the Paratext project overwrite the Bible books in "
"Bibledit."
msgstr "Mwina mabuku a Baibulo mu pulojekiti ya Paratext alembe pamwamba pa mabuku a Baibulo mu Bibledit."

msgid ""
"Or the Bible books in Bibledit overwrite the Bible books in the Paratext "
"project"
msgstr "Kapena mabuku a Baibulo mu Bibledit alembe pamwamba pa mabuku a Baibulo mu pulojekiti ya Paratext"

msgid "This only occurs once during the setup phase."
msgstr "Izi zimachitika kamodzi kokha pa nthawi yokhazikitsa."

msgid ""
"While the Paratext bridge is active, Bibledit updates Paratext Scripture "
"text."
msgstr "Pamene mlatho wa Paratext uli wogwira ntchito, Bibledit imasintha mawu a Malemba a Paratext."

msgid "The updates occur in the Paratext files."
msgstr "Zosinthazo zimachitika m'mafayilo a Paratext."

msgid ""
"When Paratext is running, and displays a chapter, and the chapter would be "
"updated in the files, then Paratext does not notice the updated files, and "
"does not reload the updated Scripture text."
msgstr "Paratext ikamayenda, ndi kuwonetsa mutu, ndipo mutuwo ukasinthidwa m'mafayilo, Paratext siiona mafayilo osinthidwa ndipo siitsitsanso mawu a Malemba osinthidwa."

msgid ""
"Then when Paratext saves that chapter, it saves an older copy of the "
"Scripture text, and so undoes the updates made by Bibledit."
msgstr "Kenako Paratext ikasunga mutuwo, imasunga kopi yakale ya mawu a Malemba, motero imathetsa zosintha zopangidwa ndi Bibledit."

msgid ""
"Therefore it is important to take care that Bibledit does not update "
"Paratext Scripture text while Paratext is running."
msgstr "Choncho nkofunika kusamala kuti Bibledit isasinthe mawu a Malemba a Paratext pamene Paratext ikuyenda."

msgid ""
"The easiest way to achieve this is to not run Bibledit and Paratext "
"simultaneously."
msgstr "Njira yosavuta yochitira izi ndi kusayendetsa Bibledit ndi Paratext nthawi imodzi."

