msgid "Hyphenation"
msgstr "Kugawa mawu m'masilabo"

msgid "Hyphenation can be used when preparing a Bible for printing."
msgstr "Kugawa mawu m'masilabo kungagwiritsidwe ntchito pokonzekera Baibulo kuti lisindikizidwe."

msgid ""
"It allows for more efficient usage of paper, and for more regular appearance "
"of margins at the end of the lines without requiring spacing adjustments."
msgstr "Kumalola kugwiritsa ntchito bwino pepala, ndi maonekedwe okhazikika a mipata kumapeto kwa mizere popanda kufunikira kusintha mipata."

msgid ""
"The details of hyphenating properly are complex and dependent on the "
"language, and can interact with other orthographic and typesetting practices."
msgstr "Zambiri zakugawa bwino mawu m'masilabo ndi zovuta ndipo zimadalira chilankhulo, ndipo zingagwirizane ndi njira zina zolembera ndi kukonza mawu."

msgid ""
"Hyphenation may not be so important when preparing a Bible for proofreading. "
"It is usually regarded important for production quality Bibles."
msgstr "Kugawa mawu m'masilabo mwina si kofunika kwambiri pokonzekera Baibulo kuti liwerengedwe kuti lipezeke zolakwika. Nthawi zambiri kumaonedwa kuti ndi kofunika pa Mabaibulo apamwamba."

msgid ""
"When preparing a Bible in LibreOffice, OpenOffice, AbiWord, en so on, the "
"wordprocessor itself provides hyphenation algorithms for many languages."
msgstr "Pokonzekera Baibulo mu LibreOffice, OpenOffice, AbiWord, ndi zina zotero, pulogalamu yolembera yokha imapereka njira zogawira mawu m'masilabo za zilankhulo zambiri."

msgid ""
"If no suitable hyphenation algorithm can be used, perhaps Bibledit can "
"assist to a limited degree."
msgstr "Ngati palibe njira yoyenera yogawira mawu m'masilabo yomwe ingagwiritsidwe ntchito, mwina Bibledit ingathandize pang'ono."

msgid ""
"Bibledit can take the data from a Bible, insert soft hyphens in the words "
"according to a certain algorithm, and then save this data as a new Bible."
msgstr "Bibledit ikhoza kutenga deta ya Baibulo, kuika zizindikiro zofewa za kugawa mu mawu motsatira njira inayake, kenako n'kusunga deta imeneyi ngati Baibulo latsopano."

msgid ""
"This new Bible can then be exported to OpenDocument format, and opened in a "
"wordprocessor."
msgstr "Baibulo latsopano limeneli likhoza kutumizidwa kunja mu mtundu wa OpenDocument, ndi kutsegulidwa mu pulogalamu yolembera."

msgid ""
"The wordprocessor sees these soft hyphens. When a soft hyphen occurs near "
"the end of the line, it breaks the word there."
msgstr "Pulogalamu yolembera imawona zizindikiro zofewa izi. Chizindikiro chofewa chikakhala pafupi ndi kumapeto kwa mzere, chimagawa mawuwo pamenepo."

msgid ""
"Bibledit has one hyphenating algorithm. When there is a transition in the "
"text from any character of a first set of characters, to any character of a "
"second set of characters, then the soft hyphen will be inserted at that "
"location in the text."
msgstr "Bibledit ili ndi njira imodzi yogawira. Pakakhala kusintha m'mawu kuchokera ku chilembo chilichonse cha gulu loyamba la zilembo, kupita ku chilembo chilichonse cha gulu lachiwiri la zilembo, ndiye kuti chizindikiro chofewa chidzaikidwa pamalo amenewo m'mawu."

msgid "First set of characters"
msgstr "Gulu loyamba la zilembo"

msgid "Second set of characters"
msgstr "Gulu lachiwiri la zilembo"

msgid "Enter the sets of characters, and press Save."
msgstr "Lowetsani magulu a zilembo, ndi kukanikiza Sungani."

