"passage to fetch."
msgstr "Potenga gwero lofotokozedwa ndi wogwiritsa ntchito, Bibledit idzatenga adilesi ya intaneti, ndi kusintha mawu atatu omwe ali m'mabulaketi ndi zomwe zili za ndime yoti itengedwe."

