msgstr "Lumikizani"

msgid "Or else connect to the Bibledit Cloud demo."
msgstr "Kapena lumikizani ku chiwonetsero cha Bibledit Cloud."

msgid "To get access to Bibledit Cloud, install a server instance."
msgstr "Kuti mupeze Bibledit Cloud, ikani seva."

msgid ""
"Bibledit is not like some programs that can work faster if you log out and "
"log back in."
msgstr "Bibledit siili ngati mapulogalamu ena omwe angagwire ntchito mwachangu mukatuluka ndi kulowanso."

msgid ""
"If you log out, then any verses you drafted or changed will not be sent to "
"the Cloud."
msgstr "Mukatuluka, mavesi aliwonse omwe munalemba kapena kusintha sadzatumizidwa ku Cloud."

msgid ""
"Bibledit has been designed so that the user never has to log out under "
"normal circumstances."
msgstr "Bibledit idapangidwa kuti wogwiritsa ntchito asafunike kutuluka pa nthawi zabwinobwino."

msgid "I understand it and want to disconnect from the Cloud."
msgstr "Ndikumvetsa ndipo ndikufuna kutuluka mu Cloud."

msgid "This page deals with setting up the email system."
msgstr "Tsambali likufotokoza za kukhazikitsa dongosolo la imelo."

msgid ""
"Bibledit sends out email. It also collects email every five minutes and acts "
"upon these emails."
msgstr "Bibledit imatumiza imelo. Imasonkhanitsanso imelo mphindi zisanu zilizonse ndi kuchitapo kanthu pa maimelo amenewa."

msgid "It needs an external email account for sending and receiving email."
msgstr "Imafunika akaunti ya imelo yakunja yotumizira ndi kulandira imelo."

msgid "The help information on this page uses a sample Google mail account."
msgstr "Thandizo patsambali limagwiritsa ntchito akaunti ya Google mail ngati chitsanzo."

msgid "You will have your own email account dedicated to Bibledit."
msgstr "Mudzakhala ndi akaunti yanu ya imelo yoperekedwa ku Bibledit yokha."

msgid ""
"The sample email address is bibletranslation@gmail.com, and the password is "
"pazzwrd."
msgstr "Adilesi ya imelo ya chitsanzo ndi bibletranslation@gmail.com, ndipo mawu achinsinsi ndi pazzwrd."

msgid "Google now recommends two-factor authentication to be enabled."
msgstr "Google tsopano ikulangiza kuti kutsimikizira kwa magawo awiri kuyatsidwe."

msgid ""
"The password to log into the Google account will not work in Bibledit."
msgstr "Mawu achinsinsi olowera mu akaunti ya Google sangagwire ntchito mu Bibledit."

msgid ""
"Instead create an App Password on Google and use that as the password below."
msgstr "M'malo mwake pangani Mawu Achinsinsi a Pulogalamu pa Google ndi kuwagwiritsa ntchito ngati mawu achinsinsi pansipa."

msgid ""
"In case the setup fails to work, all diagnostics can be seen in the Journal."
msgstr "Ngati kukhazikitsa kulephera kugwira ntchito, zonse zodziwitsa zavuto zitha kuwonedwa mu Chipika."

