msgid ""
"This shows how many verses each chapter of the Bible has according to this "
"versification system, and how many chapters each book has."
msgstr "Izi zikuwonetsa kuti mutu uliwonse wa Baibulo uli ndi mavesi angati malinga ndi dongosolo la mavesi ili, ndi kuti buku lililonse lili ndi mitu ingati."

msgid "It can be edited further down the page."
msgstr "Zitha kusinthidwa pansi pa tsamba."

