msgstr "Siyani kwa kanthawi kuti iyambike."

msgid "Connect to Bibledit Cloud via menu Settings / Cloud."
msgstr "Lumikizani ku Bibledit Cloud kudzera mu menyu Zoikamo / Cloud."

msgid "Discussions"
msgstr "Zokambirana"

msgid ""
"It is important that the more difficult or important passages of the "
"translation are discussed by the Translation Team."
msgstr "Nkofunika kuti ndime zovuta kwambiri kapena zofunika kwambiri za kumasulira zikambidwe ndi Gulu Lomasulira."

msgid ""
"All the members of the Translation Team have the intention to produce a "
"reliable translation."
msgstr "Mamembala onse a Gulu Lomasulira ali ndi cholinga chopanga kumasulira kodalirika."

msgid ""
"But the views of the members about how to best put this reliable translation "
"into words may differ."
msgstr "Koma maganizo a mamembala okhudza momwe angafotokozere bwino kumasulira kodalirika kumeneku akhoza kusiyana."

msgid ""
"All members will listen to each other's arguments, bring their own "
"arguments, and come to a conclusion."
msgstr "Mamembala onse adzamvetsera mfundo za wina ndi mnzake, kubweretsa mfundo zawo, ndi kufika pa mapeto."

msgid ""
"The conclusion can be reached because everybody agrees, or it can be reached "
"by vote, or by consulting others, or a combination of this."
msgstr "Mapeto angafikiridwe chifukwa aliyense wagwirizana, kapena kupyolera mu kuvota, kapena kufunsa ena, kapena kuphatikiza izi."

msgid "Discussions shall be guided by the following rules:"
msgstr "Zokambirana zidzatsatira malamulo awa:"

msgid ""
"If a member of the Team wishes to raise an issue for discussion, that member "
"shall create a consultation note for the team."
msgstr "Ngati membala wa Gulu akufuna kupereka nkhani yokambirana, membalayo apange cholemba cha upangiri cha gulu."

msgid "The consultation note will be distributed to all members of the team."
msgstr "Cholemba cha upangiri chidzagawidwa kwa mamembala onse a gulu."

msgid ""
"To give members time to think about the issues, and thus make the discussion "
"more productive, the consultation note shall not be discussed immediately, "
"but after a day or more."
msgstr "Kuti mamembala apeze nthawi yoganizira nkhanizo, ndi kuti zokambirana zikhale zogwira mtima, cholemba cha upangiri chisakambidwe nthawi yomweyo, koma pakatha tsiku limodzi kapena kupitirira."

msgid "The consultation note clearly describes the issue or question."
msgstr "Cholemba cha upangiri chifotokoze bwino nkhaniyo kapena funsolo."

msgid ""
"If the member desires a change, the member shall include a clear suggestion "
"for change in the consultation note."
msgstr "Ngati membalayo akufuna kusintha, aphatikizepo mu cholemba cha upangiri pempho lomveka bwino la kusintha."

msgid "The members of the team shall choose a chair person."
msgstr "Mamembala a gulu asankhe wapampando."

msgid ""
"The chair person leads the discussions, keeps the discussions on topic, "
"ensures that procedures are followed, and keeps the time."
msgstr "Wapampando amatsogolera zokambirana, amasunga zokambirana pa nkhani, amaonetsetsa kuti ndondomeko zikutsatiridwa, ndi kusunga nthawi."

msgid "The members of the team are all busy and their time is valuable."
msgstr "Mamembala a gulu onse ali otanganidwa ndipo nthawi yawo ndi yamtengo wapatali."

msgid "Therefore discussions should be kept short and to the point."
msgstr "Choncho zokambirana zikhale zazifupi ndi zomveka."

msgid ""
"Personal reflections and deliberations about a passage shall not be done in "
"the team, while others are held in suspense."
msgstr "Maganizo aumwini ndi kuganizira ndime sizichitikira mu gulu, pamene ena akudikira."

msgid ""
"Everybody shall hold such deliberations in his own time without disturbing "
"others."
msgstr "Aliyense achite maganizo otere pa nthawi yake osasokoneza ena."

msgid ""
"If discussion of a consultation note is dragging on, let's say for more than "
"5 minutes, a vote shall be taken so as to arrive at a decision."
msgstr "Ngati zokambirana za cholemba cha upangiri zikutalika, tinene kupitirira mphindi 5, kuvota kuchitike kuti pakhale chisankho."

msgid ""
"If a member is not satisfied with the outcome of a discussion, that member "
"can forward the consultation note to other appropriate bodies who are able "
"to advise the translation team."
msgstr "Ngati membala sakhutira ndi zotsatira za zokambirana, membalayo angatumize cholemba cha upangiri ku mabungwe ena oyenera omwe angathe kulangiza gulu lomasulira."

msgid ""
"If the matter concerns the original language, then it will be forwarded to "
"the Bible Society."
msgstr "Ngati nkhaniyo ikukhudza chilankhulo choyambirira, idzatumizidwa ku Bungwe la Baibulo."

msgid ""
"If the matter concerns the local language, the matter should be forwarded to "
"the group of language scholars."
msgstr "Ngati nkhaniyo ikukhudza chilankhulo cha kwanuko, nkhaniyo itumizidwe ku gulu la akatswiri a zilankhulo."

msgid ""
"If the answer from the scholars does not satisfy any member of the team, the "
"matter can be forwarded to the panel consisting of local Church leaders and "
"scholars."
msgstr "Ngati yankho la akatswiri silikukhutiritsa membala aliyense wa gulu, nkhaniyo ingatumizidwe ku komiti yopangidwa ndi atsogoleri a Mpingo ndi akatswiri a kwanuko."

msgid ""
"If a consultation notes has gone through the advising bodies, and a "
"rendering is arrived at by the majority of the members of the translation "
"team, and this rendering does not satisfy a team member, that member can ask "
"the matter to be forwarded to three able Church leaders."
msgstr "Ngati cholemba cha upangiri chadutsa m'mabungwe olangiza, ndipo mamembala ambiri a gulu lomasulira afika pa kumasulira kwina, ndipo kumasulira kumeneku sikukhutiritsa membala wa gulu, membalayo angapemphe kuti nkhaniyo itumizidwe kwa atsogoleri atatu aluso a Mpingo."

msgid ""
"Those able Church leaders have knowledge of Hebrew and Greek, of good "
"commentaries and other reference materials."
msgstr "Atsogoleri aluso a Mpingo amenewo amadziwa Chihebri ndi Chigiriki, ndi mabuku abwino omasulira ndi zinthu zina zolozera."

msgid ""
"The questions sent to them should be worded such that it places a low demand "
"on their time."
msgstr "Mafunso otumizidwa kwa iwo alembedwe m'njira yoti asatenge nthawi yawo yambiri."

msgid ""
"The matter shall include the discussions of the translation team, the answer "
"given by the Bible Society, shall state the rendering chosen by the majority "
"of the team, and the alternate rendering."
msgstr "Nkhaniyo iphatikizepo zokambirana za gulu lomasulira, yankho loperekedwa ndi Bungwe la Baibulo, ndi kunena kumasulira kosankhidwa ndi ambiri a gulu, ndi kumasulira kwina."

msgid ""
"The able Church leaders shall be asked whether they choose the majority "
"rendering or the alternate."
msgstr "Atsogoleri aluso a Mpingo afunsidwe kuti asankha kumasulira kwa ambiri kapena kwa ina."

msgid ""
"They shall be informed that their choice defaults to the majority if no "
"response has been received by the translation team within a month."
msgstr "Adziwitsidwe kuti kusankha kwawo kumapita kwa ambiri ngati palibe yankho lolandiridwa ndi gulu lomasulira mkati mwa mwezi umodzi."

msgid ""
"A vote shall be taken from the answers given by the Bible Society and each "
"of the able Church leaders."
msgstr "Voti idzatengedwa kuchokera ku mayankho operekedwa ndi Bungwe la Baibulo ndi mtsogoleri aliyense waluso wa Mpingo."

msgid ""
"If the vote needs to be split, equal votes will be given to each of the "
"members of the translation team."
msgstr "Ngati voti ikufunika kugawidwa, mavoti ofanana adzaperekedwa kwa membala aliyense wa gulu lomasulira."

