msgid "About"
msgstr "Zokhudza"

msgid "The Free Bible"
msgstr "Baibulo Laulere"

msgid ""
"While Bibledit may be used for making any Bibles, there are some distinct "
"advantages to releasing Bibles under a free license."
msgstr "Ngakhale Bibledit ingagwiritsidwe ntchito popanga Mabaibulo aliwonse, pali ubwino wina wapadera wotulutsa Mabaibulo pansi pa chilolezo chaulere."

msgid ""
"Others will feel free to publish the open Bible. You don't need to do "
"everything yourself: Others will help spreading the Word of God."
msgstr "Ena adzamva ufulu wofalitsa Baibulo lotseguka. Simufunika kuchita zonse nokha: Ena adzathandiza kufalitsa Mawu a Mulungu."

msgid ""
"It becomes easy to publish Bibles in a variety of formats by a variety of "
"people: on paper, phones, the Internet."
msgstr "Zimakhala zosavuta kufalitsa Mabaibulo m'mitundu yosiyanasiyana ndi anthu osiyanasiyana: pa pepala, pa mafoni, pa intaneti."

msgid ""
"If you think that the Bible you translated is good and reliable, and you "
"release it under an open license, it will rapidly spread over the Internet."
msgstr "Ngati mukuganiza kuti Baibulo lomwe mwamasulira ndi labwino ndi lodalirika, ndipo mulitulutsa pansi pa chilolezo chotseguka, lidzafalikira mwachangu pa intaneti."

msgid ""
"Compare an open Bible to the Greek minuscules: They were copied freely, and "
"they can now be found all over the place."
msgstr "Fananitsani Baibulo lotseguka ndi zolemba zachigiriki zazing'ono: Zinakopedwa mwaufulu, ndipo tsopano zimapezeka paliponse."

msgid "Freely you received, freely give."
msgstr "Mwalandira kwaulere, patsani kwaulere."

msgid ""
"Various church people regularly express a desire to have a more accurate "
"Bible than what they have now."
msgstr "Anthu osiyanasiyana a mu mpingo nthawi zonse amanena kuti akufuna kukhala ndi Baibulo lolondola kuposa lomwe ali nalo tsopano."

msgid "The years pass by and the desire becomes stronger."
msgstr "Zaka zimapita ndipo chikhumbo chimakula."

msgid ""
"They pray about the matter, discuss it, and decide to start the work on "
"improving the Bible themselves, with the help of a booklet with directions."
msgstr "Amapemphera pa nkhaniyi, kukambirana, ndi kusankha kuyamba okha ntchito yokonza Baibulo, mothandizidwa ndi kabuku kokhala ndi malangizo."

msgid "The booklet is published by the Bible Society."
msgstr "Kabukuka kamafalitsidwa ndi Bungwe la Baibulo."

msgid ""
"Over the years some people join the group, and others leave the group."
msgstr "M'zaka zapitazi anthu ena amalowa m'gululi, ndipo ena amachoka."

msgid ""
"The church now has a translation team consisting of four people who by the "
"grace of God work full time on the revision of the Bible."
msgstr "Mpingo tsopano uli ndi gulu lomasulira lopangidwa ndi anthu anayi omwe mwachisomo cha Mulungu amagwira ntchito nthawi yonse yokonzanso Baibulo."

msgid "Each of the four people bring in their own expertise."
msgstr "Aliyense mwa anthu anayiwo amabweretsa luso lake."

msgid "Two of them focus on the target language."
msgstr "Awiri mwa iwo amayang'ana chilankhulo chofunidwa."

msgid ""
"They aim at using accurate, faithful, beautiful and contemporary language."
msgstr "Cholinga chawo ndi kugwiritsa ntchito chilankhulo cholondola, chokhulupirika, chokongola ndi chamakono."

msgid "One of them focuses on the original Greek and Hebrew."
msgstr "Mmodzi mwa iwo amayang'ana Chigiriki ndi Chihebri choyambirira."

msgid "He ensures that the translated text matches the originals."
msgstr "Iye amaonetsetsa kuti mawu omasuliridwa akugwirizana ndi oyambirira."

msgid "One of them focuses, more than the others, on the recipients."
msgstr "Mmodzi mwa iwo amayang'ana, kuposa ena, olandira."

msgid "She aims at acceptance of the language by the future readers."
msgstr "Cholinga chake ndi kuti owerenga a mtsogolo avomereze chilankhulocho."

msgid "Many proof-readers contribute to the work."
msgstr "Oŵerenga ambiri owongolera zolakwika amathandizira pa ntchitoyi."

msgid ""
"The translation team regularly consults with language scholars and church "
"representatives about the Bible translation."
msgstr "Gulu lomasulira limafunsana nthawi zonse ndi akatswiri a zilankhulo ndi oimira mipingo za kumasulira Baibulo."

msgid ""
"The Bible Society answers queries about how to translate difficult passages."
msgstr "Bungwe la Baibulo limayankha mafunso a momwe mungamasulire ndime zovuta."

msgid "After several years the New Testament becomes ready."
msgstr "Pakatha zaka zingapo Chipangano Chatsopano chimakonzeka."

msgid "The manuscript is submitted to the Bible Society for publishing."
msgstr "Zolembedwazo zimaperekedwa ku Bungwe la Baibulo kuti zifalitsidwe."

msgid "The manuscript is formatted and uploaded to the church website."
msgstr "Zolembedwazo zimakonzedwa mawonekedwe ndi kukwezedwa pa webusayiti ya mpingo."

msgid ""
"It can now be used by whoever wants to do so before it would be published in "
"paper form."
msgstr "Tsopano zingagwiritsidwe ntchito ndi aliyense wofuna kutero zisanafalitsidwe m'mapepala."

msgid "The translation team starts to translate the Old Testament."
msgstr "Gulu lomasulira limayamba kumasulira Chipangano Chakale."

msgid "The years pass by."
msgstr "Zaka zimapita."

msgid ""
"The team eagerly awaits news from the Bible Society about publishing the New "
"Testament."
msgstr "Gulu limadikira mwachidwi nkhani kuchokera ku Bungwe la Baibulo za kufalitsa Chipangano Chatsopano."

msgid ""
"Five years later the news arrives that the Bible Society starts the "
"preparations for publishing it."
msgstr "Zaka zisanu pambuyo pake nkhani imabwera yoti Bungwe la Baibulo likuyamba kukonzekera kufalitsa."

msgid ""
"Another year later the team sees the first copies of the New Testament in "
"book form."
msgstr "Chaka china pambuyo pake gulu limaona makope oyamba a Chipangano Chatsopano mu mawonekedwe a buku."

msgid ""
"During all those years the New Testament has been locked up in the offices "
"of the Bible Society."
msgstr "M'zaka zonsezo Chipangano Chatsopano chakhala chotsekeredwa mu maofesi a Bungwe la Baibulo."

msgid ""
"It was not free to go out to the people in book form, but was kept locked up."
msgstr "Sichinali chaulere kupita kwa anthu mu mawonekedwe a buku, koma chinasungidwa chotsekeredwa."

msgid "It was enslaved."
msgstr "Chinali chokhala muukapolo."

msgid "The team keeps working on the Old Testament during many years."
msgstr "Gulu limapitiriza kugwira ntchito pa Chipangano Chakale kwa zaka zambiri."

msgid "They are enabled to do so by the Lord God."
msgstr "Amatha kutero chifukwa cha Ambuye Mulungu."

msgid "The Old Testament becomes ready."
msgstr "Chipangano Chakale chimakonzeka."

msgid ""
"The manuscript of the whole Bible is submitted to the Bible Society for "
"publishing."
msgstr "Zolembedwa za Baibulo lonse zimaperekedwa ku Bungwe la Baibulo kuti zifalitsidwe."

msgid ""
"One member of the translation team suggests to upload the formatted "
"manuscript to the church website, just as was done with the New Testament."
msgstr "Membala mmodzi wa gulu lomasulira akuwonetsa kuti zolembedwa zokonzedwa zikwezedwe pa webusayiti ya mpingo, monga momwe zinachitikira ndi Chipangano Chatsopano."

msgid ""
"The team leader decides to not do this, but let the Bible Society be the "
"first to publish the Bible."
msgstr "Mtsogoleri wa gulu akuganiza zosachita izi, koma kulola Bungwe la Baibulo kukhala loyamba kufalitsa Baibulo."

msgid ""
"The translator feels disappointed, because the Bible, now complete and "
"accurate, is not free to go out to the people."
msgstr "Womasulirayo akumva chisoni, chifukwa Baibulo, tsopano lathunthu ndi lolondola, silili laulere kupita kwa anthu."

msgid "Not in paper form, not in digital form."
msgstr "Osati mu mapepala, osati mu digito."

msgid "It is enslaved, again."
msgstr "Lili muukapolo, kachiwiri."

msgid ""
"Over the years the translator heard stories from others who had similar "
"experiences."
msgstr "M'zaka zapitazi womasulirayo anamva nkhani za ena omwe anali ndi zochitika zofanana."

msgid "It occurs to him that the current way of doing things is not right."
msgstr "Zimamuwonekera kuti njira yamakono yochitira zinthu siili yolondola."

msgid ""
"It leads to a situation where the Bible is not free to go where it is needed "
"most:"
msgstr "Zimatsogolera ku mkhalidwe womwe Baibulo silili laulere kupita kumene likufunika kwambiri:"

msgid "To the people."
msgstr "Kwa anthu."

msgid ""
"The translator begins to see more clearly that Christians should have "
"freedom to publish Bibles or portions of it any time they wish to do so."
msgstr "Womasulirayo amayamba kuona bwino kuti Akhristu ayenera kukhala ndi ufulu wofalitsa Mabaibulo kapena zigawo zake nthawi iliyonse yomwe akufuna."

msgid "The translator becomes the leader of the translation team."
msgstr "Womasulirayo amakhala mtsogoleri wa gulu lomasulira."

msgid "The team leader is acquainted with open licenses."
msgstr "Mtsogoleri wa gulu amadziwa zilolezo zotseguka."

msgid ""
"He chooses the GNU Free Documentation License as an appropriate license for "
"the Bible."
msgstr "Iye amasankha GNU Free Documentation License ngati chilolezo choyenera cha Baibulo."

msgid ""
"He is of the view that it is appropriate for the Word of God to be created "
"under an open license to allow it to have free course."
msgstr "Iye akuona kuti nkoyenera kuti Mawu a Mulungu apangidwe pansi pa chilolezo chotseguka kuti akhale ndi njira yaulere."

msgid ""
"The GNU Free Documentation License allows noncommercial distribution of the "
"Bible by anyone who accepts the license."
msgstr "GNU Free Documentation License imalola kugawa Baibulo kopanda malonda ndi aliyense wovomereza chilolezocho."

msgid ""
"That is a good thing because this enables anyone to print the Bible and give "
"it to someone else."
msgstr "Ichi ndi chinthu chabwino chifukwa chimapangitsa aliyense kusindikiza Baibulo ndi kulipereka kwa wina."

msgid ""
"The GNU Free Documentation License allows commercial distribution of the "
"Bible by any publisher who accepts the license."
msgstr "GNU Free Documentation License imalola kugawa Baibulo kwa malonda ndi wofalitsa aliyense wovomereza chilolezocho."

msgid ""
"This is good, because it maximizes the distribution potential by allowing "
"sales of printed Bibles."
msgstr "Izi nzabwino, chifukwa zimawonjezera kuthekera kogawa polola kugulitsa Mabaibulo osindikizidwa."

msgid "It also harnesses the profit motive for distribution."
msgstr "Zimagwiritsanso ntchito chikhumbo cha phindu pogawa."

msgid "It limits overcharging with competitive pressure on prices."
msgstr "Zimachepetsa kuyika mitengo yokwera mwa kupanikizika kwa mpikisano pa mitengo."

msgid ""
"The GNU Free Documentation License allows to update the Bible, provided the "
"updated version is shared under the same license."
msgstr "GNU Free Documentation License imalola kusintha Baibulo, bola ngati mtundu wosinthidwa wagawidwa pansi pa chilolezo chomwecho."

msgid ""
"This is a good thing because it allows legitimate updates, revisions, "
"adaptations with no hassle to the translators and no delay for getting "
"permission."
msgstr "Ichi ndi chinthu chabwino chifukwa chimalola zosintha zovomerezeka, kukonzanso, kusintha popanda kuvutitsa omasulira ndi popanda kuchedwa kupeza chilolezo."

msgid ""
"A disadvantage is that changes can be made by people who might not be "
"qualified or called to make changes, with possibly heretical results."
msgstr "Choyipa nchakuti zosintha zingapangidwe ndi anthu omwe mwina alibe luso kapena sanayitanidwe kuti asinthe, mwina ndi zotsatira zosokoneza chiphunzitso."

msgid ""
"There is some fear that granting permission to make revisions would make it "
"easier for somebody to make heretical changes to the Bible."
msgstr "Pali mantha ena akuti kupereka chilolezo chokonzanso kungapangitse kuti kukhale kosavuta kwa wina kupanga zosintha zosokoneza chiphunzitso mu Baibulo."

msgid "But copyright law is not about preventing this."
msgstr "Koma lamulo la kukopera siliri loletsa izi."

msgid "If anyone wants to make those changes, he would still do it."
msgstr "Ngati wina akufuna kupanga zosinthazo, adzazipangabe."

msgid ""
"There is no need for this fear, because it is God who protects His own work."
msgstr "Palibe chifukwa cha mantha awa, chifukwa ndi Mulungu amene amateteza ntchito yake."

msgid "He makes clear what is a good translation, and what is not."
msgstr "Iye amawonetsa bwino kumasulira kwabwino ndi kosakhala kwabwino."

msgid ""
"If a Bible Society is so protective about a Bible, so as not to grant a "
"license to make revisions, then there is a bigger danger than that of heresy."
msgstr "Ngati Bungwe la Baibulo likutetezera Baibulo kwambiri kotero kuti silipereka chilolezo chokonzanso, ndiye kuti pali ngozi yaikulu kuposa ya kusokoneza chiphunzitso."

msgid ""
"The bigger danger is that the copyright holder holds on to the Bible, or "
"disappears, or dies, or fails to be a good steward of it."
msgstr "Ngozi yaikulu ndi yakuti mwini ufulu wa kukopera amagwiritsitsa Baibulo, kapena amatha, kapena amamwalira, kapena alephera kukhala woyang'anira wabwino wake."

msgid "Nobody would be allowed to improve or update the text."
msgstr "Palibe amene angaloledwe kukonza kapena kusintha mawuwo."

msgid "Trust God."
msgstr "Khulupirirani Mulungu."

msgid "He takes care of His Word."
msgstr "Iye amasamalira Mawu ake."

msgid "He deals with anyone who might abuse it."
msgstr "Iye amalimbana ndi aliyense amene angawagwiritse ntchito molakwika."

msgid "The Bible Society says:"
msgstr "Bungwe la Baibulo likuti:"

msgid ""
"We own copyright, not in any way to restrict distribution, but to preserve "
"the text."
msgstr "Tili ndi ufulu wa kukopera, osati kuchepetsa kugawa mwanjira iliyonse, koma kusunga mawuwo."

msgid "Protecting the text may at times restrict distribution."
msgstr "Kuteteza mawu nthawi zina kungachepetse kugawa."

msgid ""
"For example, the Bible must be distributed by us, or under our supervision."
msgstr "Mwachitsanzo, Baibulo liyenera kugawidwa ndi ife, kapena pansi pa kuyang'aniridwa kwathu."

msgid "We have made a big investment in the Bible."
msgstr "Tayika ndalama zambiri mu Baibulo."

msgid "Nobody may improve it without our authority."
msgstr "Palibe angakonze popanda ulamuliro wathu."

msgid ""
"If anybody gives us details as to where the Bible can be improved, they can "
"improve it, but only when we agree."
msgstr "Ngati wina atipatsa zambiri za kumene Baibulo lingakonzedwe, angakonze, koma pokhapokha tikavomereza."

msgid "This Bible is our property."
msgstr "Baibulo ili ndi katundu wathu."

msgid "We share it."
msgstr "Timagawana."

msgid "It is not entirely ours, so there is a shared property."
msgstr "Si lathu lonse, choncho pali katundu wogawana."

msgid "The Free Documentation License is good in an ideal world."
msgstr "Free Documentation License ndi yabwino m'dziko langwiro."

msgid ""
"But the world is evil, so we need a license where we can protect the "
"integrity of the text."
msgstr "Koma dziko ndi loipa, choncho tikufuna chilolezo chomwe tingateteze ubwino wa mawuwo."

msgid "The proponent of the free Bible says:"
msgstr "Wochirikiza Baibulo laulere akuti:"

msgid "A free license enables spreading the Word of God more quickly."
msgstr "Chilolezo chaulere chimathandiza kufalitsa Mawu a Mulungu mwachangu."

msgid "The Bible Society has made such a reliable and good Bible."
msgstr "Bungwe la Baibulo lapanga Baibulo lodalirika ndi labwino."

msgid "Is it not worthy of being spread as far and wide as possible?"
msgstr "Kodi siliyenera kufalitsidwa kutali ndi kwambiri momwe zingathekere?"

msgid ""
"A restrictive license confines the Word to one publisher, one channel."
msgstr "Chilolezo choletsa chimaletsa Mawu kwa wofalitsa mmodzi, njira imodzi."

msgid "A free license opens up the Word to being spread by more channels."
msgstr "Chilolezo chaulere chimatsegulira Mawu kuti afalitsidwe ndi njira zambiri."

msgid ""
"If the license is restrictive, it is not the bad people who are afraid of "
"illegally copying the Word of God, making changes, then publish it."
msgstr "Ngati chilolezo chili choletsa, si anthu oipa omwe amawopa kukopera Mawu a Mulungu mosaloledwa, kusintha, kenako kuwafalitsa."

msgid ""
"But it's the good people who would be worried to violate copyright law when "
"spreading the Word, thinking that God's blessing cannot be on something "
"illegal."
msgstr "Koma ndi anthu abwino omwe angade nkhawa kuphwanya lamulo la kukopera pofalitsa Mawu, poganiza kuti dalitso la Mulungu silingakhale pa chinthu chosaloledwa."

msgid ""
"The free license does not aid bad people much, but it assists good people in "
"many ways."
msgstr "Chilolezo chaulere sichithandiza anthu oipa kwambiri, koma chimathandiza anthu abwino m'njira zambiri."

msgid ""
"A restrictive license does not stop heretics in any way, but it stops good "
"people from spreading the Word."
msgstr "Chilolezo choletsa sichiletsa ampatuko mwanjira iliyonse, koma chimaletsa anthu abwino kufalitsa Mawu."

msgid "The restrictive Bible Society says:"
msgstr "Bungwe la Baibulo loletsa likuti:"

msgid "If you revise our Bible, we'll see you in court."
msgstr "Ngati mukonza Baibulo lathu, tidzakumana kukhoti."

msgid "The free and open Bible Society says:"
msgstr "Bungwe la Baibulo laulere ndi lotseguka likuti:"

msgid ""
"If you revise and spread our Bible, we thank God for opening another channel "
"for distribution."
msgstr "Ngati mukonza ndi kufalitsa Baibulo lathu, tikuthokoza Mulungu potsegula njira ina yogawira."

msgid "God wanted property rights to be there for the benefit of humans."
msgstr "Mulungu anafuna kuti ufulu wa katundu ukhalepo kuti anthu apindule."

msgid "But did he also want copyright on Bibles?"
msgstr "Koma kodi anafunanso ufulu wa kukopera pa Mabaibulo?"

msgid "Show from the Word where this is the case."
msgstr "Onetsani kuchokera mu Mawu kuti izi zili choncho kuti."

msgid "Install Bibledit Cloud on Linux"
msgstr "Ikani Bibledit Cloud pa Linux"

msgid "Bibledit Cloud can be installed in several ways."
msgstr "Bibledit Cloud ingaikidwe m'njira zingapo."

msgid "Installation from packages."
msgstr "Kuika kuchokera ku mapaketi."

msgid "Installation from source."
msgstr "Kuika kuchokera ku gwero."

msgid "Licenses"
msgstr "Zilolezo"

msgid "Typesetting in Adobe InDesign CS5.5"
msgstr "Kukonza zilembo mu Adobe InDesign CS5.5"

msgid ""
"See the online help about typesetting for more information and general "
"principles."
msgstr "Onani thandizo la pa intaneti lokhudza kukonza zilembo kuti mudziwe zambiri ndi mfundo zonse."

msgid "Chapter numbers in drop caps"
msgstr "Manambala a mitu mu zilembo zazikulu zotsika"

msgid ""
"Bibledit normally exports chapter numbers in bigger font in a text frame."
msgstr "Bibledit nthawi zambiri imatumiza kunja manambala a mitu mu zilembo zazikulu m'bokosi la mawu."

msgid "In InDesign it is helpful to have these in drop caps."
msgstr "Mu InDesign nkothandiza kukhala nawo mu zilembo zazikulu zotsika."

msgid "Go to Bibledit, menu Export."
msgstr "Pitani ku Bibledit, menyu Tumizani kunja."

msgid "There is a setting for using frames in the drop caps. Switch it off."
msgstr "Pali zoikamo zogwiritsa ntchito mafelemu mu zilembo zazikulu zotsika. Zimitsani."

msgid "Do a fresh export."
msgstr "Chitani kutumiza kunja kwatsopano."

msgid "Creating a new document"
msgstr "Kupanga chikalata chatsopano"

msgid "Typesetting in InDesign starts with creating a new document."
msgstr "Kukonza zilembo mu InDesign kumayamba ndi kupanga chikalata chatsopano."

msgid "Choose menu File / New / Document, or press Ctrl-N."
msgstr "Sankhani menyu File / New / Document, kapena kanikizani Ctrl-N."

msgid "In the New Document dialog, make some settings."
msgstr "Mu bokosi la New Document, pangani zoikamo zina."

msgid "Facing Pages: on."
msgstr "Facing Pages: yatsegulidwa."

msgid "Page width: 138 mm."
msgstr "Kufalikira kwa tsamba: 138 mm."

msgid "Page height: 210 mm."
msgstr "Kutalika kwa tsamba: 210 mm."

msgid "Number of columns: 2."
msgstr "Chiwerengero cha mizati: 2."

msgid "Gutter: 4.2 mm."
msgstr "Mpata pakati pa mizati: 4.2 mm."

msgid "Top, Bottom and Outside margins: 10 mm."
msgstr "Mipata yapamwamba, yapansi ndi yakunja: 10 mm."

msgid "Untick the option to set all margins the same."
msgstr "Chotsani chizindikiro pa njira yoika mipata yonse yofanana."

msgid "Inside margin: 12 mm."
msgstr "Mpata wamkati: 12 mm."

msgid ""
"Click Save Preset, and save the settings as 'Ndebele'. Next time, use this "
"preset to quickly make another new document with the same settings as this "
"one."
msgstr "Dinani Save Preset, ndi kusunga zoikamo ngati 'Ndebele'. Nthawi ina, gwiritsani ntchito preset iyi kupanga mwachangu chikalata china chatsopano chokhala ndi zoikamo zomwezo."

msgid "Click OK to create the new document."
msgstr "Dinani OK kuti mupange chikalata chatsopanocho."

msgid "Setting up the baseline grid"
msgstr "Kukhazikitsa gululi la mzere woyambira"

msgid "All our text will stick to the baseline grid."
msgstr "Mawu athu onse adzamamatira ku gululi la mzere woyambira."

msgid "This is a key factor to good typography."
msgstr "Ichi ndi chinthu chofunika kwambiri pa kalembedwe kabwino."

msgid "My leading is 12 points, and I will set up a grid to reflect this."
msgstr "Kutalika kwa mizere yanga ndi mapointi 12, ndipo ndidzakhazikitsa gululi lowonetsa izi."

msgid "Go to menu Edit / Preferences / Grids."
msgstr "Pitani ku menyu Edit / Preferences / Grids."

msgid "Start the baseline grid at 0 mm relative to the top margin."
msgstr "Yambani gululi la mzere woyambira pa 0 mm molingana ndi mpata wapamwamba."

msgid "Increment it every 12 points."
msgstr "Onjezerani mapointi 12 aliwonse."

msgid "Press OK. The grid is now set up."
msgstr "Kanikizani OK. Gululi tsopano lakhazikitsidwa."

msgid ""
"Optionally, to make it visible, go to menu View / Grids and Guides / Show "
"Baseline Grid."
msgstr "Mwasankha, kuti liwonekere, pitani ku menyu View / Grids and Guides / Show Baseline Grid."

msgid "Placing text"
msgstr "Kuika mawu"

msgid "I am going to show how to place Bible text in InDesign."
msgstr "Ndikuwonetsani momwe mungaikire mawu a Baibulo mu InDesign."

msgid "The text is available from Bibledit as OpenDocument files."
msgstr "Mawuwa amapezeka kuchokera ku Bibledit ngati mafayilo a OpenDocument."

msgid ""
"Open the book of Genesis, the version with text and note citations, in "
"OpenOffice."
msgstr "Tsegulani buku la Genesis, mtundu wokhala ndi mawu ndi mawu olozera a zolemba, mu OpenOffice."

msgid "Save it as a Microsoft Word 97-2003 (.doc) document."
msgstr "Sungani ngati chikalata cha Microsoft Word 97-2003 (.doc)."

msgid "Create a new document in InDesign."
msgstr "Pangani chikalata chatsopano mu InDesign."

msgid "Go to menu File / Place, or press Ctrl-D."
msgstr "Pitani ku menyu File / Place, kapena kanikizani Ctrl-D."

msgid "Select the document in MS Word (.doc) format."
msgstr "Sankhani chikalata mu mtundu wa MS Word (.doc)."

msgid ""
"Move the cursor through the document in InDesign. Notice that the cursor "
"shows some of the text to be placed."
msgstr "Sunthani chikwangwani pa chikalata mu InDesign. Dziwani kuti chikwangwanicho chikuwonetsa mbali ya mawu oti aikidwe."

msgid ""
"Move the cursor to the corner of the first column where the text will start. "
"Click there. Notice that the first bit of the text will be placed in the "
"first column."
msgstr "Sunthani chikwangwani ku ngodya ya mzati woyamba pomwe mawu ayambira. Dinani pamenepo. Dziwani kuti mbali yoyamba ya mawu idzaikidwa mu mzati woyamba."

msgid ""
"There is much more text than what fits in just one column. This extra text "
"is not visible. What is visible, though, is a red plus near the end of the "
"first column. This shows that more text is available."
msgstr "Pali mawu ochuluka kuposa omwe angakwane mu mzati umodzi wokha. Mawu owonjezerawa sawoneka. Chomwe chikuwoneka ndi chizindikiro chofiira cha kuphatikiza pafupi ndi kumapeto kwa mzati woyamba. Izi zikuwonetsa kuti mawu ena alipo."

msgid "I would like to place this extra text in the second column."
msgstr "Ndikufuna kuyika mawu owonjezerawa mu mzati wachiwiri."

msgid ""
"Click the Selection Tool or press V. The cursor changes to a selection arrow."
msgstr "Dinani Selection Tool kapena kanikizani V. Chikwangwani chimasintha kukhala muvi wosankhira."

msgid ""
"Select the first column, and then click the red plus near the end of the "
"first column. Notice that the cursor will now show some text."
msgstr "Sankhani mzati woyamba, kenako dinani chizindikiro chofiira cha kuphatikiza pafupi ndi kumapeto kwa mzati woyamba. Dziwani kuti chikwangwani tsopano chidzawonetsa mawu ena."

msgid ""
"Place this text in the second column, in the same way as it was placed in "
"the first column."
msgstr "Ikani mawu awa mu mzati wachiwiri, mofanana ndi momwe anaikidwira mu mzati woyamba."

msgid ""
"There is still more text than fits in the second column. I estimate that "
"there is enough text to fill many pages."
msgstr "Pali mawu ochuluka kuposa omwe amakwanira mu mzati wachiwiri. Ndikuganiza kuti pali mawu okwanira kudzaza masamba ambiri."

msgid ""
"I am going to insert an extra page, so that we get more space to place the "
"text."
msgstr "Ndikuika tsamba lowonjezera, kuti tikhale ndi malo ambiri oikira mawu."

msgid ""
"To add blank pages, I need to have the Pages palette visible. If the Pages "
"palette is not visible, choose Window > Pages to open the palette."
msgstr "Kuti muwonjezere masamba opanda kanthu, ndiyenera kukhala ndi palette ya Pages yowonekera. Ngati palette ya Pages siiwoneka, sankhani Window > Pages kuti mutsegule palette."

msgid ""
"In the Pages palette, click Create new page. A new page will be added. This "
"is page 2. Press F12 to close the palette."
msgstr "Mu palette ya Pages, dinani Create new page. Tsamba latsopano liwonjezedwa. Ili ndi tsamba 2. Kanikizani F12 kutseka palette."

msgid ""
"Page 2 shows guides for two columns. I can fill these with text in the "
"manner as described above."
msgstr "Tsamba 2 likuwonetsa zolondolera za mizati iwiri. Ndingathe kuzidzaza ndi mawu monga tafotokozera pamwambapa."

msgid ""
"I can then add as many pages as are needed, and fill each page with text."
msgstr "Kenako ndingathe kuwonjezera masamba ambiri monga akufunikira, ndi kudzaza tsamba lililonse ndi mawu."

msgid "Span headlines across columns"
msgstr "Kutambasula mitu ya mawu pa mizati"

msgid ""
"The headline I have in this example is 'The first book of Moses called "
"Genesis'. I'd like it to span across the two columns."
msgstr "Mutu womwe ndili nawo mu chitsanzo ichi ndi 'Buku loyamba la Mose lotchedwa Genesis'. Ndikufuna kuti litambasuke pa mizati iwiri."

msgid ""
"Select the left column, and drag the top to make it shorter, so creating "
"space above it."
msgstr "Sankhani mzati wakumanzere, ndi kukoka pamwamba pake kuti ukhale waufupi, motero kupanga malo pamwamba pake."

msgid "Do the same with the right column."
msgstr "Chitani chimodzimodzi ndi mzati wakumanja."

msgid ""
"Select the text 'The first book of Moses called Genesis'. Cut it to the "
"clipboard."
msgstr "Sankhani mawu oti 'Buku loyamba la Mose lotchedwa Genesis'. Dulani kupita ku clipboard."

msgid "Click the Type tool or type Escape T."
msgstr "Dinani chida cha Type kapena lembani Escape T."

msgid ""
"Create a new text box above the two columns. Let it span across the two "
"columns. Estimate the size it needs to be."
msgstr "Pangani bokosi latsopano la mawu pamwamba pa mizati iwiriyo. Lilekeni litambasuke pa mizati yonse iwiri. Yerekezerani kukula komwe likufunika."

msgid "Paste the text into that text box."
msgstr "Ikani mawu mu bokosi la mawulo."

msgid ""
"Resize the text box so it looks smart. Then resize both columns so that all "
"looks good."
msgstr "Sinthani kukula kwa bokosi la mawu kuti liwoneke bwino. Kenako sinthani kukula kwa mizati yonse kuti zonse ziwoneke bwino."

msgid "Making text align to the grid"
msgstr "Kupangitsa mawu kugwirizana ndi gululi"

msgid "Text aligned to the grid is key to good typesetting."
msgstr "Mawu ogwirizana ndi gululi ndi chinsinsi cha kukonza zilembo bwino."

msgid "Select all text you would like to stick to the baseline grid."
msgstr "Sankhani mawu onse omwe mukufuna kuti amamatire ku gululi la mzere woyambira."

msgid "Go to menu Type / Paragraph, or press Alt-Ctrl-T."
msgstr "Pitani ku menyu Type / Paragraph, kapena kanikizani Alt-Ctrl-T."

msgid ""
"Press the Align to baseline grid button in the bottom right hand corner."
msgstr "Kanikizani batani la Align to baseline grid pa ngodya yapansi yakumanja."

msgid ""
"The leading of the text should be equal to the baseline grid. If the leading "
"of the text is bigger, then it is like as if you have double line spacing."
msgstr "Kutalika kwa mizere ya mawu kuyenera kufanana ndi gululi la mzere woyambira. Ngati kutalika kwa mizere ya mawu kuli kwakukulu, zili ngati kuti muli ndi mpata wa mizere iwiri."

msgid "Total page count"
msgstr "Chiwerengero chonse cha masamba"

msgid ""
"The publisher may set limits to the number of pages the typeset Bible may "
"contain."
msgstr "Wofalitsa angakhazikitse malire pa chiwerengero cha masamba omwe Baibulo lokonzedwa lingakhale nawo."

msgid ""
"In this example, we expect an entire Bible, with singable Psalms added as an "
"appendix, to contain no more than 2000 pages. Normal range is 1500 to 1800 "
"pages."
msgstr "Mu chitsanzo ichi, tikuyembekeza kuti Baibulo lathunthu, ndi Masalimo oimbidwa owonjezeredwa ngati chowonjezera, silidzakhala ndi masamba oposa 2000. Mulingo wabwinobwino ndi masamba 1500 mpaka 1800."

msgid "We suppose that the singable Psalms take up no more than 200 pages."
msgstr "Tikuganiza kuti Masalimo oimbidwa sakhala ndi masamba oposa 200."

msgid ""
"Usually the inclusion of the singable Psalms in a Bible will add about 10 "
"percent to the number of pages."
msgstr "Nthawi zambiri kuphatikiza Masalimo oimbidwa mu Baibulo kudzawonjezera pafupifupi peresenti 10 ya masamba."

msgid ""
"The Bible will have footnotes and crossreferences, all lumped together into "
"a single textframe at the bottom of each page."
msgstr "Baibulo lidzakhala ndi mawu a m'munsi ndi mawu olozera, onse ophatikizidwa mu bokosi limodzi la mawu pansi pa tsamba lililonse."

msgid "Let us now measure how many pages the notes are likely to take up."
msgstr "Tiyeni tsopano tiyeze kuti zolemba zidzatenga masamba angati."

msgid ""
"Open the file with all notes in LibreOffice. It is 00_Bible_notes.odt. Save "
"it in the correct format for InDesign."
msgstr "Tsegulani fayilo yokhala ndi zolemba zonse mu LibreOffice. Ndi 00_Bible_notes.odt. Isungeni mu mtundu woyenera wa InDesign."

msgid ""
"Place the text as described above. But I am going to use Autoflow this time. "
"Autoflow will automatically create new text boxes and new page till all text "
"has been placed. This allows us quickly to see how many pages the notes will "
"take up."
msgstr "Ikani mawu monga tafotokozera pamwambapa. Koma nthawi ino ndigwiritsa ntchito Autoflow. Autoflow idzapanga yokha mabokosi atsopano a mawu ndi masamba atsopano mpaka mawu onse aikidwe. Izi zimatilola kuwona mwamsanga kuti zolemba zidzatenga masamba angati."

msgid "This is how to use Autoflow."
msgstr "Umu ndi momwe mungagwiritsire ntchito Autoflow."

msgid ""
"When you are about the click where you want the text to go, keep the Shift "
"key down."
msgstr "Pamene mukufuna kudina pomwe mawu apite, gwirani fungulo la Shift pansi."

msgid ""
"I can now roughly see the total number of pages that the notes will take up."
msgstr "Tsopano ndingathe kuwona pafupifupi chiwerengero chonse cha masamba omwe zolemba zidzatenga."

msgid "This is sufficient for an estimate."
msgstr "Izi zikukwanira kuyerekeza."

msgid ""
"Let us now find out how many pages the main text body is likely to take up."
msgstr "Tiyeni tsopano tidziwe kuti thupi lalikulu la mawu lidzatenga masamba angati."

msgid "The text is in the file called 00_Bible_text_and_note_citations.odt."
msgstr "Mawuwo ali mu fayilo yotchedwa 00_Bible_text_and_note_citations.odt."

msgid "Place this text and use Autoflow."
msgstr "Ikani mawu awa ndi kugwiritsa ntchito Autoflow."

msgid ""
"It appears that, on my system, all text cannot be placed at once. It will "
"cut off after some point."
msgstr "Zikuoneka kuti, pa dongosolo langa, mawu onse sangaikidwe nthawi imodzi. Adzadulidwa pambuyo pa mfundo inayake."

msgid "I will place 01_Genesis_text_and_note_citations.odt instead."
msgstr "Ndidzaika 01_Genesis_text_and_note_citations.odt m'malo mwake."

msgid ""
"I can now roughly see the total number of pages that the text of Genesis "
"will take up."
msgstr "Tsopano ndingathe kuwona pafupifupi chiwerengero chonse cha masamba omwe mawu a Genesis adzatenga."

msgid ""
"The size of the whole Bible is about 22 times more than the size of Genesis."
msgstr "Kukula kwa Baibulo lonse kuli pafupifupi nthawi 22 kuposa kukula kwa Genesis."

msgid ""
"The font is of particular influence on the page count. This is not dealt "
"with here."
msgstr "Mtundu wa zilembo uli ndi mphamvu yapadera pa chiwerengero cha masamba. Izi sizikukambidwa pano."

msgid "Editing a paragraph style"
msgstr "Kusintha kalembedwe ka ndime"

msgid ""
"After exporting USFM text to OpenDocument, and placing this text into "
"InDesign, the USFM styles appear in InDesign."
msgstr "Pambuyo potumiza mawu a USFM ku OpenDocument, ndi kuika mawu awa mu InDesign, makalembedwe a USFM amawonekera mu InDesign."

msgid ""
"For example, normal paragraphs usually have style 'p', and section heading "
"'s'."
msgstr "Mwachitsanzo, ndime zabwinobwino nthawi zambiri zimakhala ndi kalembedwe 'p', ndi mitu ya magawo 's'."

msgid ""
"If you like to update a paragraph style, you may update each section heading "
"individually, but this is a lot of work. It is faster to update the style "
"for 's', so that this updates all paragraphs that have this style."
msgstr "Ngati mukufuna kusintha kalembedwe ka ndime, mungasinthe mutu uliwonse wa gawo payekha, koma ichi ndi ntchito yaikulu. Kumakhala kofulumira kusintha kalembedwe ka 's', kuti izi zisinthe ndime zonse zokhala ndi kalembedwe kameneka."

msgid ""
"To update a paragraph style, place the cursor in it, and on the palette "
"choose Paragraph Styles. Right-click the style you want and choose Edit."
msgstr "Kuti musinthe kalembedwe ka ndime, ikani chikwangwani mmenemo, ndipo pa palette sankhani Paragraph Styles. Dinani kumanja pa kalembedwe komwe mukufuna ndi kusankha Edit."

msgid ""
"Section headings look better after ticking ‘Balance ragged lines’ in the "
"paragraph options."
msgstr "Mitu ya magawo imawoneka bwino mutayika chizindikiro pa ‘Balance ragged lines’ mu zosankha za ndime."

msgid "Running headers"
msgstr "Mitu yoyenda"

msgid ""
"The Bible will have running headers. The headers contain the page number "
"near the inside margin. At the right margin it shows book and chapter "
"numbers on that page."
msgstr "Baibulo lidzakhala ndi mitu yoyenda. Mitu imakhala ndi nambala ya tsamba pafupi ndi mpata wamkati. Pa mpata wakumanja imawonetsa manambala a buku ndi mutu pa tsambalo."

msgid "Enter the page numbers on the master pages."
msgstr "Lowetsani manambala a masamba pa masamba a master."

msgid "On the Pages palette, double-click the master pages."
msgstr "Pa palette ya Pages, dinani kawiri masamba a master."

msgid ""
"On the left master page, create a text frame, and enter the page number at "
"the inside margin."
msgstr "Pa tsamba la master lakumanzere, pangani felemu la mawu, ndi kulowetsa nambala ya tsamba pa mpata wamkati."

msgid ""
"Page numbers can be found in menu Type / Insert Special Character / Marker / "
"Current Page Number."
msgstr "Manambala a masamba amapezeka mu menyu Type / Insert Special Character / Marker / Current Page Number."

msgid ""
"On the right master page, create a text frame, and enter the page number at "
"the inside margin too."
msgstr "Pa tsamba la master lakumanja, pangani felemu la mawu, ndi kulowetsa nambala ya tsamba pa mpata wamkati nayonso."

msgid ""
"On page 1, create a new text frame at the top, and put the book and chapter "
"at the outside margin."
msgstr "Pa tsamba 1, pangani felemu latsopano la mawu pamwamba, ndi kuika buku ndi mutu pa mpata wakunja."

msgid "This text frame can be copied to each odd page as it is generated."
msgstr "Felemu la mawu limeneli lingakopedwe ku tsamba lililonse la kumanzere pamene likupangidwa."

msgid "The same applies for page 2, and any subsequent even pages."
msgstr "Zomwezo zimagwira ntchito pa tsamba 2, ndi masamba aliwonse a kumanja otsatira."

msgid "The page where a book starts normally does not display a page number."
msgstr "Tsamba pomwe buku limayambira nthawi zambiri siliwonetsa nambala ya tsamba."

msgid ""
"In order to do that, apply master page [None] to that particular page."
msgstr "Kuti muchite zimenezo, gwiritsani ntchito tsamba la master [None] pa tsamba limenelo."

msgid "Space between drop caps and text"
msgstr "Mpata pakati pa zilembo zazikulu zotsika ndi mawu"

msgid ""
"It may be visually pleasant to have some space between the drop caps chapter "
"numbers and the text beside it."
msgstr "Zingakhale zosangalatsa kuona kukhala ndi mpata pakati pa manambala a mitu mu zilembo zazikulu zotsika ndi mawu omwe ali pafupi nawo."

msgid ""
"All that is needed is a fixed space after the chapter numbers. Pick any one "
"from a hair space to an em space. The number of characters in drop caps is "
"now increased by one. Set this value in the drop cap settings. All lines "
"after the first will automatically line up."
msgstr "Zonse zomwe zikufunika ndi mpata wokhazikika pambuyo pa manambala a mitu. Sankhani umodzi kuyambira hair space mpaka em space. Chiwerengero cha zilembo mu zilembo zazikulu zotsika tsopano chawonjezeka ndi chimodzi. Ikani mtengo uwu mu zoikamo za zilembo zazikulu zotsika. Mizere yonse pambuyo pa woyamba idzadzigwirizanitsa yokha."

msgid "Managing widows or orphans"
msgstr "Kusamalira mawu oyima okha kapena mizere yosiyidwa"

msgid ""
"Widows and orphans are words or short lines at the beginning or end of a "
"paragraph, which are left dangling at the top or bottom of a column, "
"separated from the rest of the paragraph."
msgstr "Mawu kapena mizere yaifupi kumayambiriro kapena kumapeto kwa ndime, yomwe imasiyidwa pamwamba kapena pansi pa mzati, yolekanitsidwa ndi ndime yonse."

msgid ""
"There is some disagreement about the definitions of widow and orphan; what "
"one calls a widow the other calls an orphan."
msgstr "Pali kusagwirizana pa matanthauzo a widow ndi orphan; chomwe wina amachitcha widow wina amachitcha orphan."

msgid "There are some ways to avoid widows or orphans."
msgstr "Pali njira zina zopewera mawu oyima okha kapena mizere yosiyidwa."

msgid ""
"- Adjusting the spacing between words to produce tighter or looser "
"paragraphs."
msgstr "- Kusintha mpata pakati pa mawu kuti pakhale ndime zolimba kapena zomasuka."

msgid ""
"- Adjusting the tracking of the text. This is the overall spacing of the "
"letters in a paragraph or on a line. With a good font in justified "
"paragraphs this can usually be adjusted by up to -25 or +15 without it "
"looking too out of place."
msgstr "- Kusintha tracking ya mawu. Uwu ndi mpata wonse wa zilembo mu ndime kapena pa mzere. Ndi mtundu wabwino wa zilembo mu ndime zolinganizidwa izi nthawi zambiri zimatha kusinthidwa mpaka -25 kapena +15 popanda kuwoneka zosayenera."

msgid "- Adjusting the hyphenation of words within the paragraph."
msgstr "- Kusintha kugawa kwa mawu m'masilabo mkati mwa ndime."

msgid "- Forcing a word down onto the next line using a soft return."
msgstr "- Kukakamiza mawu kupita ku mzere wotsatira pogwiritsa ntchito soft return."

msgid "Scripting"
msgstr "Kulemba script"

msgid "Here is a sample script."
msgstr "Nayi script ya chitsanzo."

msgid "It runs in InDesign."
msgstr "Imayenda mu InDesign."

msgid "It shows how to replace text, and how to update the formatting."
msgstr "Imawonetsa momwe mungasinthire mawu, ndi momwe mungasinthire mawonekedwe."

msgid "Install Bibledit on Ubuntu"
msgstr "Ikani Bibledit pa Ubuntu"

msgid "Follow the steps below to install Bibledit."
msgstr "Tsatirani njira zomwe zili pansipa kuti muike Bibledit."

msgid "Open a terminal."
msgstr "Tsegulani terminal."

msgid "On older versions of Ubuntu, or to get updated Bibledit software:"
msgstr "Pa mitundu yakale ya Ubuntu, kapena kuti mupeze mapulogalamu osinthidwa a Bibledit:"

msgid "Add the Bibledit repository:"
msgstr "Onjezani nkhokwe ya Bibledit:"

msgid "As of Ubuntu 18.04, the above is no longer needed."
msgstr "Kuyambira Ubuntu 18.04, zomwe zili pamwambazi sizikufunikanso."

msgid "Read the repository:"
msgstr "Werengani nkhokwe:"

msgid "Install Bibledit:"
msgstr "Ikani Bibledit:"

msgid "Bibledit can be started from the menu."
msgstr "Bibledit ingayambitsidwe kuchokera ku menyu."

msgid "More information:"
msgstr "Zambiri:"

msgid "The Notes are an important part of Consultations."
msgstr "Zolemba ndi gawo lofunika la Upangiri."

msgid ""
"The notes help to record the discussions with consultants and other people."
msgstr "Zolemba zimathandiza kulemba zokambirana ndi alangizi ndi anthu ena."

msgid ""
"Normally, when going to the Consultation Notes, you will see a list of notes."
msgstr "Nthawi zambiri, mukapita ku Zolemba za Upangiri, mudzawona mndandanda wa zolemba."

msgid "It would say, for example: Displaying notes 1 - 5 / 5."
msgstr "Udzanena, mwachitsanzo: Kuwonetsa zolemba 1 - 5 / 5."

msgid "This means that it would display notes 1 to 5, out of 5 notes total."
msgstr "Izi zikutanthauza kuti udzawonetsa zolemba 1 mpaka 5, mwa zolemba zonse 5."

msgid "You can edit the display."
msgstr "Mutha kusintha momwe zikuwonetsedwera."

msgid ""
"That means that you can edit the number of notes that will display in that "
"list."
msgstr "Zikutanthauza kuti mutha kusintha chiwerengero cha zolemba zomwe zidzawonetsedwe mu mndandandawo."

msgid "Clicking [edit] takes you to a new page, called Edit Notes Display."
msgstr "Kudina [sinthani] kumakutengerani ku tsamba latsopano, lotchedwa Sinthani Kuwonetsa Zolemba."

msgid ""
"This enables you to edit how the notes will be displayed, and how many."
msgstr "Izi zimakulolani kusintha momwe zolemba zidzawonetsedwera, ndi zingati."

msgid "The first thing that you can edit is how many notes will be selected."
msgstr "Chinthu choyamba chomwe mungasinthe ndi zolemba zingati zidzasankhidwa."

msgid ""
"If you select notes that refer to any passage, then notes will be selected "
"that refer to any passage, from Genesis to Revelation."
msgstr "Ngati musankha zolemba zomwe zimalozera ku ndime iliyonse, ndiye kuti zolemba zomwe zimalozera ku ndime iliyonse zidzasankhidwa, kuyambira Genesis mpaka Chivumbulutso."

msgid ""
"But when you select notes that refer to the current verse, then only those "
"notes will be selected that refer to the currently opened verse."
msgstr "Koma mukasankha zolemba zomwe zimalozera ku vesi lamakono, ndiye kuti zolemba zokha zolozera ku vesi lomwe latsegulidwa pakali pano zidzasankhidwa."

msgid ""
"In case you have Genesis 2.2 open in the navigator, then only notes that "
"refer to that particular verse are displayed."
msgstr "Ngati mwatsegula Genesis 2.2 mu chowongolera, ndiye kuti zolemba zokha zolozera ku vesi limenelo zidzawonetsedwa."

msgid ""
"If you select notes that have been edited at any time, then all notes would "
"be selected."
msgstr "Ngati musankha zolemba zomwe zasinthidwa nthawi iliyonse, ndiye kuti zolemba zonse zidzasankhidwa."

msgid ""
"But when you select notes that have been edited on Today, then only today's "
"notes are displayed."
msgstr "Koma mukasankha zolemba zomwe zasinthidwa Lero, ndiye kuti zolemba za lero zokha zidzawonetsedwa."

msgid ""
"The note selection mechanism combines all selection methods that have been "
"set."
msgstr "Njira yosankhira zolemba imaphatikiza njira zonse zosankhira zomwe zakhazikitsidwa."

msgid ""
"If you select notes that refer to the current verse, for example, and that "
"have been edited today, and only those notes that both refer to the current "
"verse, and that also have been edited today, are displayed."
msgstr "Ngati musankha zolemba zomwe zimalozera ku vesi lamakono, mwachitsanzo, ndi zomwe zasinthidwa lero, ndiye kuti zolemba zokha zomwe zimalozera ku vesi lamakono ndipo zasinthidwanso lero ndizo zidzawonetsedwa."

msgid "There are other notes selection mechanisms as well."
msgstr "Pali njira zina zosankhira zolemba."

msgid "See the relevant page for all selection mechanisms."
msgstr "Onani tsamba loyenera kuti muwone njira zonse zosankhira."

msgid ""
"Things should be plain and there should be no need for any further "
"information."
msgstr "Zinthu ziyenera kukhala zomveka ndipo sipayenera kufunika zambiri zina."

msgid ""
"One thing that would need explanation would be the mechanism that selects "
"notes that contain certain text."
msgstr "Chinthu chimodzi chomwe chingafunike kufotokozedwa ndi njira yosankhira zolemba zomwe zili ndi mawu enaake."

msgid "This is intended to be used to search notes for text."
msgstr "Izi zakonzedwa kuti zifufuze mawu mu zolemba."

msgid ""
"If you select notes that contain Any text, then searching for text in the "
"note is not done."
msgstr "Ngati musankha zolemba zomwe zili ndi Mawu aliwonse, ndiye kuti kufufuza mawu mu cholemba sikuchitika."

msgid ""
"Searching for text can be done by selecting notes that contain specific "
"words or text."
msgstr "Kufufuza mawu kungachitike posankha zolemba zomwe zili ndi mawu kapena mawu enieni."

msgid ""
"When you select this option, you will see that an entry becomes visible."
msgstr "Mukasankha njira iyi, mudzawona kuti bokosi lolowetsa likuwonekera."

msgid "Search text should be entered there."
msgstr "Mawu ofufuzira ayenera kulowetsedwa pamenepo."

msgid "Then the Save button should be pressed."
msgstr "Kenako batani la Sungani liyenera kukanikizidwa."

msgid "This is to save that search text."
msgstr "Izi ndi zosungira mawu ofufuziraŵo."

msgid ""
" Or just pressing Enter while the cursor is in that entry will do also."
msgstr " Kapena kungokanikiza Enter pamene chikwangwani chili m'bokosi limenelo kudzagwiranso ntchito."

msgid ""
"When you search for, for example, 'house', then notes that contain the word "
"'house' will be selected."
msgstr "Mukafufuza, mwachitsanzo, 'nyumba', ndiye kuti zolemba zomwe zili ndi mawu oti 'nyumba' zidzasankhidwa."

msgid ""
"Notes that contain the word 'houses' (in plural) would not be selected."
msgstr "Zolemba zomwe zili ndi mawu oti 'nyumba' (zambiri) sizidzasankhidwa."

msgid "To select this plural form, you can use wildcards."
msgstr "Kuti musankhe mawonekedwe a zambiri awa, mutha kugwiritsa ntchito zilembo zolowa m'malo."

msgid "Instead of entering 'house, enter 'house*'."
msgstr "M'malo molowetsa 'nyumba', lowetsani 'nyumba*'."

msgid "Notice the asterisk."
msgstr "Onani nyenyezi."

msgid "This will select notes that contains the word 'house' or 'houses."
msgstr "Izi zidzasankha zolemba zomwe zili ndi mawu oti 'nyumba' kapena 'nyumba zambiri'."

msgid "You can also enter two or more words to search for."
msgstr "Mutha kulowetsanso mawu awiri kapena kuposerapo kuti mufufuze."

msgid ""
"The search routine will then do its best to select these notes that contain "
"some or all of these words."
msgstr "Njira yofufuzira idzayesetsa kusankha zolemba zomwe zili ndi mawu ena kapena onse awa."

msgid ""
"Notes that contain all words are given first, and notes that contains only "
"one or a few of the words will be given later."
msgstr "Zolemba zomwe zili ndi mawu onse zimaperekedwa poyamba, ndipo zolemba zomwe zili ndi mawu amodzi kapena ochepa zimaperekedwa pambuyo pake."

msgid ""
"If you select notes that refer to the current verse, and then also search "
"for some text, then only the notes that refer to the current verse would be "
"searched."
msgstr "Ngati musankha zolemba zomwe zimalozera ku vesi lamakono, ndi kufufuzanso mawu ena, ndiye kuti zolemba zokha zolozera ku vesi lamakono ndi zomwe zidzafufuzidwa."

msgid "It is important to be aware of this."
msgstr "Nkofunika kudziwa izi."

msgid ""
"At times one may search for words or phrases, and get zero results, yet he "
"is sure that there should be some results."
msgstr "Nthawi zina munthu angafufuze mawu kapena ziganizo, ndi kupeza zotsatira zopanda kanthu, komabe ali wotsimikiza kuti payenera kukhala zotsatira zina."

msgid ""
"This would happen because the user does not search the whole Bible, but only "
"the current verse."
msgstr "Izi zingachitike chifukwa wogwiritsa ntchito sakufufuza Baibulo lonse, koma vesi lamakono lokha."

msgid "The same applies to other selection mechanisms."
msgstr "Zomwezo zimagwira ntchito pa njira zina zosankhira."

msgid ""
"Therefore, when searching notes for text, you may want to set all other "
"selection mechanisms to Any."
msgstr "Choncho, pofufuza mawu mu zolemba, mungafune kukhazikitsa njira zina zonse zosankhira kukhala Zilizonse."

msgid "There is more that can be said about searching notes."
msgstr "Pali zambiri zomwe zingadzanenedwe zokhudza kufufuza zolemba."

msgid "The wildcard operator already has been mentioned."
msgstr "Chizindikiro cholowa m'malo chatchulidwa kale."

msgid "Here is a list of possible operators:"
msgstr "Nayi mndandanda wa zizindikiro zomwe zingakhalepo:"

msgid ""
"By default, when no operator specified, the word is optional, but the result "
"that contain it will be rated higher."
msgstr "Mwa kusakhazikika, pomwe palibe chizindikiro chotchulidwa, mawuwo ndi osankha, koma zotsatira zomwe zili nawo zidzayikidwa pamwamba."

msgid ""
"A leading plus sign indicates that this word must be present in every result "
"returned."
msgstr "Chizindikiro cha kuphatikiza kutsogolo chikuwonetsa kuti mawu awa ayenera kupezeka mu zotsatira zilizonse zobwezedwa."

msgid ""
"A leading minus sign indicates that this word must not be present in any "
"result returned."
msgstr "Chizindikiro cha kuchotsa kutsogolo chikuwonetsa kuti mawu awa sayenera kupezeka mu zotsatira zilizonse zobwezedwa."

msgid ""
"A leading tilde acts as a negation operator, causing the word's contribution "
"to the result relevance to be negative."
msgstr "Tilde yotsogolera imagwira ntchito ngati chizindikiro chokana, kupangitsa mphamvu ya mawuwo pa kufunika kwa zotsatira kukhala yoipa."

msgid "It's useful for marking noise words."
msgstr "Ndi yothandiza polemba mawu osafunikira."

msgid ""
"A result that contains such a word will be rated lower than others, but will "
"not be excluded altogether, as it would be with the minus operator."
msgstr "Zotsatira zomwe zili ndi mawu otere zidzayikidwa pansi kuposa zina, koma sizidzachotsedwa kwathunthu, monga momwe zingakhalire ndi chizindikiro cha kuchotsa."

msgid "An asterisk is the wildcard operator."
msgstr "Nyenyezi ndi chizindikiro cholowa m'malo."

msgid ""
"Unlike the other operators, it is appended to the word, or fragment, not "
"prepended."
msgstr "Mosiyana ndi zizindikiro zina, imawonjezedwa kumapeto kwa mawu, kapena chigawo, osati kutsogolo."

msgid ""
"This means that if there is a note with the word 'house', and you search for "
"'*ouse', this note will not be selected."
msgstr "Izi zikutanthauza kuti ngati pali cholemba chokhala ndi mawu oti 'nyumba', ndipo mufufuze '*umba', cholembachi sichidzasankhidwa."

msgid "Yes, this is unusual, but this is how the database search works."
msgstr "Inde, izi ndi zachilendo, koma ndi momwe kufufuza kwa nkhokwe ya deta kumagwirira ntchito."

msgid ""
"To minimize the pain of this, measures have been taken that if you type any "
"part of the word, the expected result will still be found."
msgstr "Kuti muchepetse vuto ili, njira zakonzedwa kuti ngati mulemba mbali iliyonse ya mawu, zotsatira zoyembekezeka zidzapezekabe."

msgid ""
"Double quotes at the beginning and end of a phrase, gives only the notes "
"that contain the complete phrase, as it was typed."
msgstr "Zizindikiro ziwiri za mawu kumayambiriro ndi kumapeto kwa mawu zimapereka zolemba zokha zomwe zili ndi mawu athunthu, monga adalembedwera."

msgid "Each note can be assigned to somebody."
msgstr "Cholemba chilichonse chingaperekedwe kwa munthu wina."

msgid ""
"The person to whom the note is assigned then knows that action should be "
"taken on this note."
msgstr "Munthu amene wapatsidwa cholembacho amadziwa kuti chiyenera kuchitidwapo kanthu."

msgid "Or the person can be automatically emailed if the note gets changed."
msgstr "Kapena munthuyo angatumizidwe imelo yokha ngati cholembacho chasinthidwa."

msgid "The Consultation Notes can partly be operated by email."
msgstr "Zolemba za Upangiri zitha kuyendetsedwa pang'ono ndi imelo."

msgid ""
"When you receive an email from Bibledit, and this email contains a "
"Consultation Note, then you can reply to this email."
msgstr "Mukalandira imelo kuchokera ku Bibledit, ndipo imelo iyi ili ndi Cholemba cha Upangiri, ndiye kuti mutha kuyankha imelo iyi."

msgid ""
"Your reply will be added as a comment to this particular Consultation Note."
msgstr "Yankho lanu lidzawonjezedwa ngati ndemanga pa Cholemba cha Upangiri ichi."

msgid ""
"The reply should come from the email address which you registered with "
"Bibledit when you created your  account."
msgstr "Yankholo liyenera kuchokera ku adilesi ya imelo yomwe munalembetsa ndi Bibledit pamene mumapanga akaunti yanu."

msgid "The reply should also have (CSID123456789) in the subject line."
msgstr "Yankholo liyeneranso kukhala ndi (CSID123456789) pa mzere wa nkhani."

msgid "The number 123456789 is a Consultation Note Identifier."
msgstr "Nambala 123456789 ndi Chizindikiritso cha Cholemba cha Upangiri."

msgid "It is different for every Note."
msgstr "Imasiyana pa Cholemba chilichonse."

msgid ""
"Just replying to a Consultation Note you received is usually all that is "
"needed."
msgstr "Kungoyankha Cholemba cha Upangiri chomwe mwalandira nthawi zambiri ndi zonse zomwe zikufunika."

msgid "Only replies that are typed before the quoted text are considered."
msgstr "Mayankho okha omwe alembedwa pamaso pa mawu otchulidwa ndi omwe amaganiziridwa."

msgid "This is called top-posting."
msgstr "Izi zimatchedwa top-posting."

msgid ""
"When the quoted text gets posted too, then it is necessary to remove that "
"from your email reply."
msgstr "Mawu otchulidwa akatumizidwanso, nkofunika kuwachotsa mu yankho lanu la imelo."

msgid "You can also submit a new Consultation Note by email."
msgstr "Mutha kutumizanso Cholemba chatsopano cha Upangiri ndi imelo."

msgid "This is how to do it:"
msgstr "Umu ndi momwe mungachitire:"

msgid "Create a new email to the site's email address."
msgstr "Pangani imelo yatsopano ku adilesi ya imelo ya tsambalo."

msgid ""
"The subject line contains 'New note', then the passage, and finally the "
"summary."
msgstr "Mzere wa nkhani uli ndi 'Cholemba chatsopano', kenako ndime, ndi pomaliza chidule."

msgid "The body of the email will be the first comment on that note."
msgstr "Thupi la imelo lidzakhala ndemanga yoyamba pa cholembacho."

msgid "Lean Bible translation management"
msgstr "Kuyang'anira kumasulira Baibulo mwa njira ya lean"

msgid "What is lean management?"
msgstr "Kuyang'anira mwa njira ya lean ndi chiyani?"

msgid ""
"Lean management is about the systematic pursuit of desired translation "
"competence and conditions by utilizing human capabilities in a coordinated "
"manner."
msgstr "Kuyang'anira mwa njira ya lean kumakhudza kufunafuna mwadongosolo luso ndi mikhalidwe yofunidwa ya kumasulira pogwiritsa ntchito luso la anthu mwa mgwirizano."

msgid "Two things are essential for this:"
msgstr "Zinthu ziwiri ndi zofunika pa izi:"

msgid "Developing desired conditions."
msgstr "Kupanga mikhalidwe yofunidwa."

msgid "Developing capable people who can develop the desired conditions."
msgstr "Kukulitsa anthu aluso omwe angapange mikhalidwe yofunidwa."

msgid "External reference"
msgstr "Cholozera chakunja"

