"code included in Bibledit."
msgstr "Khodi ndi deta zonse zophatikizidwa mu Bibledit zomwe sizikugwera m'magulu a zilolezo pamwambapa zapatsidwa chilolezo monga zatchulidwa m'zigawo zosiyanasiyana za khodi yoyambira yophatikizidwa mu Bibledit."

msgid "See the source code repository."
msgstr "Onani nkhokwe ya khodi yoyambira."

msgid "Install Bibledit Cloud from a package"
msgstr "Ikani Bibledit Cloud kuchokera ku paketi"

msgid "Follow the steps below to install Bibledit Cloud."
msgstr "Tsatirani njira zomwe zili pansipa kuti muike Bibledit Cloud."

msgid "Step"
msgstr "Gawo"

msgid ""
"Install fixed version of Bibledit as it comes with the operating system."
msgstr "Ikani mtundu wokhazikika wa Bibledit monga umabwera ndi dongosolo logwiritsira ntchito."

msgid "Install most recent version of Bibledit."
msgstr "Ikani mtundu waposachedwa wa Bibledit."

msgid "Install required software:"
msgstr "Ikani mapulogalamu ofunikira:"

msgid "Bibledit will be accessible through the IP address port 8080."
msgstr "Bibledit idzapezeka kudzera mu adilesi ya IP pa doko 8080."

msgid "Examples:"
msgstr "Zitsanzo:"

msgid ""
"Open the web address in a browser, follow the instructions on the screen to "
"configure Bibledit Cloud, and log in."
msgstr "Tsegulani adilesi ya intaneti mu msakatuli, tsatirani malangizo a pa chinsalu kuti mukonze Bibledit Cloud, ndi kulowa."

msgid "The following command shows the status of Bibledit Cloud:"
msgstr "Lamulo lotsatirali likuwonetsa udindo wa Bibledit Cloud:"

msgid "Install Bibledit on Windows"
msgstr "Ikani Bibledit pa Windows"

msgid "Bibledit runs on Windows 10 and 11."
msgstr "Bibledit imayenda pa Windows 10 ndi 11."

msgid "Install Bibledit."
msgstr "Ikani Bibledit."

msgid "Start it through the menu."
msgstr "Iyambitseni kudzera mu menyu."

msgid "Give it enough time to download all the data from Bibledit Cloud."
msgstr "Ipatseni nthawi yokwanira yotsitsa deta yonse kuchokera ku Bibledit Cloud."

msgid "Bibledit is now ready for online and offline use."
msgstr "Bibledit tsopano ndi yokonzeka kugwiritsa ntchito ndi intaneti komanso popanda."

msgid ""
"There's a version for better performance and battery life on Windows on Arm."
msgstr "Pali mtundu wogwira ntchito bwino ndi moyo wa batire pa Windows on Arm."

msgid "Bibledit runs a number of checks on the text of the Bibles."
msgstr "Bibledit imachita kuyang'ana kosiyanasiyana pa mawu a Mabaibulo."

msgid "It does that every night."
msgstr "Imachita izi usiku uliwonse."

msgid "Act on the results of the checks."
msgstr "Chitanipo kanthu pa zotsatira za kuyang'anaku."

msgid "Receive the results by email."
msgstr "Landirani zotsatira ndi imelo."

msgid "Notes."
msgstr "Zolemba."

msgid "You deal with checks on the Bibles you have write access to."
msgstr "Mumayang'anira kuyang'ana kwa Mabaibulo omwe muli ndi chilolezo cholemba."

msgid "Install Bibledit iOS"
msgstr "Ikani Bibledit iOS"

msgid "Install Bibledit via the App Store."
msgstr "Ikani Bibledit kudzera mu App Store."

msgid "This works on an iPad or an iPhone running iOS 12 or higher."
msgstr "Izi zimagwira ntchito pa iPad kapena iPhone yoyendetsa iOS 12 kapena kuposa."

msgid "Hint."
msgstr "Langizo."

msgid "Switch off backup of Bibledit to iCloud via iOS."
msgstr "Zimitsani kusunga kopi ya Bibledit ku iCloud kudzera mu iOS."

msgid "Bibledit Cloud already backs up Bibledit iOS."
msgstr "Bibledit Cloud imasunga kale kopi ya Bibledit iOS."

msgid "If there were two backup mechanisms, that might  clash."
msgstr "Ngati pangakhale njira ziwiri zosungira kopi, zingasemphana."

msgid "Read more."
msgstr "Werengani zambiri."

msgid "Bibledit can host many Bibles."
msgstr "Bibledit ikhoza kusunga Mabaibulo ambiri."

msgid "Many users can create an account."
msgstr "Ogwiritsa ntchito ambiri angapange akaunti."

msgid ""
"A translation team is formed by giving a group of users access to a Bible."
msgstr "Gulu lomasulira limapangidwa popatsa gulu la ogwiritsa ntchito chilolezo chofikira Baibulo."

msgid "A user may be granted read-only access to a Bible, or write access."
msgstr "Wogwiritsa ntchito angapatsidwe chilolezo chowerenga chokha cha Baibulo, kapena chilolezo cholemba."

msgid "The type of access also depends on the role of a user."
msgstr "Mtundu wa chilolezo umadaliranso udindo wa wogwiritsa ntchito."

msgid "Manage users."
msgstr "Yang'anirani ogwiritsa ntchito."

msgid "Bibles can be made viewable by all users."
msgstr "Mabaibulo angapangidwe kuti aziwoneka ndi ogwiritsa ntchito onse."

msgid "Manage Bibles."
msgstr "Yang'anirani Mabaibulo."

msgid "Typesetting in Scribus 1.4 or higher"
msgstr "Kukonza zilembo mu Scribus 1.4 kapena kuposa"

msgid ""
"See the Scribus online help for more information and general principles."
msgstr "Onani thandizo la pa intaneti la Scribus kuti mudziwe zambiri ndi mfundo zonse."

msgid "Typesetting in Scribus starts with creating a new document."
msgstr "Kukonza zilembo mu Scribus kumayamba ndi kupanga chikalata chatsopano."

msgid "Choose menu File / New."
msgstr "Sankhani menyu File / New."

msgid "Document Layout: Double Sided."
msgstr "Document Layout: Double Sided."

msgid "To make the grid visible, go to menu View / Show Baseline Grid."
msgstr "Kuti gululi liwonekere, pitani ku menyu View / Show Baseline Grid."

msgid "Pick a Bible book, the version with text and note citations."
msgstr "Sankhani buku la Baibulo, mtundu wokhala ndi mawu ndi mawu olozera a zolemba."

msgid "Create a text frame in Scribus."
msgstr "Pangani felemu la mawu mu Scribus."

msgid "Add the text of the OpenDocument to this frame."
msgstr "Onjezani mawu a OpenDocument mu felemu ili."

msgid "I would like to place this extra text on a second page."
msgstr "Ndikufuna kuika mawu owonjezerawa pa tsamba lachiwiri."

msgid "Create a new text frame on a new page."
msgstr "Pangani felemu latsopano la mawu pa tsamba latsopano."

msgid "Link the new text frame with the previous text frame."
msgstr "Lumikizani felemu latsopano la mawu ndi felemu la mawu lapitalo."

msgid ""
"There is still more text than fits on the second page. I estimate that there "
"is enough text to fill many pages."
msgstr "Pali mawu ochuluka kuposa omwe amakwanira pa tsamba lachiwiri. Ndikuganiza kuti pali mawu okwanira kudzaza masamba ambiri."

msgid "Place headlines"
msgstr "Ikani mitu ya mawu"

msgid "The headline I have in this example is:"
msgstr "Mutu womwe ndili nawo mu chitsanzo ichi ndi:"

msgid "'The first book of Moses called Genesis'."
msgstr "'Buku loyamba la Mose lotchedwa Genesis'."

msgid ""
"I'd like it to place it at the top of the page, and to span across any "
"columns."
msgstr "Ndikufuna kuliika pamwamba pa tsamba, ndi kutambasula pa mizati iliyonse."

msgid ""
"Select the relevant text frames, and drag the top to make it shorter, so "
"creating space above it."
msgstr "Sankhani mafelemu oyenera a mawu, ndi kukoka pamwamba kuti akhale afupi, motero kupanga malo pamwamba pake."

msgid "Create a new text frame at the top of the page."
msgstr "Pangani felemu latsopano la mawu pamwamba pa tsamba."

msgid "Estimate the size it needs to be."
msgstr "Yerekezerani kukula komwe likufunika."

msgid "Paste the text into that text frame."
msgstr "Ikani mawu mu felemu la mawulo."

msgid "Resize the text frame so it looks smart."
msgstr "Sinthani kukula kwa felemu la mawu kuti liwoneke bwino."

msgid ""
"Then resize the main text frame or frames so that everything looks good."
msgstr "Kenako sinthani kukula kwa felemu kapena mafelemu akulu a mawu kuti zonse ziwoneke bwino."

msgid "Make the setting to align it to the baseline grid."
msgstr "Pangani zoikamo zolizinjika ku gululi la mzere woyambira."

msgid "The leading of the text should be equal to the baseline grid."
msgstr "Kutalika kwa mizere ya mawu kuyenera kufanana ndi gululi la mzere woyambira."

msgid ""
"If the leading of the text is bigger, then it is like as if you have double "
"line spacing."
msgstr "Ngati kutalika kwa mizere ya mawu kuli kwakukulu, zili ngati kuti muli ndi mpata wa mizere iwiri."

msgid "In this example, we expect an entire Bible to have about 1600 pages."
msgstr "Mu chitsanzo ichi, tikuyembekeza kuti Baibulo lathunthu lidzakhala ndi masamba pafupifupi 1600."

msgid "Create a new document in Scribus."
msgstr "Pangani chikalata chatsopano mu Scribus."

msgid "Take the file with all notes in OpenDocument format."
msgstr "Tengani fayilo yokhala ndi zolemba zonse mu mtundu wa OpenDocument."

msgid "It is 00_Bible_notes.odt."
msgstr "Ndi 00_Bible_notes.odt."

msgid "Place the text as described above."
msgstr "Ikani mawu monga tafotokozera pamwambapa."

msgid ""
"Keep adding new text frames and linking them till all text has been placed."
msgstr "Pitirizani kuwonjezera mafelemu atsopano a mawu ndi kuwalumikiza mpaka mawu onse aikidwe."

msgid "This allows us to see how many pages the notes will take up."
msgstr "Izi zimatilola kuwona kuti zolemba zidzatenga masamba angati."

msgid "Place this text in the same way as above."
msgstr "Ikani mawu awa mofanana ndi pamwambapa."

msgid "The font is of particular influence on the page count."
msgstr "Mtundu wa zilembo uli ndi mphamvu yapadera pa chiwerengero cha masamba."

msgid "This is not dealt with here."
msgstr "Izi sizikukambidwa pano."

msgid ""
"After exporting USFM text to OpenDocument, and properly placing this text "
"into Scribus, the USFM styles appear in Scribus."
msgstr "Pambuyo potumiza mawu a USFM ku OpenDocument, ndi kuika bwino mawu awa mu Scribus, makalembedwe a USFM amawonekera mu Scribus."

msgid ""
"If you like to update a paragraph style, you may update each section heading "
"individually, but this is a lot of work."
msgstr "Ngati mukufuna kusintha kalembedwe ka ndime, mungasinthe mutu uliwonse wa gawo payekha, koma ichi ndi ntchito yaikulu."

msgid ""
"It is faster to update the style for 's', so that this updates all "
"paragraphs that have this style."
msgstr "Kumakhala kofulumira kusintha kalembedwe ka 's', kuti izi zisinthe ndime zonse zokhala ndi kalembedwe kameneka."

msgid ""
"To update a paragraph style, place the cursor in it, and use the menu to "
"view or edit the style."
msgstr "Kuti musinthe kalembedwe ka ndime, ikani chikwangwani mmenemo, ndi kugwiritsa ntchito menyu kuti muwone kapena kusintha kalembedweko."

msgid "The Bible will have running headers."
msgstr "Baibulo lidzakhala ndi mitu yoyenda."

msgid "The headers contain the page number near the inside margin."
msgstr "Mitu imakhala ndi nambala ya tsamba pafupi ndi mpata wamkati."

msgid "At the right margin it shows book and chapter numbers on that page."
msgstr "Pa mpata wakumanja imawonetsa manambala a buku ndi mutu pa tsambalo."

msgid "To do that, apply no master page to that particular page."
msgstr "Kuti muchite zimenezo, musagwiritse ntchito tsamba la master pa tsamba limenelo."

msgid "All that is needed is a fixed space after the chapter numbers."
msgstr "Zonse zomwe zikufunika ndi mpata wokhazikika pambuyo pa manambala a mitu."

msgid "Pick any one from a hair space to an em space."
msgstr "Sankhani umodzi kuyambira hair space mpaka em space."

msgid "The number of characters in drop caps is now increased by one."
msgstr "Chiwerengero cha zilembo mu zilembo zazikulu zotsika tsopano chawonjezeka ndi chimodzi."

msgid "Set this value in the drop cap settings."
msgstr "Ikani mtengo uwu mu zoikamo za zilembo zazikulu zotsika."

msgid "All lines after the first will automatically line up."
msgstr "Mizere yonse pambuyo pa woyamba idzadzigwirizanitsa yokha."

msgid ""
"Adjusting the spacing between words to produce tighter or looser paragraphs."
msgstr "Kusintha mpata pakati pa mawu kuti pakhale ndime zolimba kapena zomasuka."

msgid ""
"Adjusting the tracking of the text. This is the overall spacing of the "
"letters in a paragraph or on a line. With a good font in justified "
"paragraphs this can usually be adjusted by up to -25 or +15 without it "
"looking too out of place."
msgstr "Kusintha tracking ya mawu. Uwu ndi mpata wonse wa zilembo mu ndime kapena pa mzere. Ndi mtundu wabwino wa zilembo mu ndime zolinganizidwa izi nthawi zambiri zimatha kusinthidwa mpaka -25 kapena +15 popanda kuwoneka zosayenera."

msgid "Adjusting the hyphenation of words within the paragraph."
msgstr "Kusintha kugawa kwa mawu m'masilabo mkati mwa ndime."

msgid "Forcing a word down onto the next line using a soft return."
msgstr "Kukakamiza mawu kupita ku mzere wotsatira pogwiritsa ntchito soft return."

msgid "Tips and Tricks"
msgstr "Malangizo ndi Nzeru"

msgid "Extensions and plugins"
msgstr "Zowonjezera ndi ma plugin"

msgid "Browser extensions and plugins may interfere with Bibledit."
msgstr "Zowonjezera za msakatuli ndi ma plugin zingasokoneze Bibledit."

msgid "There was a case that the USFM editor didn't load the text."
msgstr "Panali nthawi yomwe chosintha cha USFM sichinatsitse mawu."

msgid "Disabling an extension in Chrome resolved it."
msgstr "Kuzimitsa chowonjezera mu Chrome kunathetsa vutoli."

msgid "Enable consultants to view the Bible in a workspace"
msgstr "Lolani alangizi kuwona Baibulo m'malo ogwirira ntchito"

msgid ""
"Just add the desired Bible to the Resources through the link organizer."
msgstr "Ingowonjezerani Baibulo lofunidwa ku Magwero kudzera mwa wokonza maulalo."

msgid "Then add the Resources to the workspace through URL resource/index."
msgstr "Kenako onjezani Magwero ku malo ogwirira ntchito kudzera pa URL resource/index."

msgid "Backup"
msgstr "Kusunga kopi"

msgid "Bibledit does not do any backups of its own."
msgstr "Bibledit siipanga kusunga kopi kulikonse kwa yokha."

msgid "Backup is very important."
msgstr "Kusunga kopi ndi kofunika kwambiri."

msgid ""
"The system administrator should have a reliable backup strategy in place."
msgstr "Woyang'anira dongosolo ayenera kukhala ndi njira yodalirika yosungira kopi."

msgid "Bibledit uses SQLite for data storage."
msgstr "Bibledit imagwiritsa ntchito SQLite posunga deta."

msgid ""
"If a database is backed up while SQLite is storing data in it, the database "
"may get malformed."
msgstr "Ngati nkhokwe ya deta ikusungidwa kopi pamene SQLite ikusunga deta mmenemo, nkhokwe ya deta ingawonongeke."

msgid "Information."
msgstr "Chidziwitso."

msgid "This applies to any database software, not just SQLite."
msgstr "Izi zimagwira ntchito pa pulogalamu iliyonse ya nkhokwe ya deta, osati SQLite yokha."

msgid ""
"To accommodate backup, Bibledit does not access databases from 0:00 to 0:05 "
"at midnight."
msgstr "Kuti kusunga kopi kuthandizike, Bibledit siifikira nkhokwe za deta kuyambira 0:00 mpaka 0:05 pakati pa usiku."

msgid ""
"If no users access Bibledit during that time, then there is no database "
"access at all."
msgstr "Ngati palibe ogwiritsa ntchito omwe amafikira Bibledit panthawi imeneyo, ndiye kuti palibe kufikira nkhokwe za deta konse."

msgid "Backup can be safely done during that time."
msgstr "Kusunga kopi kungachitike motetezeka panthawi imeneyo."

msgid "If syncing no longer works, check the Journal for clues."
msgstr "Ngati kugwirizanitsa sikugwiranso ntchito, onani Chipika kuti mupeze zizindikiro."

msgid "The Journal may indicate any of the following:"
msgstr "Chipika chingasonyeze chilichonse mwa izi:"

msgid "This may be resolved in two ways:"
msgstr "Izi zingathetsedwe m'njira ziwiri:"

msgid ""
"Manually run the two commands in the appropriate directory from a terminal."
msgstr "Yendetsani pamanja malamulo awiriwo mu chikwatu choyenera kuchokera ku terminal."

msgid "Redo the setup of the Collaboration."
msgstr "Chitaninso kukhazikitsa kwa Kugwirizana pa ntchito."

msgid "It will run those two commands for you."
msgstr "Idzayendetsa malamulo awiriwo m'malo mwanu."

msgid "Bible books in custom order"
msgstr "Mabuku a Baibulo mu dongosolo losankhidwa"

msgid "To sort the Bible books in a custom order, do this:"
msgstr "Kuti muike mabuku a Baibulo mu dongosolo losankhidwa, chitani izi:"

msgid "Go to menu Bible / Bibles."
msgstr "Pitani ku menyu Baibulo / Mabaibulo."

msgid "Select a Bible."
msgstr "Sankhani Baibulo."

msgid "Go to Book order."
msgstr "Pitani ku Dongosolo la mabuku."

msgid "Drag the books into the desired order."
msgstr "Kokerani mabuku mu dongosolo lofunidwa."

msgid "Font, text direction and writing mode of the Bible editors"
msgstr "Mtundu wa zilembo, njira ya mawu ndi njira yolembera ya zosintha za Baibulo"

msgid ""
"To set the font, the text direction, or the writing mode for the Bible text "
"editors, do this:"
msgstr "Kuti mukhazikitse mtundu wa zilembo, njira ya mawu, kapena njira yolembera ya zosintha za mawu a Baibulo, chitani izi:"

msgid "Go to Font and text direction."
msgstr "Pitani ku Mtundu wa zilembo ndi njira ya mawu."

msgid "Make the settings."
msgstr "Pangani zoikamo."

msgid "Restore a Bible from a git repository"
msgstr "Bwezeretsani Baibulo kuchokera ku nkhokwe ya git"

msgid ""
"A Bible that has been backed up to a git repository, can also be restored "
"again from that repository."
msgstr "Baibulo lomwe lasungidwa kopi ku nkhokwe ya git, lingabwezeretsedwenso kuchokera ku nkhokwe imeneyo."

msgid ""
"While linking this Bible to that repository afresh, take the Bible data from "
"that repository."
msgstr "Mukalumikizanso Baibulo ili ku nkhokwe imeneyo, tengani deta ya Baibulo kuchokera ku nkhokwe imeneyo."

msgid "That will restore the Bible."
msgstr "Zimenezo zidzabwezeretsa Baibulo."

msgid ""
"When there is a need to restore the Bible to an older commit in the "
"repository, copy the data from that older commit to the master branch, "
"commit it, then link this Bible afresh."
msgstr "Pakafunika kubwezeretsa Baibulo ku commit yakale mu nkhokwe, koperani deta kuchokera ku commit yakale imeneyo ku nthambi ya master, itsimikizireni (commit), kenako lumikizaninso Baibulo ili."

msgid ""
"When the Navigator is displayed, enter the passage to focus through the "
"keyboard."
msgstr "Chowongolera chikawonetsedwa, lowetsani ndime yoti musankhe kudzera pa kiyibodi."

msgid "Escape"
msgstr "Escape"

msgid "Cancel any navigation or style operation."
msgstr "Letsani chochita chilichonse cha kuyenda kapena kalembedwe."

msgid "Alt-Down Arrow"
msgstr "Alt-Muvi Wapansi"

msgid "Navigate to the next verse."
msgstr "Pitani ku vesi lotsatira."

msgid "Alt-Up Arrow"
msgstr "Alt-Muvi Wapamwamba"

msgid "Navigate to the previous verse."
msgstr "Pitani ku vesi lapitalo."

msgid "Open the styles from the Bible editor."
msgstr "Tsegulani makalembedwe kuchokera ku chosintha cha Baibulo."

msgid "Find text."
msgstr "Pezani mawu."

msgid "Find next."
msgstr "Pezani yotsatira."

msgid "Print."
msgstr "Sindikizani."

msgid "Cycle through the available Bible editors."
msgstr "Yendani pa zosintha za Baibulo zomwe zilipo."

msgid "Scrum-based Translation"
msgstr "Kumasulira kozikidwa pa Scrum"

msgid "What is Scrum-based translation?"
msgstr "Kumasulira kozikidwa pa Scrum ndi chiyani?"

msgid ""
"A translation team that works with Scrum frequently releases portions of "
"translated Scripture."
msgstr "Gulu lomasulira lomwe limagwira ntchito ndi Scrum limatulutsa pafupipafupi zigawo za Malemba omasuliridwa."

msgid ""
"This makes it clear to involved parties where the translation project is "
"going."
msgstr "Izi zimawonetsa bwino kwa omwe akukhudzidwa kumene ntchito yomasulira ikupita."

msgid ""
"It enables the translation team to make course corrections based on the "
"facts."
msgstr "Zimalola gulu lomasulira kusintha njira potengera zenizeni."

msgid ""
"Burndown charts and the product backlog provide the product owner and others "
"with a permanent overview over the translation status and progress."
msgstr "Ma chati a burndown ndi product backlog zimapatsa mwini chinthu ndi ena chithunzi chokhazikika cha momwe kumasulira kulili ndi momwe kukupitira."

msgid ""
"Scrum is an agile process that enables self-organizing translation teams to "
"deliver high translation output and accuracy in a short time."
msgstr "Scrum ndi njira yofulumira yomwe imalola magulu omasulira odzikonza okha kupereka kumasulira kochuluka ndi kolondola mu nthawi yochepa."

msgid ""
"Using iterative translation, it releases portions of translated Scripture "
"every iteration, say, every month."
msgstr "Pogwiritsa ntchito kumasulira kobwerezabwereza, imatulutsa zigawo za Malemba omasuliridwa nthawi iliyonse yobwereza, tinene mwezi uliwonse."

msgid ""
"At the end of the every sprint, anyone can see the translated portion, and "
"decide whether to release it to the congregations and community for feedback "
"or continue to enhance it."
msgstr "Kumapeto kwa sprint iliyonse, aliyense angawone gawo lomasuliridwa, ndi kusankha kaya alitulutse ku mipingo ndi anthu kuti apereke maganizo kapena kupitiriza kulikonza."

msgid ""
"The introduction and the following explanation just outlines the mechanics "
"of Scrum-based Translation."
msgstr "Mawu oyamba ndi kufotokoza kotsatiraku kumangonena za makina a Kumasulira kozikidwa pa Scrum."

msgid ""
"It does not make clear what difficulties and issues you will run into trying "
"to implement it."
msgstr "Sikufotokoza mavuto ndi zovuta zomwe mudzakumana nazo poyesa kukhazikitsa."

msgid "It only hints at the agile spirit that's required to make it work."
msgstr "Kumangotchula mzimu wofulumira womwe umafunika kuti zigwire ntchito."

msgid ""
"If you're interested in implementing Scrum-based translation, do some "
"reading, watch videos, follow a course, find a mentor or coach."
msgstr "Ngati mukufuna kukhazikitsa kumasulira kozikidwa pa Scrum, werengani pang'ono, onani mavidiyo, tsatirani maphunziro, pezani mlangizi kapena mphunzitsi."

msgid "Product Owner"
msgstr "Mwini Chinthu (Product Owner)"

msgid "The Product Owner represents the stakeholders."
msgstr "Mwini Chinthu amaimira omwe akukhudzidwa."

msgid ""
"He or she is the voice of the target audience, that is the Bible reader."
msgstr "Iye ndi mawu a omvera omwe akufunidwa, ndiko kuti, wowerenga Baibulo."

msgid "He understands the requirements for the Bible."
msgstr "Amamvetsetsa zofunikira za Baibulo."

msgid "The Product Owner may also be a group of people in a committee."
msgstr "Mwini Chinthu angakhalenso gulu la anthu mu komiti."

msgid ""
"He is responsible for ensuring that the team delivers accuracy and "
"reliability to the Bible translation."
msgstr "Ali ndi udindo woonetsetsa kuti gulu likupereka kulondola ndi kudalirika pa kumasulira Baibulo."

msgid "He knows about accuracy and reliability."
msgstr "Amadziwa za kulondola ndi kudalirika."

msgid "He defines items that focus on desired features."
msgstr "Amafotokoza zinthu zoyang'ana pa mawonekedwe ofunidwa."

msgid ""
"He makes decisions as to whether to implement footnotes or leave them out."
msgstr "Amapanga zisankho za kaya agwiritse ntchito mawu a m'munsi kapena kuwasiya."

msgid ""
"In the same way, he defines other features, like headers, introductions, or "
"decides to leave them out."
msgstr "Momwemonso, amafotokoza mawonekedwe ena, monga mitu, mawu oyamba, kapena kusankha kuwasiya."

msgid "He decides about use or non-use of a dialect."
msgstr "Amasankha kugwiritsa ntchito kapena kusagwiritsa ntchito chilankhulo cha dera."

msgid "He sets the priorities for the work to be done."
msgstr "Amakhazikitsa zofunika kwambiri za ntchito yoyenera kuchitidwa."

msgid "He adds the items to the product backlog."
msgstr "Amawonjezera zinthuzo ku product backlog."

msgid "Scrum teams should have one Product Owner."
msgstr "Magulu a Scrum ayenera kukhala ndi Mwini Chinthu mmodzi."

msgid ""
"The Product Owner may be part of the Translation Team, but it is recommended "
"that his role not be combined with the role of Scrum Master."
msgstr "Mwini Chinthu angakhale gawo la Gulu Lomasulira, koma tikulimbikitsa kuti udindo wake usaphatikizidwe ndi udindo wa Scrum Master."

msgid "Release Planning"
msgstr "Kukonzekera kutulutsa"

msgid ""
"The release planning shows which parts of the Bible will be translated and "
"delivered during which Sprint."
msgstr "Kukonzekera kutulutsa kumasonyeza kuti ndi mbali ziti za Baibulo zomwe zidzamasuliridwa ndi kuperekedwa mu Sprint iti."

msgid ""
"It is convenient to define a Sprint in months, so that the release planning "
"mentions January, February, and so on."
msgstr "Nkosavuta kufotokoza Sprint m'miyezi, kuti kukonzekera kutulutsa kutchule Januwale, Febuluwale, ndi zina zotero."

msgid ""
"It is often helpful to stick the release planning to the wall so that "
"everybody can see the grand picture."
msgstr "Nthawi zambiri nkothandiza kumamatiza kukonzekera kutulutsa pa khoma kuti aliyense awone chithunzi chachikulu."

msgid "The advantages of a release planning are:"
msgstr "Ubwino wa kukonzekera kutulutsa ndi:"

msgid ""
"1. It gives the team a common vision about what needs to be achieved, and "
"when."
msgstr "1. Kumapatsa gulu masomphenya ofanana a zomwe zikuyenera kuchitidwa, ndi liti."

msgid "2. It guides the team to make decisions during detailed planning."
msgstr "2. Kumatsogolera gulu kupanga zisankho pa kukonzekera mwatsatanetsatane."

msgid "3. It helps prioritize the actions."
msgstr "3. Kumathandiza kuika zochita mu dongosolo la kufunika."

msgid ""
"4. It resolves conflicts and guides the teams toward the right balance on "
"trade-offs."
msgstr "4. Kumathetsa mikangano ndi kutsogolera magulu ku mgwirizano wolondola pa zosankha."

msgid ""
"Release each completed Bible book to the community and get their feedback."
msgstr "Tulutsani buku lililonse lomaliza la Baibulo kwa anthu ndi kulandira maganizo awo."

msgid "This implements the important principle of continual improvement."
msgstr "Izi zimagwiritsa ntchito mfundo yofunika ya kupititsa patsogolo kosatha."

msgid "The release planning is a simple way of doing top-down planning."
msgstr "Kukonzekera kutulutsa ndi njira yosavuta yokonzera kuchokera pamwamba kupita pansi."

msgid "It is an estimate, simple and quick to do."
msgstr "Ndi kuyerekeza, kosavuta ndi kwachangu kuchita."

msgid "It is based on the Product Backlog."
msgstr "Kumazikidwa pa Product Backlog."

msgid "Product Backlog"
msgstr "Product Backlog"

msgid ""
"The product backlog is an ordered list of requirements that is maintained "
"for the Bible translation."
msgstr "Product backlog ndi mndandanda wokonzedwa wa zofunikira zomwe zimasungidwa pa kumasulira Baibulo."

msgid ""
"It consists of translation tasks, checking tasks, testing tasks, "
"comprehension tasks, whatever needs to be done to deliver a reliable "
"manuscript."
msgstr "Imakhala ndi ntchito zomasulira, ntchito zoyang'ana, ntchito zoyesa, ntchito zomvetsetsa, chilichonse chomwe chiyenera kuchitidwa kuti pakhale zolembedwa zodalirika."

msgid "The Product Owner prioritizes the items on this list."
msgstr "Mwini Chinthu amakonza zinthu za pa mndandanda uwu motsatira kufunika."

msgid "It is used to determine the work for the next sprints."
msgstr "Imagwiritsidwa ntchito kudziwa ntchito ya ma sprint otsatira."

msgid "Each item has an associated estimated time to complete."
msgstr "Chinthu chilichonse chili ndi nthawi yoyerekezera yomaliza."

msgid "A sprint typically takes one month."
msgstr "Sprint nthawi zambiri imatenga mwezi umodzi."

msgid ""
"This is where the translaton work (translate, review, approve, test) occurs."
msgstr "Apa ndi pomwe ntchito yomasulira imachitika (kumasulira, kuwunika, kuvomereza, kuyesa)."

msgid ""
"Each member of the team translates independently and in a responsible manner."
msgstr "Membala aliyense wa gulu amamasulira payekha ndi mwa udindo."

msgid ""
"In case a translator is sure of a required change, he enters it without "
"consulting others."
msgstr "Ngati womasulira ali wotsimikiza za kusintha kofunikira, amachilowetsa popanda kufunsa ena."

msgid ""
"If a translator thinks a proposed change needs discussion, he notifies his "
"colleagues."
msgstr "Ngati womasulira akuganiza kuti kusintha komwe kwaperekedwa kumafunika kukambidwa, amadziwitsa anzake."

msgid ""
"All members of the translation team review the changes made by the team."
msgstr "Mamembala onse a gulu lomasulira amawunika zosintha zopangidwa ndi gulu."

msgid ""
"This is to make sure that all changes are reviewed by all members, that no "
"mistakes occur."
msgstr "Izi ndi kuonetsetsa kuti zosintha zonse zawunikidwa ndi mamembala onse, kuti pasakhale zolakwika."

msgid "The reviews take place every day."
msgstr "Kuwunika kumachitika tsiku lililonse."

msgid ""
"This way of working is based on personal responsibility and mutual trust."
msgstr "Njira yogwirira ntchito imeneyi imazikidwa pa udindo waumwini ndi kukhulupirirana."

msgid ""
"It speeds up the translation procedure because there's more actual "
"translation work going on, and less discussions."
msgstr "Imafulumizitsa ntchito yomasulira chifukwa pali ntchito yeniyeni yomasulira yambiri ndi zokambirana zochepa."

msgid ""
"The newer members of the team learn from the more experienced ones through "
"the daily reviews."
msgstr "Mamembala atsopano a gulu amaphunzira kuchokera kwa odziwa zambiri kudzera mu kuwunika kwa tsiku ndi tsiku."

msgid "Bibledit has the concept of daily Change Notifications."
msgstr "Bibledit ili ndi lingaliro la Zidziwitso za Zosintha za tsiku ndi tsiku."

msgid "A member can opt to receive the Change Notifications through email."
msgstr "Membala angasankhe kulandira Zidziwitso za Zosintha ndi imelo."

msgid "This email can be viewed online also."
msgstr "Imelo iyi ingawonedwenso pa intaneti."

msgid ""
"Or a member can opt to have the Change Notifications generated for him "
"online, and can review and approve them there."
msgstr "Kapena membala angasankhe kuti Zidziwitso za Zosintha zipangidwe kwa iye pa intaneti, ndi kuziwunikira ndi kuzivomereza kumeneko."

msgid "Sprint Planning Meeting"
msgstr "Msonkhano wa Kukonzekera Sprint"

msgid ""
"During this meeting the team selects the portions to translate, review and "
"test it believes it can commit to in a sprint."
msgstr "Pa msonkhano uwu gulu limasankha zigawo zomasulira, kuwunika ndi kuyesa zomwe likukhulupirira kuti lingathe kuzichita mu sprint."

msgid ""
"The team breaks the portions down into tasks and provided estimates for "
"those tasks as to the time it takes to complete them."
msgstr "Gulu limagawa zigawozo kukhala ntchito ndipo limapereka kuyerekezera kwa nthawi yomwe zimatenga kumaliza ntchitozo."

msgid "Sprint Backlog"
msgstr "Sprint Backlog"

msgid "The sprint backlog is a list of tasks to be completed in a sprint."
msgstr "Sprint backlog ndi mndandanda wa ntchito zoyenera kumalizidwa mu sprint."

msgid ""
"The tasks are created by breaking down the product backlog items during the "
"planning meeting."
msgstr "Ntchito zimapangidwa pogawa zinthu za product backlog pa msonkhano wokonzekera."

msgid "The tasks have estimates in hours or days associated with them."
msgstr "Ntchito zili ndi kuyerekezera mu maola kapena masiku."

msgid ""
"For a team it is vitally important to have a clear goal to work towards."
msgstr "Kwa gulu nkofunika kwambiri kukhala ndi cholinga chomveka cholimbikira."

msgid ""
"Thus everybody is focused on the desired outcome, and keeps a good pace."
msgstr "Choncho aliyense amayang'ana pa zotsatira zofunidwa, ndi kusunga liwiro labwino."

msgid ""
"Without a clear goal, the team may still do a lot of things and work hard, "
"but the produced results may not have the desired value."
msgstr "Popanda cholinga chomveka, gulu lingachitebe zinthu zambiri ndi kugwira ntchito mwakhama, koma zotsatira zopangidwa sizingakhale ndi phindu lofunidwa."

msgid "Team"
msgstr "Gulu"

msgid ""
"The team consistes of the Bible translators, their assistants, and the "
"consultants."
msgstr "Gulu limapangidwa ndi omasulira Baibulo, othandizira awo, ndi alangizi."

msgid ""
"The team organizes itself to carry out the work and deliver a reliable and "
"good Bible translation."
msgstr "Gulu limadzikonza lokha kuchita ntchito ndi kupereka kumasulira Baibulo kodalirika ndi kwabwino."

msgid "The team is quick but does not hurry."
msgstr "Gulu ndi lachangu koma siligwira mwachangu mopupuluma."

msgid "The team goes fast, but always has an eye on translation quality."
msgstr "Gulu limayenda mwachangu, koma nthawi zonse limayang'ana ubwino wa kumasulira."

msgid "Scrum Master"
msgstr "Scrum Master"

msgid "The scrum master organizes the translation process."
msgstr "Scrum master amakonza njira yomasulira."

msgid "He or she keeps track of the progress of the translation team."
msgstr "Iye amatsata momwe gulu lomasulira likupitira."

msgid "He removes obstacles from the path of the team."
msgstr "Amachotsa zopinga panjira ya gulu."

msgid "Daily Scrum Meeting"
msgstr "Msonkhano wa Scrum wa tsiku ndi tsiku"

msgid ""
"On each day of a sprint, the Bible translation team holds daily meetings."
msgstr "Tsiku lililonse la sprint, gulu lomasulira Baibulo limakhala ndi misonkhano ya tsiku ndi tsiku."

msgid "These meetings are called: Daily scrum meetings."
msgstr "Misonkhano imeneyi imatchedwa: Misonkhano ya scrum ya tsiku ndi tsiku."

msgid "The scrum meetings are held in the same place and at the same time."
msgstr "Misonkhano ya scrum imachitikira pamalo amodzi ndi nthawi imodzi."

msgid "The meetings are typically held in front of Task Board."
msgstr "Misonkhano nthawi zambiri imachitika pamaso pa Bolodi la Ntchito."

msgid ""
"The daily scrum meeting is best held in the morning, because it assists in "
"setting the context for the work of that day."
msgstr "Msonkhano wa scrum wa tsiku ndi tsiku umachitika bwino m'mawa, chifukwa umathandiza kukhazikitsa nkhani ya ntchito ya tsikulo."

msgid ""
"During the meeting, all members stand, as this keeps the discussion short "
"and relevant."
msgstr "Pa msonkhano, mamembala onse amaimirira, chifukwa izi zimasunga zokambirana zazifupi ndi zogwirizana."

msgid "The scrum meeting is strictly time-boxed to 15 minutes."
msgstr "Msonkhano wa scrum umaikidwa malire okhwima a mphindi 15."

msgid ""
"There is a difference between people who are 'committed' to the Bible "
"translation project, and those who are 'involved' in it."
msgstr "Pali kusiyana pakati pa anthu 'odzipereka' ku ntchito yomasulira Baibulo, ndi omwe 'akukhudzidwa' nayo."

msgid "Scrum affords special status to those who are committed."
msgstr "Scrum imapereka udindo wapadera kwa omwe adzipereka."

msgid ""
"Many teams enforce a rule in which only those who are committed are allowed "
"to talk during the daily scrum meeting."
msgstr "Magulu ambiri amakhazikitsa lamulo lakuti odzipereka okha ndiwo amaloledwa kulankhula pa msonkhano wa scrum wa tsiku ndi tsiku."

msgid "All team members are required to attend the scrum meetings."
msgstr "Mamembala onse a gulu amafunika kupezeka pa misonkhano ya scrum."

msgid ""
"The Scrum Master and the and Product Owner (usually the Bible Translation "
"Manager) are committed team members."
msgstr "Scrum Master ndi Mwini Chinthu (nthawi zambiri Woyang'anira Kumasulira Baibulo) ndi mamembala odzipereka a gulu."

msgid "They are expected to attend and participate."
msgstr "Akuyembekezeka kupezekapo ndi kutenga nawo mbali."

msgid ""
"Anyone else, for example a Church leader, a Committee member, or a "
"Translator from another team, is allowed to attend but is there to listen "
"only."
msgstr "Wina aliyense, mwachitsanzo mtsogoleri wa Mpingo, membala wa Komiti, kapena Womasulira wa gulu lina, amaloledwa kupezekapo koma ali pomwepo kuti amvetsere basi."

msgid ""
"This makes the daily scrum meeting an excellent way for a scrum team to "
"disseminate information."
msgstr "Izi zimapangitsa msonkhano wa scrum wa tsiku ndi tsiku kukhala njira yabwino yoti gulu la scrum lifalitse zidziwitso."

msgid ""
"If you are interested in hearing the status of the project, attend that "
"day's meeting."
msgstr "Ngati mukufuna kumva za momwe ntchito ilili, pitani ku msonkhano wa tsikulo."

msgid ""
"The scrum meeting is not the place for solving problems or resolving issues."
msgstr "Msonkhano wa scrum si malo othetsera mavuto kapena kuthetsa nkhani."

msgid ""
"Issues that are raised are usually dealt with by one or two team members "
"immediately after the scrum."
msgstr "Nkhani zomwe zaperekedwa nthawi zambiri zimathetsedwa ndi mamembala amodzi kapena awiri a gulu atangotha scrum."

msgid ""
"During the daily Scrum, each team member answers the following three "
"questions:"
msgstr "Pa scrum ya tsiku ndi tsiku, membala aliyense wa gulu amayankha mafunso atatu otsatirawa:"

msgid "What did you do yesterday?"
msgstr "Munachita chiyani dzulo?"

msgid "What are you going to do today?"
msgstr "Mudzachita chiyani lero?"

msgid "Are there any impediments in your way?"
msgstr "Kodi pali zopinga zilizonse panjira yanu?"

msgid ""
"The Scrum Master asks each team member to answer these questions, the member "
"speaks, the Scrum Master thanks the member, and then goes to the next member."
msgstr "Scrum Master amapempha membala aliyense wa gulu kuyankha mafunso awa, membala amalankhula, Scrum Master amathokoza membalayo, kenako amapita kwa membala wotsatira."

msgid ""
"By focusing on what each person did yesterday and will do today, the team "
"gains an understanding of what work has been done and what work remains."
msgstr "Poyang'ana zomwe aliyense anachita dzulo ndi zomwe achite lero, gulu limamvetsetsa ntchito yomwe yachitika ndi yomwe yatsala."

msgid ""
"The daily scrum meeting is not a status update meeting in which the boss is "
"finding out about who is slow in his work."
msgstr "Msonkhano wa scrum wa tsiku ndi tsiku si msonkhano wa zosintha za momwe zinthu zilili pomwe bwana amadziwa yemwe akuchedwa ntchito yake."

msgid ""
"Rather, it is a meeting in which team members make commitments to each other."
msgstr "M'malo mwake, ndi msonkhano pomwe mamembala a gulu amalonjezana wina ndi mnzake."

msgid ""
"If a translator says: Today, I will prepare chapter 10 and 11 of Matthew, "
"everyone knows that in tomorrow's meeting, he will say whether or not he did "
"finish."
msgstr "Ngati womasulira anena kuti: Lero, ndikonzekera mutu 10 ndi 11 wa Mateyu, aliyense amadziwa kuti pa msonkhano wa mawa, adzanena ngati wamaliza kapena ayi."

msgid ""
"This has the wonderful effect of helping a team realize the significance of "
"these commitments, and that their commitments are to each other, and not to "
"anyone else."
msgstr "Izi zili ndi zotsatira zabwino zothandiza gulu kuzindikira kufunika kwa malonjezo amenewa, ndi kuti malonjezo awo ndi kwa wina ndi mnzake, osati kwa wina aliyense."

msgid ""
"Any impediments that are raised in the daily scrums become the Scrum "
"Master's responsibility to resolve as quickly as possible."
msgstr "Zopinga zilizonse zomwe zaperekedwa mu ma scrum a tsiku ndi tsiku zimakhala udindo wa Scrum Master kuzithetsa mwamsanga momwe zingathere."

msgid "Typical impediments are:"
msgstr "Zopinga zachizolowezi ndi:"

msgid "My ... broke and I need a new one today."
msgstr "Chinthu changa ... chasweka ndipo ndikufuna chatsopano lero."

msgid "I still haven't got the ... I requested a month ago."
msgstr "Sindinalandirebe ... zomwe ndinapempha mwezi wapitawo."

msgid ""
"I'm struggling to understand ... and would like to discuss it with someone."
msgstr "Ndikuvutika kumvetsetsa ... ndipo ndikufuna kukambirana ndi wina."

msgid "The ... has asked me to work on something else for a few days."
msgstr "... wandipempha kuti ndigwire ntchito ina kwa masiku angapo."

msgid ""
"In cases where the Scrum Master cannot remove these impediments directly "
"himself, he still takes responsibility for making sure someone on the team "
"does quickly resolve the issue."
msgstr "Pamene Scrum Master sangathe kuchotsa yekha zopingazi mwachindunji, amatengabe udindo woonetsetsa kuti wina mu gulu athetsa mwamsanga vutolo."

msgid "Every day a different person leads the daily scrum meeting."
msgstr "Tsiku lililonse munthu wosiyana amatsogolera msonkhano wa scrum wa tsiku ndi tsiku."

msgid "This gets the entire team involved."
msgstr "Izi zimaphatikiza gulu lonse."

msgid "It opens up new channels for communication."
msgstr "Zimatsegula njira zatsopano zolankhulirana."

msgid "It builds trust between the Translators and the Scrum Master."
msgstr "Zimamanga kukhulupirirana pakati pa Omasulira ndi Scrum Master."

msgid "Team members can learn from one another's techniques."
msgstr "Mamembala a gulu angaphunzire kuchokera ku njira za wina ndi mnzake."

msgid ""
"The Scrum Master ensures to set a good example for leading the daily scrum "
"meeting."
msgstr "Scrum Master amaonetsetsa kuti akupereka chitsanzo chabwino chotsogolera msonkhano wa scrum wa tsiku ndi tsiku."

msgid ""
"The scrum master uses the information from the meeting to update the "
"burndown chart illustrating progress."
msgstr "Scrum master amagwiritsa ntchito zidziwitso za msonkhano kusintha chati ya burndown yomwe ikuwonetsa momwe zikupitira."

msgid "Side conversations are taken offline."
msgstr "Zokambirana zam'mbali zimatengedwa kunja kwa msonkhano."

msgid "Burn down chart"
msgstr "Chati ya burn down"

msgid ""
"A burn down chart is a graphical representation of work left to do versus "
"time."
msgstr "Chati ya burn down ndi chithunzi cha ntchito yotsala yochitidwa poyerekeza ndi nthawi."

msgid "The outstanding work is on the vertical axis."
msgstr "Ntchito yotsala ili pa olo loyimirira."

msgid "The days of the sprint are on the horizontal axis."
msgstr "Masiku a sprint ali pa olo yopingasa."

msgid "It is useful for predicting when all of the work will be completed."
msgstr "Ndi yothandiza kuneneratu nthawi yomwe ntchito yonse idzamalizidwa."

msgid "Sprint Review"
msgstr "Kuwunikanso Sprint"

msgid ""
"The Product Owner looks through the sprint’s work and provides feedback."
msgstr "Mwini Chinthu amayang'ana ntchito ya sprint ndi kupereka maganizo."

msgid "The Translators may demonstrate features."
msgstr "Omasulira angasonyeze mawonekedwe."

msgid "The Team owns up to deficiencies with the translation."
msgstr "Gulu limavomereza zofooka za kumasulira."

msgid "This attitude helps to build trust with the Product Owner."
msgstr "Khalidwe limeneli limathandiza kumanga kukhulupirirana ndi Mwini Chinthu."

msgid "Sprint Retrospective"
msgstr "Kuwonanso mmbuyo kwa Sprint"

msgid "The Team reviews what went well and what went poorly."
msgstr "Gulu limawunikanso zomwe zinayenda bwino ndi zomwe zinayenda molakwika."

msgid "They use retrospection techniques to find potential for improvement."
msgstr "Amagwiritsa ntchito njira zowonanso mmbuyo kupeza mwayi wokonza."

msgid "They pick one or two areas to focus for improvement."
msgstr "Amasankha madera amodzi kapena awiri oyang'ana kuti akonze."

msgid "Typesetting Bibles"
msgstr "Kukonza zilembo za Mabaibulo kuti zisindikizidwe"

msgid "Bibledit can assist with typesetting."
msgstr "Bibledit ingathandize pa kukonza zilembo."

msgid "But Bibledit is not designed for typesetting."
msgstr "Koma Bibledit sinapangidwe kuti ikonze zilembo."

msgid "It is for Bible editing."
msgstr "Ndi ya kusintha Baibulo."

msgid "No more than that."
msgstr "Osati kuposa pamenepo."

msgid "Having said this, and despite this, let's press on."
msgstr "Mutanena izi, ndi ngakhale zili choncho, tiyeni tipitirize."

msgid "The Bible has been translated. It is time to publish it."
msgstr "Baibulo lamasuliridwa. Ndi nthawi yolifalitsa."

msgid "This article assists with typesetting the Bible."
msgstr "Nkhani iyi imathandiza pa kukonza zilembo za Baibulo."

msgid ""
"At the end of all, you will have a PDF file with part of the Bible, or the "
"whole Bible, typeset, ready for publishing."
msgstr "Kumapeto kwa zonse, mudzakhala ndi fayilo ya PDF yokhala ndi gawo la Baibulo, kapena Baibulo lonse, lokonzedwa zilembo, lokonzeka kufalitsidwa."

msgid "Basic assumptions"
msgstr "Malingaliro oyambira"

msgid "The Bible is available in USFM code."
msgstr "Baibulo likupezeka mu khodi ya USFM."

msgid "The USFM code is clean and adheres to the standards."
msgstr "Khodi ya USFM ndi yoyera ndipo imatsata miyezo."

msgid "You have access to Bibledit."
msgstr "Muli ndi mwayi wofikira Bibledit."

msgid "You have OpenOffice, LibreOffice or an equivalent."
msgstr "Muli ndi OpenOffice, LibreOffice kapena chofanana nacho."

msgid "Importing the USFM files"
msgstr "Kutenga mafayilo a USFM"

msgid ""
"This section describes the steps to take to prepare the USFM code for export."
msgstr "Gawoli limafotokoza njira zotsatirira pokonzekera khodi ya USFM kuti itumizidwe kunja."

msgid "Each Bible book is stored as one USFM file."
msgstr "Buku lililonse la Baibulo limasungidwa ngati fayilo imodzi ya USFM."

msgid ""
"Create a new Bible in Bibledit. Give the Bible a name. The example calls it "
"'Ndebele'."
msgstr "Pangani Baibulo latsopano mu Bibledit. Patsani Baibulo dzina. Chitsanzocho chimalitcha 'Ndebele'."

msgid "Click the 'Ndebele' Bible."
msgstr "Dinani Baibulo la 'Ndebele'."

msgid "Import data into it."
msgstr "Tengani deta mmenemo."

msgid "Choose the option to upload a file."
msgstr "Sankhani njira yokweza fayilo."

msgid ""
"You can upload 66 separate files, or you can put all the 66 files into one "
"zipped file, and then upload that zipped file. Import takes a while. The "
"Journal shows the progress."
msgstr "Mutha kukweza mafayilo 66 osiyana, kapena mutha kuika mafayilo onse 66 mu fayilo imodzi ya zip, kenako kukweza fayilo ya zip imeneyo. Kutenga kumatenga nthawi. Chipika chimasonyeza momwe ntchito ikuyendera."

msgid ""
"Create a new stylesheet in menu Styles. Give it a name. The example calls it "
"'Ndebele'."
msgstr "Pangani tsamba latsopano la masitayilo mu menyu Makalembedwe. Patsani dzina. Chitsanzocho chimalitcha 'Ndebele'."

msgid ""
"All the data is now in Bibledit. Everthing is ready for export to "
"OpenDocument files."
msgstr "Deta yonse tsopano ili mu Bibledit. Chilichonse chakonzeka kutumizidwa ku mafayilo a OpenDocument."

msgid "The OpenDocument files are used as a starting point for typesetting."
msgstr "Mafayilo a OpenDocument amagwiritsidwa ntchito ngati poyambira pa kukonza zilembo."

msgid ""
"Some of the words in the OpenDocument files are long. This results in too "
"much space between some words."
msgstr "Mawu ena mu mafayilo a OpenDocument ndi aatali. Izi zimayambitsa mpata wochuluka pakati pa mawu ena."

msgid ""
"The words need to get hyphens so that part of the word goes on the next line."
msgstr "Mawuwo afunika kuikidwa zizindikiro za kugawa kuti gawo la mawuwo lipite ku mzere wotsatira."

msgid ""
"LibreOffice and Adobe InDesign and Scribus have hyphenation algorithms for "
"many languages. That would solve the problem."
msgstr "LibreOffice ndi Adobe InDesign ndi Scribus ali ndi njira zogawira mawu m'masilabo za zilankhulo zambiri. Izi zingathetse vutoli."

msgid ""
"But the programs do not have hyphenation algorithms for all languages."
msgstr "Koma mapulogalamu alibe njira zogawira mawu m'masilabo za zilankhulo zonse."

msgid "Bibledit has a hyphenater that could assist."
msgstr "Bibledit ili ndi chogawa mawu m'masilabo chomwe chingathandize."

msgid "In Bibledit, go to this menu:"
msgstr "Mu Bibledit, pitani ku menyu iyi:"

msgid "Enter the first set of characters, and the second set, and save it."
msgstr "Lowetsani gulu loyamba la zilembo, ndi lachiwiri, ndi kulisunga."

msgid ""
"Set the Bible where to take the data from. In this case it is 'Ndebele'."
msgstr "Khazikitsani Baibulo lomwe deta idzatengedwa. Pa nkhaniyi ndi 'Ndebele'."

msgid ""
"Insert the soft hyphens according to the setting. It takes a while to "
"complete."
msgstr "Ikani zizindikiro zofewa motsatira zoikamo. Zimatenga nthawi kumaliza."

msgid "The output Bible is called 'Ndebele-hyphenated'."
msgstr "Baibulo lotuluka limatchedwa 'Ndebele-hyphenated'."

msgid "Use this Bible from now on."
msgstr "Gwiritsani ntchito Baibulo ili kuyambira pano."

msgid "Exporting to OpenDocument files"
msgstr "Kutumiza ku mafayilo a OpenDocument"

msgid "Make an initial export just to see how the text looks."
msgstr "Chitani kutumiza koyamba kuti muwone momwe mawu akuwonekera."

msgid "In Bibledit, go to menu Exports."
msgstr "Mu Bibledit, pitani ku menyu Zotumizidwa kunja."

msgid "Add Bible 'Ndebele' to the ones that will be exported."
msgstr "Onjezani Baibulo 'Ndebele' ku omwe adzatumizidwa."

msgid "Use stylesheet 'Ndebele'."
msgstr "Gwiritsani ntchito tsamba la masitayilo 'Ndebele'."

msgid "Output the chapter number in drop caps. Do not use frames."
msgstr "Tulutsani nambala ya mutu mu zilembo zazikulu zotsika. Musagwiritse ntchito mafelemu."

msgid "Set the page size. I use this: width: 138 mm; height: 210 mm."
msgstr "Khazikitsani kukula kwa tsamba. Ndimagwiritsa ntchito izi: kufalikira: 138 mm; kutalika: 210 mm."

msgid ""
"Set the margins. I use this: 10 mm for top and bottom margins, 12 mm for the "
"outer margins, and 14 mm for the inner margins."
msgstr "Khazikitsani mipata. Ndimagwiritsa ntchito izi: 10 mm pa mipata yapamwamba ndi yapansi, 12 mm pa mipata yakunja, ndi 14 mm pa mipata yamkati."

msgid ""
"Do not display the date in the running headers. Switch that setting off."
msgstr "Musawonetse tsiku mu mitu yoyenda. Zimitsani zoikamo zimenezo."

msgid "Insert the 'en space' after verse numbers."
msgstr "Ikani 'mpata wa en' pambuyo pa manambala a mavesi."

msgid "The Logbook shows the progress. Proceed when it is ready."
msgstr "Chipika chimasonyeza momwe ntchito ikuyendera. Pitirizani ikadzakonzeka."

msgid ""
"Go to menu Exports and choose your Bible there. Then go to the OpenDocument "
"folder."
msgstr "Pitani ku menyu Zotumizidwa kunja ndi kusankha Baibulo lanu pamenepo. Kenako pitani ku foda ya OpenDocument."

msgid "You will see the Bible exported into several formats."
msgstr "Mudzawona Baibulo litatumizidwa m'mitundu yosiyanasiyana."

msgid "Open the books in LibreOffice to see how they look."
msgstr "Tsegulani mabuku mu LibreOffice kuti muwone momwe akuwonekera."

msgid "The divine name will be underlined in the OpenDocument files."
msgstr "Dzina laumulungu lidzalembedwa mzere pansi mu mafayilo a OpenDocument."

msgid "The divine name is within this markup:"
msgstr "Dzina laumulungu lili mkati mwa chizindikiro ichi:"

msgid "Some prefer this in small capitals, not underlined."
msgstr "Ena amakonda izi m'zilembo zazikulu zazing'ono, osati mzere pansi."

msgid "This can be changed in the stylesheet."
msgstr "Izi zingasinthidwe mu tsamba la masitayilo."

msgid "Go to menu Styles, and choose the 'Ndebele' stylesheet."
msgstr "Pitani ku menyu Makalembedwe, ndi kusankha tsamba la masitayilo 'Ndebele'."

msgid "Click the 'nd' style."
msgstr "Dinani kalembedwe 'nd'."

msgid "Switch 'Underline' off."
msgstr "Zimitsani 'Underline'."

msgid "Switch 'Small caps' on."
msgstr "Yatsani 'Small caps'."

msgid ""
"Do a new export, wait a while, and review the OpenDocument files again."
msgstr "Chitani kutumiza kwatsopano, dikirani kanthawi, ndi kuwunikanso mafayilo a OpenDocument."

msgid ""
"The verse numbers are in superscript. The verse numbers are small and "
"difficult to read."
msgstr "Manambala a mavesi ali pamwamba. Manambala a mavesi ndi ang'onoang'ono ndipo ndi ovuta kuwerenga."

msgid "The intended audience prefers the verse numbers in bigger print."
msgstr "Omvera omwe akufunidwa amakonda manambala a mavesi osindikizidwa aakulu."

msgid "Go to the relevant stylesheet and choose the 'v' style."
msgstr "Pitani ku tsamba loyenera la masitayilo ndi kusankha kalembedwe 'v'."

msgid "Switch 'Superscript' off."
msgstr "Zimitsani 'Superscript'."

msgid "Do a new export and review the OpenDocument files."
msgstr "Chitani kutumiza kwatsopano ndi kuwunika mafayilo a OpenDocument."

msgid ""
"The text in the OpenDocument files has been divided into paragraphs. New "
"paragraphs start when appropriate in the context. This is how the USFM files "
"have been marked up."
msgstr "Mawu mu mafayilo a OpenDocument agawidwa m'ndime. Ndime zatsopano zimayamba pamene zili zoyenera mu nkhani. Umu ndi momwe mafayilo a USFM adalembedwera."

msgid ""
"The people who are going to read this Bible prefer each verse to start a new "
"paragraph."
msgstr "Anthu omwe adzawerenga Baibulo ili amakonda kuti vesi lililonse liyambe ndime yatsopano."

msgid "Go to the stylesheet, and choose the 'v' style."
msgstr "Pitani ku tsamba la masitayilo, ndi kusankha kalembedwe 'v'."

msgid "Set 'Restart paragraph' on."
msgstr "Yatsani 'Restart paragraph'."

msgid "Export again."
msgstr "Tumizaninso."

msgid ""
"Since each verse starts a new paragraph, there is no longer any need to "
"indent the first line of that paragraph."
msgstr "Popeza vesi lililonse limayamba ndime yatsopano, sikufunikanso kulowetsa mzere woyamba wa ndimeyo."

msgid "In the stylesheet, edit the 'p' style."
msgstr "Mu tsamba la masitayilo, sinthani kalembedwe 'p'."

msgid "Set the 'First line indent' to 0 mm."
msgstr "Khazikitsani 'First line indent' kukhala 0 mm."

msgid ""
"Some verses are short. Chapters that start with short verses no longer have "
"the chapter number in drop caps in LibreOffice."
msgstr "Mavesi ena ndi aafupi. Mitu yomwe imayamba ndi mavesi afupi siikhalanso ndi nambala ya mutu mu zilembo zazikulu zotsika mu LibreOffice."

msgid ""
"This is because this verse is all on one line, and thus there is no space "
"for drop caps, as these need two lines of text."
msgstr "Izi ndi chifukwa vesi ili lili pa mzere umodzi, motero palibe malo a zilembo zazikulu zotsika, chifukwa izi zimafunika mizere iwiri ya mawu."

msgid ""
"Setting the text in two columns in LibreOffice solves the problem. The drop "
"caps are back."
msgstr "Kuika mawu m'mizati iwiri mu LibreOffice kumathetsa vutoli. Zilembo zazikulu zotsika zabwerera."

msgid ""
"The letters of the Bible text are too big. This takes up a lot of space. The "
"Bible would get too many pages."
msgstr "Zilembo za mawu a Baibulo ndi zazikulu kwambiri. Izi zimatenga malo ambiri. Baibulo likanakhala ndi masamba ambiri."

msgid ""
"Find out which styles start paragraphs. In the Ndebele Bible, these are the "
"styles p, s, nb, d."
msgstr "Dziwani kuti ndi makalembedwe ati amayamba ndime. Mu Baibulo la Ndebele, awa ndi makalembedwe p, s, nb, d."

msgid "Set these styles to have a font size of 10 points."
msgstr "Khazikitsani makalembedwe awa kukhala ndi kukula kwa zilembo kwa mapointi 10."

msgid "The letters of the notes and crossreferences are too big."
msgstr "Zilembo za zolemba ndi mawu olozera ndi zazikulu kwambiri."

msgid "Set the fontsize of the styles ft and xt to 6 points."
msgstr "Khazikitsani kukula kwa zilembo za makalembedwe ft ndi xt kukhala mapointi 6."

msgid ""
"Parts of the footnotes are in bold or italics or both. You may prefer it all "
"in normal script."
msgstr "Mbali zina za mawu a m'munsi zili zakuda kapena zopendekeka kapena zonse ziwiri. Mungakonde zonse mu zilembo zabwinobwino."

msgid ""
"Update the relevant footnote styles and switch bold and italics off. The "
"styles are fk, fl, fq, fqa."
msgstr "Sinthani makalembedwe oyenera a mawu a m'munsi ndi kuzimitsa zakuda ndi zopendekeka. Makalembedwewo ndi fk, fl, fq, fqa."

msgid "Typesetting guidelines"
msgstr "Malangizo a kukonza zilembo"

msgid ""
"The following needs consideration if the Bible includes more than one book."
msgstr "Zotsatirazi zimafunika kuganiziridwa ngati Baibulo lili ndi buku loposa limodzi."

msgid ""
"Does the next book follow on the same page on which the previous book "
"finished, or do the books follow on from one another in a different way?"
msgstr "Kodi buku lotsatira limatsatira pa tsamba lomwe buku lapitalo linatha, kapena mabuku amatsatana m'njira ina?"

msgid ""
"Whatever method is chosen, it needs to be applied consistently throughout "
"the Bible."
msgstr "Njira iliyonse yosankhidwa, iyenera kugwiritsidwa ntchito mofanana pa Baibulo lonse."

msgid ""
"Line spacing should be consistent throughout and should be placed line on "
"line across all pages."
msgstr "Mpata wa mizere uyenera kukhala wofanana paliponse ndi kuikidwa mzere pa mzere pa masamba onse."

msgid ""
"It means that all lines should line up with each other all the way down the "
"page and across all pages."
msgstr "Zikutanthauza kuti mizere yonse iyenera kugwirizana wina ndi mnzake pa tsamba lonse ndi pa masamba onse."

msgid ""
"Then when the Bible is printed, the printed text will be back to back and "
"not show through from one side of the page to the other."
msgstr "Kenako Baibulo likasindikizidwa, mawu osindikizidwa adzakhala kumbuyo ndi kumbuyo ndipo sadzaonekera kuchokera mbali imodzi ya tsamba kupita ku inzake."

msgid ""
"In the typesetting software, this can be implemented by setting up a grid in "
"the document, and then aligning all text to this grid."
msgstr "Mu pulogalamu yokonza zilembo, izi zingachitidwe pokhazikitsa gululi mu chikalata, kenako kugwirizanitsa mawu onse ndi gululi."

msgid "The space after the verse numbers would be the same and consistent."
msgstr "Mpata pambuyo pa manambala a mavesi udzakhala wofanana ndi wokhazikika."

msgid ""
"Bibledit exports the text to OpenDocument format using 'en spaces' after "
"each verse."
msgstr "Bibledit imatumiza mawu ku mtundu wa OpenDocument pogwiritsa ntchito 'mipata ya en' pambuyo pa vesi lililonse."

msgid ""
"This ensures a consistent width of the spaces after the verse numbers."
msgstr "Izi zimaonetsetsa kuti mpata pambuyo pa manambala a mavesi uli ndi kufalikira kofanana."

msgid ""
"The verse numbers should be set closer to the text that follows than to the "
"preceding text."
msgstr "Manambala a mavesi ayenera kukhala pafupi ndi mawu otsatira kuposa mawu apitawo."

msgid ""
"Many fonts have half spaces and hair spaces that can be used for this."
msgstr "Mitundu yambiri ya zilembo ili ndi mipata ya hafu ndi mipata yaying'ono yomwe ingagwiritsidwe ntchito pa izi."

msgid "Or set the kerning to a specific amount for the verse numbers."
msgstr "Kapena khazikitsani kerning kukhala kuchuluka kwinakwake pa manambala a mavesi."

msgid "Superscript numerals could also be considered for verse numbers."
msgstr "Manambala a pamwamba angaganiziridwenso pa manambala a mavesi."

msgid ""
"They are less intrusive while at the same time just as readable and easily "
"found if they are not made too small."
msgstr "Sasokoneza kwambiri ndipo nthawi yomweyo amawerengeka ndi kupezeka mosavuta ngati sapangidwa ang'onoang'ono kwambiri."

msgid "They should be larger than any note citations in the text."
msgstr "Ayenera kukhala aakulu kuposa mawu olozera zolemba mu mawu."

msgid ""
"The size of the superscript would be between 70 and 80 percent of the size "
"of the main text."
msgstr "Kukula kwa chilembo cha pamwamba kudzakhala pakati pa peresenti 70 ndi 80 ya kukula kwa mawu aakulu."

msgid ""
"The alignment of the drop caps chapter numbers to the text beside it is to "
"be consistent."
msgstr "Kuyika manambala a mitu mu zilembo zazikulu zotsika molingana ndi mawu omwe ali pafupi nawo kuyenera kukhala kofanana."

msgid "There should be some space between the numbers and the text."
msgstr "Payenera kukhala mpata pakati pa manambala ndi mawu."

msgid ""
"Drop cap characters should not be too large and not rise too far above the "
"height of the other letters on the first line."
msgstr "Zilembo zazikulu zotsika siziyenera kukhala zazikulu kwambiri ndipo siziyenera kukwera kwambiri pamwamba pa kutalika kwa zilembo zina pa mzere woyamba."

msgid "The top of the highest letters should reach to about the same height."
msgstr "Pamwamba pa zilembo zazitali kwambiri payenera kufika pa kutalika kofanana."

msgid ""
"The drop cap characters in the body of the text should not be indented."
msgstr "Zilembo zazikulu zotsika mu thupi la mawu siziyenera kulowetsedwa."

msgid ""
"The chapter divisions would also benefit from some more space between them "
"and the text of the preceding chapter."
msgstr "Magawo a mitu angapindule ndi mpata wina pakati pawo ndi mawu a mutu wapitawo."

msgid ""
"When there is no heading above a chapter, it may be visually better to start "
"the chapter number with a line space before it."
msgstr "Pamene palibe mutu wa mawu pamwamba pa mutu, zingakhale bwino kuona kuyamba nambala ya mutu ndi mpata wa mzere pamaso pake."

msgid ""
"The amount of space given to the Bible book headings should not be too much."
msgstr "Mpata woperekedwa ku mitu ya mabuku a Baibulo usakhale wochuluka kwambiri."

msgid "But they can do with some space above and below them."
msgstr "Koma angagwiritse ntchito mpata wina pamwamba ndi pansi pawo."

msgid ""
"Subheadings should not appear squashed amongst the rest of the text and "
"would benefit from some space."
msgstr "Mitu yaing'ono siyenera kuwoneka yopanikizidwa pakati pa mawu ena ndipo ingapindule ndi mpata."

msgid "Subheadings do not need to be set on the grid."
msgstr "Mitu yaing'ono siifunikira kuikidwa pa gululi."

msgid "They are much better set a little closer to the text that follows."
msgstr "Ndi bwino kwambiri kuiyika pafupi ndi mawu otsatira."

msgid ""
"Subheadings are an addition and not Scripture, so it is appropriate to put "
"these in italics."
msgstr "Mitu yaing'ono ndi chowonjezera osati Malemba, choncho nkoyenera kuiyika m'zilembo zopendekeka."

msgid ""
"The space between the text and footnotes should not be too tight neither "
"unnecessarily large."
msgstr "Mpata pakati pa mawu ndi mawu a m'munsi usakhale wopanikizika kapena waukulu mopanda chifukwa."

msgid ""
"Keep the gap between the references in the footer and the main block of text "
"as consistent as possible."
msgstr "Sungani mpata pakati pa mawu olozera pansi ndi gawo lalikulu la mawu kukhala wofanana momwe mungathere."

msgid ""
"The footnotes and crossreferences should not have a large variation in how "
"far they finish from the foot of the page."
msgstr "Mawu a m'munsi ndi mawu olozera sayenera kukhala ndi kusiyana kwakukulu pa momwe amatha kuchokera pansi pa tsamba."

msgid ""
"In the crossreferences it is pleasing to have the chapter and verse number "
"kept together with the book name, especially as the small font on long lines "
"gives scope for this."
msgstr "Mu mawu olozera ndi kosangalatsa kusunga nambala ya mutu ndi vesi pamodzi ndi dzina la buku, makamaka popeza zilembo zazing'ono pa mizere yaitali zimalola izi."

msgid ""
"The columns should start at the same height and should be balanced at the "
"ends."
msgstr "Mizati iyenera kuyamba pa kutalika kofanana ndipo iyenera kukhala yoyenerana kumapeto."

msgid "The gap between the columns should be between 4 and 5 mm."
msgstr "Mpata pakati pa mizati uyenera kukhala pakati pa 4 ndi 5 mm."

msgid ""
"The centre line dividing the two columns should start about level or very "
"slightly above the top of the highest ascenders on the first line of text in "
"a column and finish about level with the bottom of the lowest descenders on "
"the bottom line."
msgstr "Mzere wapakati wolekanitsa mizati iwiri uyenera kuyamba pafupifupi pa msinkhu umodzi kapena pamwamba pang'ono pa pamwamba pa zilembo zazitali kwambiri pa mzere woyamba wa mawu mu mzati ndi kutha pafupifupi pa msinkhu umodzi ndi pansi pa zilembo zotsika kwambiri pa mzere wapansi."

msgid "The centre line may also be omitted, as most modern Bibles do."
msgstr "Mzere wapakati ungasiyidwenso, monga momwe Mabaibulo amakono ambiri amachitira."

msgid "The pages looks cleaner then."
msgstr "Masamba amawoneka oyera kwambiri."

msgid ""
"The Psalm headers need consistent spaces before and after and should be "
"positioned closer to the Psalm that follows than to the Psalm before."
msgstr "Mitu ya Masalimo imafunika mipata yofanana pamaso ndi pambuyo ndipo iyenera kuikidwa pafupi ndi Salimo lotsatira kuposa lapitalo."

msgid "A 10 mm margin is okay for the top and bottom margins."
msgstr "Mpata wa 10 mm ndi wabwino pa mipata yapamwamba ndi yapansi."

msgid "A 12 mm margin is good for the outer margin."
msgstr "Mpata wa 12 mm ndi wabwino pa mpata wakunja."

msgid "The inner margin needs slightly more, for example 14 mm."
msgstr "Mpata wamkati umafuna pang'ono kuposa, mwachitsanzo 14 mm."

msgid ""
"For singable Psalms, readability would be helped by distinguishing the verse "
"numbers visually."
msgstr "Pa Masalimo oimbidwa, kuwerengeka kungathandizidwe posiyanitsa manambala a mavesi mwa maonekedwe."

msgid ""
"It is helpful to distinguish the running head, perhaps by using a semi-bold "
"version of the same font."
msgstr "Nkothandiza kusiyanitsa mutu woyenda, mwina pogwiritsa ntchito mtundu wa hafu-wakuda wa zilembo zomwezo."

msgid ""
"One way in which the number of pages in a volume could be reduced without "
"loss of readability would be to choose a font with slightly shorter "
"ascenders and descenders and then tighten the leading (line spacing) "
"slightly."
msgstr "Njira imodzi yomwe chiwerengero cha masamba mu voliyumu chingachepetsedwe popanda kutaya kuwerengeka ndi kusankha zilembo zokhala ndi zazitali zazifupi pang'ono ndi kuchepetsa pang'ono mpata wa mizere."

msgid ""
"When producing PDF output, the text needs to be monochrome black, not black "
"consisting of three or four colours."
msgstr "Popanga zotsatira za PDF, mawu ayenera kukhala akuda amtundu umodzi, osati akuda opangidwa ndi mitundu itatu kapena inayi."

msgid ""
"The last line of a verse or paragraph should not appear on its own at the "
"top of a column."
msgstr "Mzere womaliza wa vesi kapena ndime usawonekere wokha pamwamba pa mzati."

msgid ""
"The typesetting software will have a setting for 'orphans' to control this."
msgstr "Pulogalamu yokonza zilembo idzakhala ndi zoikamo za 'orphans' kuwongolera izi."

msgid ""
"An elegant way of avoiding orphans is to increase or decrease the tracking "
"of the text."
msgstr "Njira yokongola yopewera orphans ndi kuwonjezera kapena kuchepetsa tracking ya mawu."

msgid ""
"This is the overall spacing of the letters in a paragraph or on a line."
msgstr "Uwu ndi mpata wonse wa zilembo mu ndime kapena pa mzere."

msgid "Avoid hyphenations in the headings."
msgstr "Pewani kugawa mawu m'masilabo mu mitu ya mawu."

msgid "It is helpful to remove all discretionary hyphens from the headings."
msgstr "Nkothandiza kuchotsa zizindikiro zonse zosankha za kugawa m'mitu ya mawu."

msgid ""
"Many book titles consist of a main title and a subtitle, like 'The gospel of "
"Matthew'."
msgstr "Mitu yambiri ya mabuku imakhala ndi mutu waukulu ndi mutu wachiwiri, monga 'Uthenga Wabwino wa Mateyu'."

msgid "'Matthew' is the main title, and the rest is the subtitle."
msgstr "'Mateyu' ndi mutu waukulu, ndipo zotsala ndi mutu wachiwiri."

msgid "It is good if there is a clear contrast on size between these two."
msgstr "Nkwabwino ngati pali kusiyana koonekeratu pa kukula pakati pa awiriwa."

msgid ""
"Say 24 points bold for the main title, and 14 points regular for the "
"subtitle."
msgstr "Tinene mapointi 24 zakuda pa mutu waukulu, ndi mapointi 14 zabwinobwino pa mutu wachiwiri."

msgid ""
"The number of hyphens used in a row should be few for enhanced readability."
msgstr "Chiwerengero cha zizindikiro za kugawa zogwiritsidwa ntchito motsatana chikhale chochepa kuti kuwerengeka kuwonjezeke."

msgid ""
"The number of hyphens used in a row should not amount to more than three "
"consecutive hyphenated lines."
msgstr "Chiwerengero cha zizindikiro za kugawa zogwiritsidwa ntchito motsatana siyenera kupitirira mizere itatu yotsatana yogawidwa."

msgid ""
"At times a word that is now hyphenated can be forced down onto the next "
"line, and become a non-hyphenated word there, without opening up the gaps "
"between the words too much on the line where the word came from."
msgstr "Nthawi zina mawu omwe tsopano agawidwa angakakamizidwe kupita ku mzere wotsatira, ndikukhala mawu osagawidwa kumeneko, popanda kutsegula kwambiri mipata pakati pa mawu pa mzere umene mawuwo anachokera."

msgid ""
"Hyphenation should be set to the optimum result for the column width but "
"then it is usually necessary to go over every page and make corrections "
"manually."
msgstr "Kugawa mawu m'masilabo kuyenera kukhazikitsidwa pa zotsatira zabwino pa kufalikira kwa mzati koma nthawi zambiri nkofunika kupita pa tsamba lililonse ndi kupanga zokonza pamanja."

msgid ""
"The main page numbering should start at the first page of Genesis, or "
"Matthew in case of New Testaments."
msgstr "Kuwerengera masamba kwakukulu kuyenera kuyamba pa tsamba loyamba la Genesis, kapena Mateyu pa Mapangano Atsopano."

msgid "To avoid what are sometimes referred to as 'rivers' in the text."
msgstr "Kuti mupewe zomwe nthawi zina zimatchedwa 'mitsinje' m'mawu."

msgid ""
"This is where large spaces between words cause rivers of white space to be "
"seen running through the text."
msgstr "Apa ndi pomwe mipata yaikulu pakati pa mawu imachititsa mitsinje ya malo oyera kuonekera ikuyenda m'mawu."

msgid ""
"The use of hyphenation or tracking adjustments are tools that can be used to "
"minimise the problem."
msgstr "Kugwiritsa ntchito kugawa mawu m'masilabo kapena kusintha tracking ndi zida zomwe zingagwiritsidwe ntchito kuchepetsa vutoli."

msgid "But as always they need to be used with discretion."
msgstr "Koma monga mwa nthawi zonse ziyenera kugwiritsidwa ntchito mwanzeru."

msgid "As a general rule text will be justified on the left and the right."
msgstr "Monga lamulo lalikulu mawu adzaikidwa mofanana kumanzere ndi kumanja."

msgid ""
"A word, part of a word, or very short line should not appear by itself at "
"the end of a paragraph."
msgstr "Mawu, gawo la mawu, kapena mzere waufupi kwambiri siuyenera kuoneka wokha kumapeto kwa ndime."

msgid ""
"This results in less much white space between paragraphs or at the bottom of "
"a page."
msgstr "Izi zimapangitsa malo oyera ochepa pakati pa ndime kapena pansi pa tsamba."

msgid ""
"The main page numbering starts at the first page of the text of the "
"Scripture."
msgstr "Kuwerengera masamba kwakukulu kumayamba pa tsamba loyamba la mawu a Malemba."

msgid ""
"This first page of Scripture starts on the recto for left to right reading "
"scripts."
msgstr "Tsamba loyamba la Malemba limayamba pa recto pa zolemba zowerengedwa kuchokera kumanzere kupita kumanja."

msgid "The recto is the right side of a two page spread."
msgstr "Recto ndi mbali yakumanja ya masamba awiri otseguka."

msgid "For right to left scripts it starts on the verso."
msgstr "Pa zolemba zowerengedwa kuchokera kumanja kupita kumanzere imayamba pa verso."

msgid "This is the left side of a two page spread."
msgstr "Iyi ndi mbali yakumanzere ya masamba awiri otseguka."

msgid ""
"Due to subheadings starting in a new column, there may be spaces at the foot "
"of pages."
msgstr "Chifukwa cha mitu yaing'ono yoyambira mu mzati watsopano, pangakhale mipata pansi pa masamba."

msgid ""
"They can be filled by carefully adjusting tracking in one of the paragraphs."
msgstr "Ingadzazidwe posintha mosamala tracking mu imodzi mwa ndime."

msgid "The paragraph would then take up an extra line to fill that space."
msgstr "Ndimeyo ingatenge mzere wowonjezera kudzaza mpatawo."

msgid ""
"It may not always be possible to fill gaps completely without creating "
"unsightly spacing within paragraphs."
msgstr "Sizingatheke nthawi zonse kudzaza mipata kwathunthu popanda kupanga mipata yoyipa mkati mwa ndime."

msgid "It needs to be handled with common sense."
msgstr "Zimafunika kuchitidwa mwanzeru wamba."

msgid "The typesetting"
msgstr "Kukonza zilembo"

msgid "The typesetting can be done in LibreOffice."
msgstr "Kukonza zilembo kungachitike mu LibreOffice."

msgid "Or in Scribus."
msgstr "Kapena mu Scribus."

msgid "This is free software."
msgstr "Iyi ndi mapulogalamu aulere."

msgid ""
"The organisation may want to use specialized typesetting software like Adobe "
"InDesign."
msgstr "Bungwe lingafune kugwiritsa ntchito mapulogalamu apadera okonza zilembo monga Adobe InDesign."

msgid "Scrum-based translation process."
msgstr "Njira yomasulira yozikidwa pa Scrum."

msgid "Transparent, fair, and argued discussions"
msgstr "Zokambirana zowonekera, zachilungamo, ndi zolingaliridwa"

msgid "Use of reliable Hebrew and Greek manuscripts."
msgstr "Kugwiritsa ntchito zolembedwa zodalirika za Chihebri ndi Chigiriki."

msgid "Looking for and depending on the help of the Lord Jesus."
msgstr "Kufunafuna ndi kudalira thandizo la Ambuye Yesu."

msgid "Use of modern tools and technology."
msgstr "Kugwiritsa ntchito zida ndi ukadaulo wamakono."

msgid ""
"Goal: Deliver a reliable Bible translation within a reasonable time frame."
msgstr "Cholinga: Kupereka kumasulira Baibulo kodalirika mu nthawi yoyenera."

msgid "Lean management"
msgstr "Kuyang'anira mwa njira ya lean"

msgid "Typesetting in LibreOffice"
msgstr "Kukonza zilembo mu LibreOffice"

msgid ""
"See the online help about typesetting for more information about some "
"general principles."
msgstr "Onani thandizo la pa intaneti lokhudza kukonza zilembo kuti mudziwe zambiri za mfundo zina zonse."

msgid "You have access to a copy of LibreOffice."
msgstr "Muli ndi mwayi wofikira kopi ya LibreOffice."

msgid "Page count"
msgstr "Chiwerengero cha masamba"

msgid ""
"Download the file with notes. It was exported above. It is called "
"00_Bible_notes.odt."
msgstr "Tsitsani fayilo yokhala ndi zolemba. Inatumizidwa kunja pamwambapa. Imatchedwa 00_Bible_notes.odt."

msgid "Open the file in LibreOffice."
msgstr "Tsegulani fayiloyo mu LibreOffice."

msgid ""
"Let it repaginate. A good way of doing this is to press Ctrl-P as if going "
"to print the document. Then it will repaginate. Cancel the print dialog."
msgstr "Ilekeni ipange masamba atsopano. Njira yabwino yochitira izi ndi kukanikiza Ctrl-P ngati mukupita kusindikiza chikalatacho. Kenako idzapanganso masamba. Letsani bokosi la kusindikiza."

msgid "It will now give the page count that the notes are likely to take up."
msgstr "Tsopano idzapereka chiwerengero cha masamba chomwe zolemba zingatenge."

msgid "In our case, this is about 300 pages."
msgstr "Mu nkhani yathu, izi ndi pafupifupi masamba 300."

msgid ""
"Each chapter has headings. These headings do not belong to the notes. Thus "
"the page count is too high."
msgstr "Mutu uliwonse uli ndi mitu ya mawu. Mitu imeneyi si ya zolemba. Choncho chiwerengero cha masamba ndi chokwera kwambiri."

msgid ""
"Notice that the paragraph style for these headings is called 'Heading 1'."
msgstr "Dziwani kuti kalembedwe ka ndime ka mitu imeneyi kamatchedwa 'Heading 1'."

msgid ""
"Hide the headings. This can be done like this. Right-click on a heading. "
"Choose 'Edit Paragraph Style'. A dialog comes up. Choose tab 'Font Effects'. "
"Tick option 'Hidden'."
msgstr "Bisani mitu ya mawu. Izi zitha kuchitidwa motere. Dinani kumanja pa mutu. Sankhani 'Edit Paragraph Style'. Bokosi limatuluka. Sankhani tabu 'Font Effects'. Chongani njira 'Hidden'."

msgid ""
"Repaginate, and notice the page count. In our case it is down to about 125."
msgstr "Pangani masamba atsopano, ndipo onani chiwerengero cha masamba. Mu nkhani yathu chatsika kufika pafupifupi 125."

msgid ""
"Download the OpenDocument file with text and note citations. It was exported "
"above. It is called 00_Bible_text_and_note_citations.odt."
msgstr "Tsitsani fayilo ya OpenDocument yokhala ndi mawu ndi mawu olozera a zolemba. Inatumizidwa kunja pamwambapa. Imatchedwa 00_Bible_text_and_note_citations.odt."

msgid "The document has only one column."
msgstr "Chikalatacho chili ndi mzati umodzi wokha."

msgid "Repaginate and notice the page count. In our case this is 1750."
msgstr "Pangani masamba atsopano ndipo onani chiwerengero cha masamba. Mu nkhani yathu ichi ndi 1750."

msgid ""
"This is not accurate since it applies to a column count of one rather than "
"two."
msgstr "Izi si zolondola chifukwa zimagwira ntchito pa mzati umodzi osati iwiri."

msgid "Set the whole document to have two columns."
msgstr "Khazikitsani chikalata chonse kukhala ndi mizati iwiri."

msgid ""
"Go to menu Format / Page. Choose the Columns tab. Choose two columns. Set "
"the spacing to 0.2 cm. Set a thin separator line. Click Ok."
msgstr "Pitani ku menyu Format / Page. Sankhani tabu ya Columns. Sankhani mizati iwiri. Khazikitsani mpata kukhala 0.2 cm. Khazikitsani mzere wopatula wopyapyala. Dinani Ok."

msgid "Repaginate and notice the page count. It is down to 1520."
msgstr "Pangani masamba atsopano ndipo onani chiwerengero cha masamba. Chatsika kufika 1520."

msgid "We are now able to estimate the page count for the entire Bible:"
msgstr "Tsopano tingathe kuyerekeza chiwerengero cha masamba a Baibulo lonse:"

msgid ""
"Text body 1520 pages. Notes 125 pages. Singable Psalms 200 pages. Estimated "
"total is 1845 pages."
msgstr "Thupi la mawu masamba 1520. Zolemba masamba 125. Masalimo oimbidwa masamba 200. Chiwerengero chonse choyerekezeka ndi masamba 1845."

msgid "Using LibreOffice for typesetting"
msgstr "Kugwiritsa ntchito LibreOffice pokonza zilembo"

msgid ""
"Having used LibreOffice for typesetting for some time, my experience is that "
"the program is suitable for typesetting Bibles."
msgstr "Nditagwiritsa ntchito LibreOffice pokonza zilembo kwa kanthawi, zomwe ndadziwa ndi zoti pulogalamuyi ndi yoyenera kukonza zilembo za Mabaibulo."

msgid ""
"I'd like to give some hints about how to do typographic work in LibreOffice."
msgstr "Ndikufuna kupereka malangizo okhudza momwe mungagwirire ntchito yokonza zilembo mu LibreOffice."

msgid ""
"To meet the requirement that line spacing be consistent throughout and be "
"placed line on line across all pages, do the following:"
msgstr "Kuti mukwaniritse chofunikira cha kuti mpata wa mizere ukhale wofanana paliponse ndi kuikidwa mzere pa mzere pa masamba onse, chitani izi:"

msgid ""
"Go to menu Format / Page, and enable Register-true. Set the reference style "
"to 'Text Body'. Press OK."
msgstr "Pitani ku menyu Format / Page, ndi kuyatsa Register-true. Khazikitsani kalembedwe kolozera kukhala 'Text Body'. Kanikizani OK."

msgid ""
"Select all the text, and go to menu Format / Paragraph, and activate "
"Register-true. Press OK."
msgstr "Sankhani mawu onse, ndi kupita ku menyu Format / Paragraph, ndi kuyatsa Register-true. Kanikizani OK."

msgid ""
"The line spacing specified by the paragraph style 'Text Body' is now used as "
"the reference line spacing for all paragraphs that have the register-true "
"feature enabled."
msgstr "Mpata wa mizere wotchulidwa ndi kalembedwe ka ndime 'Text Body' tsopano ukugwiritsidwa ntchito ngati mpata wolozera wa mizere pa ndime zonse zomwe zili ndi register-true yoyatsidwa."

msgid ""
"The line spacing in the document is going to be consistent. It will be equal "
"to the line spacing of the reference style 'Text Body', or a multiple of it."
msgstr "Mpata wa mizere mu chikalata udzakhala wofanana. Udzakhala wofanana ndi mpata wa mizere wa kalembedwe kolozera 'Text Body', kapena kuchulukitsa kwake."

msgid "Changing the line spacing."
msgstr "Kusintha mpata wa mizere."

msgid "Change the line spacing in paragraph style 'Text Body'."
msgstr "Sinthani mpata wa mizere mu kalembedwe ka ndime 'Text Body'."

msgid "Press F11 to get the Styles and Formatting dialog."
msgstr "Kanikizani F11 kuti mupeze bokosi la Styles and Formatting."

msgid "Locate style 'Text Body'."
msgstr "Pezani kalembedwe 'Text Body'."

msgid "Right-click it with the mouse, and choose menu Modify."
msgstr "Dinani kumanja nako ndi mbewa, ndi kusankha menyu Modify."

msgid "Go to tab Indents & Spacing."
msgstr "Pitani ku tabu Indents & Spacing."

msgid ""
"Adjust the spacing above the paragraph, the spacing below the paragrap, and "
"the line spacing. Press OK."
msgstr "Sinthani mpata pamwamba pa ndime, mpata pansi pa ndime, ndi mpata wa mizere. Kanikizani OK."

msgid ""
"It may happen that some paragraphs in the text used to have a line spacing "
"equal to the line spacing of style 'Text Body', but now suddenly take up a "
"multiple of it. This may happen when you have tightened the line spacing a "
"bit."
msgstr "Zingachitike kuti ndime zina m'mawu zinali ndi mpata wa mizere wofanana ndi mpata wa mizere wa kalembedwe 'Text Body', koma tsopano mwadzidzidzi zimatenga kuchulukitsa kwake. Izi zingachitike mukachepetsa pang'ono mpata wa mizere."

msgid ""
"To resolve this, make the line spacing of those paragraphs smaller than the "
"line spacing of style 'Text body'."
msgstr "Kuti muthetse izi, pangani mpata wa mizere wa ndime zimenezo kukhala wocheperako kuposa mpata wa mizere wa kalembedwe 'Text body'."

msgid "Updating a paragraph style."
msgstr "Kusintha kalembedwe ka ndime."

msgid ""
"After exporting USFM text to OpenDocument, the paragraph styles of the USFM "
"document appear in LibreOffice."
msgstr "Pambuyo potumiza mawu a USFM ku OpenDocument, makalembedwe a ndime a chikalata cha USFM amawonekera mu LibreOffice."

msgid ""
"To update a paragraph style, right-click the text of this paragraph, and "
"choose menu Edit Paragraph Style..., and make the desired settings."
msgstr "Kuti musinthe kalembedwe ka ndime, dinani kumanja pa mawu a ndime iyi, ndi kusankha menyu Edit Paragraph Style..., ndi kupanga zoikamo zomwe mukufuna."

msgid "Exporting to PDF."
msgstr "Kutumiza ku PDF."

msgid "See menu File / Export as PDF."
msgstr "Onani menyu File / Export as PDF."

msgid "Hiding the soft hyphens and non-breaking spaces."
msgstr "Kubisa zizindikiro zofewa za kugawa ndi mipata yosasweka."

msgid ""
"The soft hyphens and the non-breaking spaces are visible as grey fields that "
"clutter the page. To hide them, do this:"
msgstr "Zizindikiro zofewa za kugawa ndi mipata yosasweka zimawoneka ngati madera a imvi omwe amadzaza tsamba. Kuti muwabise, chitani izi:"

msgid "Go to menu Tools / Options."
msgstr "Pitani ku menyu Tools / Options."

msgid "Go to LibreOffice Writer / Formatting Aids."
msgstr "Pitani ku LibreOffice Writer / Formatting Aids."

msgid "Untick display of custom hyphens."
msgstr "Chotsani chizindikiro pa kuwonetsa zizindikiro zosankha za kugawa."

msgid "Untick display of non-breaking spaces."
msgstr "Chotsani chizindikiro pa kuwonetsa mipata yosasweka."

msgid "Install Bibledit on Android"
msgstr "Ikani Bibledit pa Android"

msgid "Install Bibledit from Google Play."
msgstr "Ikani Bibledit kuchokera ku Google Play."

msgid "Give it a while to initialize."
msgstr "Ipatseni nthawi yoti iyambike."

msgid "Alternative installation options:"
msgstr "Njira zina zoikira:"

msgid "Versions"
msgstr "Mitundu"

msgid ""
"There is a Bibledit version for Windows, for the Mac, for Android, for iOS, "
"and for Linux."
msgstr "Pali mtundu wa Bibledit wa Windows, wa Mac, wa Android, wa iOS, ndi wa Linux."

msgid "These are all client editions of Bibledit."
msgstr "Zonsezi ndi mitundu ya makasitomala ya Bibledit."

msgid "There is also a server edition of Bibledit."
msgstr "Palinso mtundu wa seva wa Bibledit."

msgid "That is 'Bibledit Cloud'."
msgstr "Umenewo ndi 'Bibledit Cloud'."

msgid "It runs on the web."
msgstr "Imayenda pa intaneti."

msgid ""
"Bibledit Cloud has more capabilities than the standard Bibledit editions."
msgstr "Bibledit Cloud ili ndi luso lochulukirapo kuposa mitundu yabwinobwino ya Bibledit."

msgid ""
"The standard Bibledit editions connect to an instance of Bibledit Cloud for "
"collaboration, keeping the devices in sync, and for backup."
msgstr "Mitundu yabwinobwino ya Bibledit imalumikizana ndi Bibledit Cloud kuti agwirizane pa ntchito, kusunga zipangizo mu mgwirizano, ndi kusunga kopi."

msgid ""
"All Bibledit editions, including Bibledit Cloud, enable Bible translation."
msgstr "Mitundu yonse ya Bibledit, kuphatikizapo Bibledit Cloud, imalola kumasulira Baibulo."

msgid ""
"With a fast internet connection, it is usually easiest to translate straight "
"in Bibledit Cloud through the web browser."
msgstr "Ndi intaneti yachangu, nthawi zambiri kumakhala kosavuta kumasulira mwachindunji mu Bibledit Cloud kudzera msakatuli."

msgid ""
"When the internet connection is slow, or when it is off at times, it is "
"recommended to translate through one of the standard Bibledit versions."
msgstr "Pamene intaneti ndi yapang'onopang'ono, kapena nthawi zina yazimitsidwa, tikulangiza kumasulira kudzera mu imodzi mwa mitundu yabwinobwino ya Bibledit."

msgid ""
"The changes made in this way can be synchronized with Bibledit Cloud through "
"Send/receive."
msgstr "Zosintha zopangidwa motere zitha kugwirizanitsidwa ndi Bibledit Cloud kudzera mu Tumiza/Landira."

msgid "Bibledit on Windows"
msgstr "Bibledit pa Windows"

msgid "Bibledit on Android"
msgstr "Bibledit pa Android"

msgid "Bibledit on macOS"
msgstr "Bibledit pa macOS"

msgid "Bibledit on Linux"
msgstr "Bibledit pa Linux"

msgid "Bibledit on iOS"
msgstr "Bibledit pa iOS"

msgid "Bibledit on Chrome OS"
msgstr "Bibledit pa Chrome OS"

msgid "Bibledit Cloud on Linux"
msgstr "Bibledit Cloud pa Linux"

msgid "Upgrading"
msgstr "Kukweza mtundu"

msgid ""
"A certain release of Bibledit can upgrade the most recent previous release, "
"but not older releases."
msgstr "Mtundu wina wa Bibledit ukhoza kukweza mtundu waposachedwa wapitawo, koma osati mitundu yakale."

msgid "A new release can be installed over the previous release."
msgstr "Mtundu watsopano ukhoza kuikidwa pamwamba pa mtundu wapitawo."

msgid "There should be no loss of information."
msgstr "Sipayenera kukhala kutaya kwa zidziwitso."

msgid ""
"Create a backup of the Bibledit folder before upgrading, just to be sure."
msgstr "Pangani kopi yosungira ya foda ya Bibledit musanakweze mtundu, kungoti mukhale otsimikiza."

msgid "Clients"
msgstr "Makasitomala"

msgid "The various Bibledit client editions store the data offline."
msgstr "Mitundu yosiyanasiyana ya makasitomala ya Bibledit imasunga deta popanda intaneti."

msgid "You can translate the Bible on a client."
msgstr "Mutha kumasulira Baibulo pa kasitomala."

msgid ""
"The user needs to regularly synchronize the data on the client with the data "
"on Bibledit Cloud."
msgstr "Wogwiritsa ntchito ayenera kugwirizanitsa nthawi zonse deta pa kasitomala ndi deta pa Bibledit Cloud."

msgid ""
"A Client is useful when the Internet connection to Bibledit Cloud is not "
"fast or not stable."
msgstr "Kasitomala ndi wothandiza pamene intaneti yolumikizana ndi Bibledit Cloud siili yachangu kapena yokhazikika."

msgid ""
"In the Bibledit client, connect to Bibledit Cloud once, and provide your "
"username and password as you normally log in on Bibledit Cloud."
msgstr "Mu kasitomala wa Bibledit, lumikizani ku Bibledit Cloud kamodzi, ndi kupereka dzina lanu logwiritsa ntchito ndi mawu achinsinsi monga mumalowera nthawi zambiri mu Bibledit Cloud."

msgid "Also provide the port number."
msgstr "Perekaninso nambala ya doko."

msgid "Then synchronize the data."
msgstr "Kenako gwirizanitsani deta."

msgid ""
"The first time the client will download all Bible data and Notes from "
"Bibledit Cloud and store it offline."
msgstr "Nthawi yoyamba kasitomala adzatsitsa deta yonse ya Baibulo ndi Zolemba kuchokera ku Bibledit Cloud ndi kuzisunga popanda intaneti."

msgid "That may take a while."
msgstr "Zimenezo zingatenge nthawi."

msgid "After that, synchronizing will send and receive the changes only."
msgstr "Pambuyo pake, kugwirizanitsa kudzatumiza ndi kulandira zosintha zokha."

msgid ""
"The client mode is useful in a situation where the Internet connection is "
"not optimal."
msgstr "Njira ya kasitomala ndi yothandiza pa mkhalidwe pomwe intaneti siiri yabwino."

msgid "All data is stored locally on your computing device."
msgstr "Deta yonse imasungidwa pa chipangizo chanu cha kompyuta."

msgid "During translation, the Internet connection is not used."
msgstr "Pamene mukumasulira, intaneti siigwiritsidwa ntchito."

msgid "It is used during synchronization."
msgstr "Imagwiritsidwa ntchito pamene mukugwirizanitsa."

msgid "Bibledit Cloud works with email."
msgstr "Bibledit Cloud imagwira ntchito ndi imelo."

msgid ""
"After completing the installation of Bibledit, sending and receiving emails "
"does not yet work."
msgstr "Mukamaliza kuika Bibledit, kutumiza ndi kulandira maimelo sikugwirabe ntchito."

msgid "This needs to be set up."
msgstr "Izi zimafunika kukhazikitsidwa."

msgid ""
"Setting up the email means to pick an email address and setting details for "
"the mail servers in Bibledit."
msgstr "Kukhazikitsa imelo kumatanthauza kusankha adilesi ya imelo ndi kukhazikitsa zambiri za ma seva a imelo mu Bibledit."

msgid "This can be done from within the web application."
msgstr "Izi zingachitike kuchokera mkati mwa pulogalamu ya pa intaneti."

msgid "Multiple translation teams"
msgstr "Magulu angapo omasulira"

msgid "There are two ways to have multiple translation teams on one server."
msgstr "Pali njira ziwiri zokhalira ndi magulu angapo omasulira pa seva imodzi."

msgid "Install multiple parallel copies of Bibledit on one server."
msgstr "Ikani makopi angapo ofanana a Bibledit pa seva imodzi."

msgid ""
"Unpack the installation zip archive in sub folders with different names."
msgstr "Tsegulani chikwatu cha zip cha kuika mu zikwatu zazing'ono zokhala ndi mayina osiyana."

msgid "Each copy has its own web address."
msgstr "Kopi iliyonse ili ndi adilesi yake ya intaneti."

msgid "Everything is completely separated between the parallel copies."
msgstr "Chilichonse chimasiyanitsidwa kwathunthu pakati pa makopi ofanana."

msgid "This includes the data and the databases."
msgstr "Izi zimaphatikizapo deta ndi nkhokwe za deta."

msgid "Every copy has its own independent databases."
msgstr "Kopi iliyonse ili ndi nkhokwe zake zodziimira za deta."

msgid "Use one installation of Bibledit."
msgstr "Gwiritsani ntchito kuika kumodzi kwa Bibledit."

msgid "Give various users read or write access to various Bibles."
msgstr "Patsani ogwiritsa ntchito osiyanasiyana chilolezo chowerenga kapena kulemba ku Mabaibulo osiyanasiyana."

msgid ""
"Users with write access together constitute a translation team that can edit "
"the Bible."
msgstr "Ogwiritsa ntchito omwe ali ndi chilolezo cholemba amapanga gulu lomasulira lomwe lingasinthe Baibulo."

msgid "Source code"
msgstr "Khodi yoyambira"

msgid "The Bibledit source code is kept in git repositories."
msgstr "Khodi yoyambira ya Bibledit imasungidwa mu nkhokwe za git."

msgid "Hosting"
msgstr "Kusunga pa seva"

msgid ""
"To run Bibledit Cloud, a Linux VPS (virtual private server) is needed."
msgstr "Kuti muyendetse Bibledit Cloud, pamafunika Linux VPS (seva yachinsinsi yeniyeni)."

msgid "Good providers are:"
msgstr "Operekera abwino ndi:"

msgid ""
"Several Bibledit users offer free assistance in setting up inexpensive "
"server hosting for Bibledit."
msgstr "Ogwiritsa ntchito ena a Bibledit amapereka thandizo laulere pokhazikitsa kusunga seva kwa mtengo wotsika kwa Bibledit."

msgid "If you would like this assistance, post a message to:"
msgstr "Ngati mukufuna thandizo limeneli, tumizani uthenga ku:"

msgid "Security"
msgstr "Chitetezo"

msgid ""
"There are various ways to improve the security of working with Bibledit."
msgstr "Pali njira zosiyanasiyana zowonjezerera chitetezo cha kugwira ntchito ndi Bibledit."

msgid ""
"Securing traffic between a users' browsers and Bibledit Cloud, and between "
"Bibledit clients and Bibledit Cloud."
msgstr "Kuteteza kuyenda kwa deta pakati pa ma msakatuli a ogwiritsa ntchito ndi Bibledit Cloud, ndi pakati pa makasitomala a Bibledit ndi Bibledit Cloud."

msgid "Obfuscating Bibledit Cloud and Bibledit Linux clients."
msgstr "Kubisa Bibledit Cloud ndi makasitomala a Bibledit Linux."

msgid "Accessing Bibledit Cloud through a Tor browser."
msgstr "Kufikira Bibledit Cloud kudzera mu msakatuli wa Tor."

msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Kukonza"

msgid "Here is more information about how to configure Bibledit Cloud."
msgstr "Nazi zambiri za momwe mungakonzere Bibledit Cloud."

msgid "Install Bibledit on macOS"
msgstr "Ikani Bibledit pa macOS"

msgid "This assumes a standard installation of the operating system."
msgstr "Izi zimaganiza kuti dongosolo logwiritsira ntchito laikidwa mwanjira yabwinobwino."

msgid "Install Bibledit from the App Store."
msgstr "Ikani Bibledit kuchokera ku App Store."

msgid "Download Bibledit.zip from"
msgstr "Tsitsani Bibledit.zip kuchokera ku"

msgid "Unpack it."
msgstr "Tsegulani."

msgid "But most likely macOS will already have done this for you."
msgstr "Koma mwina macOS yachita izi kale m'malo mwanu."

msgid "Drag Bibledit to the Applications folder."
msgstr "Kokerani Bibledit ku foda ya Applications."

msgid "Start it from the Applications."
msgstr "Iyambitseni kuchokera ku Applications."

msgid "Open Bibledit."
msgstr "Tsegulani Bibledit."

msgid "Bibledit is ready for online and offline use."
msgstr "Bibledit ndi yokonzeka kugwiritsa ntchito ndi intaneti komanso popanda."

msgid ""
"Swiping right or left while displaying resources navigates to the previous "
"or next verse."
msgstr "Kusuntha chala kumanja kapena kumanzere pamene magwero akuwonetsedwa kumapita ku vesi lapitalo kapena lotsatira."

msgid "The same applies to the two verse-based Bible text editors."
msgstr "Zomwezo zimagwira ntchito pa zosintha ziwiri za mawu a Baibulo zozikidwa pa vesi."

msgid ""
"Swiping right or left in the two chapter-based Bible text editors navigates "
"to the previous of next chapter."
msgstr "Kusuntha chala kumanja kapena kumanzere mu zosintha ziwiri za mawu a Baibulo zozikidwa pa mutu kumapita ku mutu wapitawo kapena wotsatira."

msgid "Install Bibledit on Linux"
msgstr "Ikani Bibledit pa Linux"

msgid "Supported Linux distributions:"
msgstr "Mitundu ya Linux yothandizidwa:"

msgid "Install Bibledit on Ubuntu and derivatives."
msgstr "Ikani Bibledit pa Ubuntu ndi zomwe zachokera mwa iyo."

msgid "Other Linux distributions:"
msgstr "Mitundu ina ya Linux:"

msgid "Follow the steps below to install Bibledit"
msgstr "Tsatirani njira zomwe zili pansipa kuti muike Bibledit"

msgid "Download the Bibledit Linux installer"
msgstr "Tsitsani choikira cha Bibledit Linux"

msgid "Put it in the home directory."
msgstr "Chiikeni mu chikwatu chakunyumba."

msgid "Run the installer:"
msgstr "Yendetsani choikiracho:"

msgid "Bibledit is an application for translating the Bible."
msgstr "Bibledit ndi pulogalamu yomasulira Baibulo."

msgid "People can sign up for an account and log in."
msgstr "Anthu angalembetse akaunti ndi kulowa."

msgid "Each user has a certain role within the application."
msgstr "Wogwiritsa ntchito aliyense ali ndi udindo wina mkati mwa pulogalamuyi."

msgid ""
"The first role is Member. A member is somebody who has signed up to the "
"site, and has confirmed this signup through his email."
msgstr "Udindo woyamba ndi Membala. Membala ndi munthu amene walembetsa pa tsambalo, ndipo watsimikizira kulembetsa kumeneku kudzera mu imelo yake."

msgid ""
"The second role is Consultant. Consultants are people who can be consulted "
"because of their knowledge of the original language such as Hebrew or Greek, "
"or because of their knowledge of their target language in case they are "
"language scholars, or for any other knowledge they have."
msgstr "Udindo wachiwiri ndi Mlangizi. Alangizi ndi anthu omwe angafunsidwe chifukwa cha chidziwitso chawo cha chilankhulo choyambirira monga Chihebri kapena Chigiriki, kapena chifukwa cha chidziwitso chawo cha chilankhulo chawo chofunidwa ngati ali akatswiri a zilankhulo, kapena chifukwa cha chidziwitso china chilichonse chomwe ali nacho."

msgid ""
"The next role is Translator. These are the ones that have all the rights of "
"the Consultant, but in addition can change the Bible text."
msgstr "Udindo wotsatira ndi Womasulira. Awa ndi omwe ali ndi maufulu onse a Mlangizi, koma kuwonjezera apo angasinthe mawu a Baibulo."

msgid ""
"Then there's the Manager. The manager has all the privileges of the previous "
"levels, but in addition can add books to the Bible, delete books, add "
"chapters, copy Bibles, and so on. The manager can assign privileges to the "
"translators, consultants, and so on."
msgstr "Kenako pali Woyang'anira. Woyang'anira ali ndi maufulu onse a magawo apitawo, koma kuwonjezera apo angawonjezere mabuku ku Baibulo, kuchotsa mabuku, kuwonjezera mitu, kukopera Mabaibulo, ndi zina zotero. Woyang'anira angapatse maufulu kwa omasulira, alangizi, ndi zina zotero."

msgid ""
"Finally, there is the Administrator. The administrator has all rights to do "
"anything, and will do the technical setup and maintenance of the site."
msgstr "Pomaliza, pali Woyang'anira Wamkulu. Woyang'anira Wamkulu ali ndi maufulu onse ochita chilichonse, ndipo adzachita kukhazikitsa kwaukadaulo ndi kusamalira tsambalo."

msgid ""
"Everybody who has an account can enable the personal notifications. Those "
"who have switched the relevant notifications on can receive email from "
"Bibledit. They receive email when new consultation notes get created, or "
"when consultation notes get changed, or when consultation notes get assigned "
"to them. They can also get automatic daily email detailing the changes that "
"have been made in the Bible since the previous email."
msgstr "Aliyense amene ali ndi akaunti angayatse zidziwitso zaumwini. Omwe ayatsa zidziwitso zoyenera angalandire imelo kuchokera ku Bibledit. Amalandira imelo pamene zolemba zatsopano za upangiri zapangidwa, kapena pamene zolemba za upangiri zasinthidwa, kapena pamene zolemba za upangiri zaperekedwa kwa iwo. Angalandirenso imelo yadzidzidzi ya tsiku ndi tsiku yofotokoza zosintha zomwe zapangidwa mu Baibulo kuyambira imelo yapitayi."

msgid ""
"Everybody who has an account can create consultation notes by email, and "
"respond to these by email."
msgstr "Aliyense amene ali ndi akaunti angapange zolemba za upangiri ndi imelo, ndi kuziyankha ndi imelo."

msgid ""
"Members can view and download all exported Bibles and lists with recent "
"changes in the Bibles."
msgstr "Mamembala angawone ndi kutsitsa Mabaibulo onse otumizidwa kunja ndi mindandanda ya zosintha zaposachedwa mu Mabaibulo."

msgid ""
"Consultants can create consultation notes online, view these, set parameters "
"for these, assign the notes to people, and delete notes."
msgstr "Alangizi angapange zolemba za upangiri pa intaneti, kuziwona, kukhazikitsa magawo ake, kupereka zolemba kwa anthu, ndi kuchotsa zolemba."

msgid "Translators can do the following things:"
msgstr "Omasulira angachite zinthu izi:"

msgid "Edit the Bible text."
msgstr "Sintha mawu a Baibulo."

msgid "Switch the stylesheet."
msgstr "Sinthani tsamba la masitayilo."

msgid "View and suppress results of the automatic checks."
msgstr "Onani ndi kubisa zotsatira za kuyang'ana kwadzidzidzi."

msgid "Managers can do several things:"
msgstr "Oyang'anira angachite zinthu zingapo:"

msgid "Edit the Bible in raw USFM format."
msgstr "Sintha Baibulo mu mtundu wa USFM wosakonzedwa."

msgid ""
"Send and receive the Bible text. This means that they can synchronize the "
"Bible text with a remote git repository. In this way they can collaborate "
"with people who use Bibledit-Gtk."
msgstr "Tumiza ndi kulandira mawu a Baibulo. Izi zikutanthauza kuti angagwirizanitse mawu a Baibulo ndi nkhokwe ya git yakutali. Mwanjira imeneyi angagwirizane ndi anthu ogwiritsa ntchito Bibledit-Gtk."

msgid "View and clear the logbook."
msgstr "Onani ndi kuchotsa buku la zolemba."

msgid ""
"Process the changes, so that lists are created, and email is sent out."
msgstr "Konzani zosintha, kuti mindandanda ipangidwe, ndi imelo itumizidwe."

msgid "View and edit people who have an account, and create new accounts."
msgstr "Onani ndi kusintha anthu omwe ali ndi akaunti, ndi kupanga maakaunti atsopano."

msgid "Create and delete Bibles, books, chapters, and import USFM data."
msgstr "Pangani ndi kuchotsa Mabaibulo, mabuku, mitu, ndi kutenga deta ya USFM."

msgid ""
"Initiate the daily export of selected Bibles to OpenDocument, USFM, html, "
"Online Bible."
msgstr "Yambitsani kutumiza kunja kwa tsiku ndi tsiku kwa Mabaibulo osankhidwa ku OpenDocument, USFM, html, Online Bible."

msgid "Create and edit versification systems."
msgstr "Pangani ndi kusintha madongosolo a mavesi."

msgid "Create and edit stylesheets."
msgstr "Pangani ndi kusintha matsamba a masitayilo."

msgid "Import consultation notes from Bibledit-Gtk and remove duplicates."
msgstr "Tengani zolemba za upangiri kuchokera ku Bibledit-Gtk ndi kuchotsa zobwerezabwereza."

msgid "Deal with automatic hyphenation when exporting to OpenDocument."
msgstr "Samalirani kugawa mawu m'masilabo kwadzidzidzi potumiza ku OpenDocument."

msgid ""
"Make settings for the automatic check and select Bibles to run them on."
msgstr "Pangani zoikamo za kuyang'ana kwadzidzidzi ndi kusankha Mabaibulo oti ayendetsedweko."

msgid "Administrator can do several things:"
msgstr "Woyang'anira Wamkulu angachite zinthu zingapo:"

msgid "Set up Bibledit's email account."
msgstr "Khazikitsani akaunti ya imelo ya Bibledit."

msgid ""
"Set up collaboration through setting up a connection with a remote git "
"repository."
msgstr "Khazikitsani kugwirizana pa ntchito pokhazikitsa kulumikizana ndi nkhokwe ya git yakutali."

msgid "Maintain the databases."
msgstr "Sungani nkhokwe za deta."

msgid "Set the site's timezone."
msgstr "Khazikitsani nthawi ya dera ya tsambalo."

msgid "Set the site's language."
msgstr "Khazikitsani chilankhulo cha tsambalo."

msgid "Install Bibledit Cloud from source"
msgstr "Ikani Bibledit Cloud kuchokera ku khodi yoyambira"

msgid "Select the Linux distribution for which to show instructions."
msgstr "Sankhani mtundu wa Linux womwe mukufuna kuwonetsa malangizo ake."

msgid "Then follow the steps below to install Bibledit Cloud."
msgstr "Kenako tsatirani njira zomwe zili pansipa kuti muike Bibledit Cloud."

msgid "Update the software sources."
msgstr "Sinthani magwero a mapulogalamu."

msgid "Install and enable extra package repositories."
msgstr "Ikani ndi kuyatsa nkhokwe zowonjezera za mapaketi."

msgid "Install the software Bibledit relies on:"
msgstr "Ikani mapulogalamu omwe Bibledit imadalira:"

msgid "Go to the home directory."
msgstr "Pitani ku chikwatu chakunyumba."

msgid "Download a recent version of Bibledit."
msgstr "Tsitsani mtundu waposachedwa wa Bibledit."

msgid "Unpack the downloaded Bibledit in folder bibledit."
msgstr "Tsegulani Bibledit yotsitsidwa mu foda bibledit."

msgid ""
"Change the xxx above to the version number of Bibledit that was downloaded."
msgstr "Sinthani xxx pamwambapa kukhala nambala ya mtundu wa Bibledit yomwe yatsitsidwa."

msgid "Change to the directory."
msgstr "Pitani ku chikwatu."

msgid "Build Bibledit."
msgstr "Pangani Bibledit."

msgid "This takes a while."
msgstr "Izi zimatenga nthawi."

msgid "There will be many technical messages, but there should be no errors."
msgstr "Padzakhala mauthenga ambiri a ukadaulo, koma sipayenera kukhala zolakwika."

msgid "Open port 8080 in the firewall."
msgstr "Tsegulani doko 8080 mu firewall."

msgid "Start Bibledit."
msgstr "Yambitsani Bibledit."

msgid "Most of Bibledit Cloud will now be working."
msgstr "Zambiri za Bibledit Cloud tsopano zigwira ntchito."

msgid ""
"To get email services working, connect Bibledit to a gmail or other mail "
"account."
msgstr "Kuti ntchito za imelo zigwire ntchito, lumikizani Bibledit ku akaunti ya gmail kapena ina ya imelo."

msgid "To get SWORD resources working, install the SWORD libraries."
msgstr "Kuti magwero a SWORD agwire ntchito, ikani malaibulale a SWORD."

msgid ""
"Bibledit assists with checking how consistent words have been translated in "
"the Bible."
msgstr "Bibledit imathandiza kuyang'ana momwe mawu amamasuliridwira mofanana mu Baibulo."

msgid "The suggested work-flow for consistency checking is this:"
msgstr "Njira yogwirira ntchito yoperekedwa yoyang'ana kugwirizana ndi iyi:"

msgid ""
"Create a Consultation Note, and enter the details of the desired consistency "
"check, plus the passages to check."
msgstr "Pangani Cholemba cha Upangiri, ndi kulowetsa zambiri za kuyang'ana kugwirizana komwe mukufuna, kuphatikiza ndime zoyenera kuyang'anidwa."

msgid "Open the Consistency tool in a new tab."
msgstr "Tsegulani chida cha Kugwirizana mu tabu yatsopano."

msgid ""
"Copy the passages from the Consultation Note and paste them in the "
"Consistency tool."
msgstr "Koperani ndime kuchokera ku Cholemba cha Upangiri ndi kuziika mu chida cha Kugwirizana."

msgid ""
"Enter the desired translation or translations in the Consistency tool."
msgstr "Lowetsani kumasulira kapena kumasulira komwe mukufuna mu chida cha Kugwirizana."

msgid ""
"The Consistency tool will display the verse texts from the active Bible."
msgstr "Chida cha Kugwirizana chidzawonetsa mawu a mavesi kuchokera ku Baibulo logwira ntchito."

msgid "It will mark the translations in the verse."
msgstr "Chidzalemba kumasulira mu vesi."

msgid "To make corrections, click a Passage."
msgstr "Kuti mupange zokonza, dinani Ndime."

msgid "The text editor will open at the correct chapter and verse."
msgstr "Chosintha cha mawu chidzatsegulidwa pa mutu ndi vesi lolondola."

msgid "Changes can be made in the text."
msgstr "Zosintha zingapangidwe m'mawu."

msgid "The Consistency tool will display any updates in the Bible."
msgstr "Chida cha Kugwirizana chidzawonetsa zosintha zilizonse mu Baibulo."

msgid "The Consistency tool can display extra Bibles."
msgstr "Chida cha Kugwirizana chingawonetse Mabaibulo owonjezera."

msgid "This assists the checking process."
msgstr "Izi zimathandiza pa kuyang'ana."

msgid "Several pages have a Passage Navigator on top."
msgstr "Masamba angapo ali ndi Chowongolera cha Ndime pamwamba."

msgid "It consists of the name of the book, the chapter, and the verse."
msgstr "Chimakhala ndi dzina la buku, mutu, ndi vesi."

msgid "Matthew 1:1."
msgstr "Mateyu 1:1."

msgid "The navigator enables you to go to another passage."
msgstr "Chowongoleracho chimakulolani kupita ku ndime ina."

msgid "Click on the name of the book to navigate to another book."
msgstr "Dinani dzina la buku kuti mupite ku buku lina."

msgid "In the same way you can click on the chapter and on the verse."
msgstr "Momwemonso mutha kudina mutu ndi vesi."

msgid "You can also use the keyboard to navigate."
msgstr "Mutha kugwiritsanso ntchito kiyibodi kuyenda."

msgid "On touch screens you can swipe to navigate."
msgstr "Pa zinsalu zokhudza mutha kusuntha chala kuti muyende."

msgid "The Navigator shows two arrows:"
msgstr "Chowongolera chimawonetsa mivi iwiri:"

msgid "Clicking"
msgstr "Kudina"

msgid "goes back in the navigation history."
msgstr "kubwerera m'mbiri ya kuyenda."

msgid "goes forward in the navigation history."
msgstr "kupita patsogolo m'mbiri ya kuyenda."

msgid "There are also keyboard shortcuts for it."
msgstr "Palinso njira zazifupi za kiyibodi za izi."

msgid "A long click on any of these two arrows brings up the history menu."
msgstr "Kudina kwautali pa mivi iliyonse mwa iwiri iyi kumabweretsa menyu ya mbiri."

msgid "Some pages display one or more clickable passages."
msgstr "Masamba ena amawonetsa ndime imodzi kapena zingapo zodinika."

msgid "Clicking them updates the Passage Navigator."
msgstr "Kuzidina kumasintha Chowongolera cha Ndime."

msgid "Username or email address:"
msgstr "Dzina la wogwiritsa ntchito kapena adilesi ya imelo:"

msgid "Forgot password?"
msgstr "Mwaiwala mawu achinsinsi?"

msgid "Not registered?"
msgstr "Simunalembetse?"

msgid "Sign up!"
msgstr "Lembetsani!"

msgid "Signup"
msgstr "Kulembetsa"

msgid "Your account is pending."
msgstr "Akaunti yanu ikudikira."

msgid "A verification email has been sent."
msgstr "Imelo yotsimikizira yatumizidwa."

msgid "Follow the instructions in the email to activate your account."
msgstr "Tsatirani malangizo omwe ali mu imelo kuti muyambitse akaunti yanu."

msgid "Switched user"
msgstr "Wogwiritsa ntchito wasinthidwa"

msgid "You have now logged in on behalf of another user:"
msgstr "Tsopano mwalowa m'malo mwa wogwiritsa ntchito wina:"

msgid ""
"To go back to your own username, log this user out, and then login with your "
"own credentials."
msgstr "Kuti mubwerere ku dzina lanu logwiritsa ntchito, tulutsani wogwiritsa ntchito uyu, kenako lowani ndi zidziwitso zanu."

msgid "Which username would you like to use?"
msgstr "Mukufuna kugwiritsa ntchito dzina liti?"

msgid "Which password?"
msgstr "Mawu achinsinsi ndi ati?"

msgid "Your email address?"
msgstr "Adilesi yanu ya imelo?"

msgid "Security question:"
msgstr "Funso lachitetezo:"

msgid "Hint for answering the security question:"
msgstr "Chidziwitso cha kuyankha funso lachitetezo:"

msgid ""
"Submit your username or email address, and instructions will be emailed to "
"you."
msgstr "Tumizani dzina lanu logwiritsa ntchito kapena adilesi ya imelo, ndipo malangizo adzatumizidwa kwa inu ndi imelo."

msgid "Identification"
msgstr "Kuzindikiritsa"

msgid ""
"File identification information (name of file, book name, language, last "
"edited, date, etc.)"
msgstr "Zidziwitso zozindikiritsa fayilo (dzina la fayilo, dzina la buku, chilankhulo, nthawi yomaliza kusinthidwa, tsiku, ndi zina)"

msgid "USFM version"
msgstr "Mtundu wa USFM"

msgid ""
"USFM version specification for the file. Used to identify the USFM version "
"which a USFM editor / processor will be required to support in order to "
"manage all markup found within the file."
msgstr "Kutchula mtundu wa USFM wa fayilo. Kumagwiritsidwa ntchito kuzindikira mtundu wa USFM womwe chosintha / pulosesa ya USFM ikuyenera kuthandizira kuti ithe kuyang'anira zizindikiro zonse zopezeka mu fayiloyo."

msgid "Encoding"
msgstr "Kulemba kwa zilembo"

msgid ""
"File encoding information. Bibledit disregards this marker, as all text in "
"Bibledit is in UTF-8 encoding."
msgstr "Zidziwitso za kulemba kwa zilembo kwa fayilo. Bibledit imanyalanyaza chizindikirochi, chifukwa mawu onse mu Bibledit ali mu UTF-8."

msgid "Project text status tracking."
msgstr "Kutsata udindo wa mawu a pulojekiti."

msgid "Remark"
msgstr "Ndemanga"

msgid "Comments and remarks."
msgstr "Ndemanga ndi zolemba."

msgid "Running header"
msgstr "Mutu woyenda"

msgid "Running header text for a book."
msgstr "Mawu a mutu woyenda a buku."

msgid "Left running header"
msgstr "Mutu woyenda wakumanzere"

msgid "Running header text for a book, left page."
msgstr "Mawu a mutu woyenda a buku, tsamba lakumanzere."

msgid "Right running header"
msgstr "Mutu woyenda wakumanja"

msgid "Running header text for a book, right page."
msgstr "Mawu a mutu woyenda a buku, tsamba lakumanja."

msgid "Long TOC text"
msgstr "Mawu aatali a mndandanda wa zomwe zili"

msgid "Long table of contents text."
msgstr "Mawu aatali a tebulo la zomwe zili."

msgid "Short TOC text"
msgstr "Mawu afupi a mndandanda wa zomwe zili"

msgid "Short table of contents text."
msgstr "Mawu afupi a tebulo la zomwe zili."

msgid "Book abbreviation"
msgstr "Chidule cha buku"

msgid "Book abbreviation for the table of contents."
msgstr "Chidule cha buku cha tebulo la zomwe zili."

msgid "Introduction major title level 1"
msgstr "Mutu waukulu wa mawu oyamba mlingo 1"

msgid "Introduction major title, level 1, if single level."
msgstr "Mutu waukulu wa mawu oyamba, mlingo 1, ngati pali mlingo umodzi."

msgid "Introduction major title, level 1, if multiple levels."
msgstr "Mutu waukulu wa mawu oyamba, mlingo 1, ngati pali milingo ingapo."

msgid "Introduction major title level 2"
msgstr "Mutu waukulu wa mawu oyamba mlingo 2"

msgid "Introduction major title, level 2."
msgstr "Mutu waukulu wa mawu oyamba, mlingo 2."

msgid "Introduction major title level 3"
msgstr "Mutu waukulu wa mawu oyamba mlingo 3"

msgid "Introduction major title, level 3."
msgstr "Mutu waukulu wa mawu oyamba, mlingo 3."

msgid "Introduction major title level 4"
msgstr "Mutu waukulu wa mawu oyamba mlingo 4"

msgid "Introduction major title, level 4."
msgstr "Mutu waukulu wa mawu oyamba, mlingo 4."

msgid "Introduction section heading level 1"
msgstr "Mutu wa gawo la mawu oyamba mlingo 1"

msgid "Introduction section heading, level 1, if single level."
msgstr "Mutu wa gawo la mawu oyamba, mlingo 1, ngati pali mlingo umodzi."

msgid "Introduction section heading, level 1, if multiple levels."
msgstr "Mutu wa gawo la mawu oyamba, mlingo 1, ngati pali milingo ingapo."

msgid "Introduction section heading level 2"
msgstr "Mutu wa gawo la mawu oyamba mlingo 2"

msgid "Introduction section heading, level 2."
msgstr "Mutu wa gawo la mawu oyamba, mlingo 2."

msgid "Introduction paragraph"
msgstr "Ndime ya mawu oyamba"

msgid "Introduction prose paragraph."
msgstr "Ndime ya mawu oyamba ya mawu wamba."

msgid "Indented introduction paragraph"
msgstr "Ndime yolowetsedwa ya mawu oyamba"

msgid "Introduction prose paragraph, with first line indent."
msgstr "Ndime ya mawu oyamba ya mawu wamba, ndi kulowetsa mzere woyamba."

msgid "Introduction margin paragraph"
msgstr "Ndime ya m'mphepete ya mawu oyamba"

msgid ""
"Introduction prose paragraph, with no first line indent. May occur after "
"poetry."
msgstr "Ndime ya mawu oyamba ya mawu wamba, popanda kulowetsa mzere woyamba. Ingabwere pambuyo pa ndakatulo."

msgid "Indented introduction margin paragraph"
msgstr "Ndime ya m'mphepete yolowetsedwa ya mawu oyamba"

msgid ""
"Introduction prose paragraph text, indented, with no first line indent."
msgstr "Mawu a ndime ya mawu oyamba ya mawu wamba, yolowetsedwa, popanda kulowetsa mzere woyamba."

msgid "Introduction quote from text paragraph"
msgstr "Ndime ya mawu otengedwa kuchokera m'mawu a mawu oyamba"

msgid "Introduction prose paragraph, quote from the body text."
msgstr "Ndime ya mawu oyamba ya mawu wamba, mawu otengedwa kuchokera m'thupi la mawu."

msgid "Introduction margin quote from text paragraph"
msgstr "Ndime ya m'mphepete ya mawu otengedwa kuchokera m'mawu a mawu oyamba"

msgid ""
"Introduction prose paragraph, quote from the body text, with no first line "
"indent."
msgstr "Ndime ya mawu oyamba ya mawu wamba, mawu otengedwa kuchokera m'thupi la mawu, popanda kulowetsa mzere woyamba."

msgid "Introduction paragraph right-aligned"
msgstr "Ndime ya mawu oyamba yoyikidwa kumanja"

msgid "Introduction prose paragraph, right aligned."
msgstr "Ndime ya mawu oyamba ya mawu wamba, yoyikidwa kumanja."

msgid "Introduction poetic line"
msgstr "Mzere wa ndakatulo wa mawu oyamba"

msgid "Introduction poetry text, level 1, if single level."
msgstr "Mawu a ndakatulo a mawu oyamba, mlingo 1, ngati pali mlingo umodzi."

msgid "Introduction poetic line level 1"
msgstr "Mzere wa ndakatulo wa mawu oyamba mlingo 1"

msgid "Introduction poetry text, level 1, if multiple levels."
msgstr "Mawu a ndakatulo a mawu oyamba, mlingo 1, ngati pali milingo ingapo."

msgid "Introduction poetic line level 2"
msgstr "Mzere wa ndakatulo wa mawu oyamba mlingo 2"

msgid "Introduction poetry text, level 2, if multiple levels."
msgstr "Mawu a ndakatulo a mawu oyamba, mlingo 2, ngati pali milingo ingapo."

msgid "Introduction poetic line level 3"
msgstr "Mzere wa ndakatulo wa mawu oyamba mlingo 3"

msgid "Introduction poetry text, level 3, if multiple levels."
msgstr "Mawu a ndakatulo a mawu oyamba, mlingo 3, ngati pali milingo ingapo."

msgid "Introduction blank line"
msgstr "Mzere wopanda kanthu wa mawu oyamba"

msgid ""
"May be used to explicitly indicate additional white space between paragraphs."
msgstr "Ungagwiritsidwe ntchito kuwonetsa momveka malo oyera owonjezera pakati pa ndime."

msgid "Introduction list item"
msgstr "Chinthu cha mndandanda wa mawu oyamba"

msgid "A list entry, level 1, if single level."
msgstr "Cholowa cha mndandanda, mlingo 1, ngati pali mlingo umodzi."

msgid "Introduction list item level 1"
msgstr "Chinthu cha mndandanda wa mawu oyamba mlingo 1"

msgid "A list entry, level 1, if multiple levels."
msgstr "Cholowa cha mndandanda, mlingo 1, ngati pali milingo ingapo."

msgid "Introduction list item level 2"
msgstr "Chinthu cha mndandanda wa mawu oyamba mlingo 2"

msgid "A list entry, level 2."
msgstr "Cholowa cha mndandanda, mlingo 2."

msgid "Introduction outline title"
msgstr "Mutu wa chidule cha mawu oyamba"

msgid "Introduction outline title."
msgstr "Mutu wa chidule cha mawu oyamba."

msgid "Introduction outline entry"
msgstr "Cholowa cha chidule cha mawu oyamba"

msgid "Introduction outline text, level 1, if single level."
msgstr "Mawu a chidule cha mawu oyamba, mlingo 1, ngati pali mlingo umodzi."

msgid "Introduction outline entry level 1"
msgstr "Cholowa cha chidule cha mawu oyamba mlingo 1"

msgid "Introduction outline text, level 1, if multiple levels."
msgstr "Mawu a chidule cha mawu oyamba, mlingo 1, ngati pali milingo ingapo."

msgid "Introduction outline entry level 2"
msgstr "Cholowa cha chidule cha mawu oyamba mlingo 2"

msgid "Introduction outline text, level 2."
msgstr "Mawu a chidule cha mawu oyamba, mlingo 2."

msgid "Introduction outline entry level 3"
msgstr "Cholowa cha chidule cha mawu oyamba mlingo 3"

msgid "Introduction outline text, level 3."
msgstr "Mawu a chidule cha mawu oyamba, mlingo 3."

msgid "Introduction outline entry level 4"
msgstr "Cholowa cha chidule cha mawu oyamba mlingo 4"

msgid "Introduction outline text, level 4."
msgstr "Mawu a chidule cha mawu oyamba, mlingo 4."

msgid "Introduction outline reference range"
msgstr "Mtundu wa maumboni a chidule cha mawu oyamba"

msgid ""
"Introduction references range for outline entry; for marking references "
"separately."
msgstr "Mtundu wa maumboni a mawu oyamba a cholowa cha chidule; polemba maumboni padera."

msgid "Introduction quoted text"
msgstr "Mawu otchulidwa a mawu oyamba"

msgid ""
"Scripture quotations, or other quoted text, appearing in the introduction."
msgstr "Mawu otchulidwa a Malemba, kapena mawu ena otchulidwa, omwe amawonekera m'mawu oyamba."

msgid "Explanatory or bridge text"
msgstr "Mawu ofotokoza kapena olumikiza"

msgid ""
"Introduction explanatory or bridge text, e.g. explanation of missing book in "
"short Old Testament."
msgstr "Mawu ofotokoza kapena olumikiza a mawu oyamba, mwachitsanzo kufotokoza buku losowa mu Chipangano Chakale chachifupi."

msgid "Introduction major title ending"
msgstr "Mutu waukulu womaliza wa mawu oyamba"

msgid "Used to mark a major title indicating the end of the introduction."
msgstr "Umagwiritsidwa ntchito polemba mutu waukulu wosonyeza kutha kwa mawu oyamba."

msgid "Introduction major title ending level 1"
msgstr "Mutu waukulu womaliza wa mawu oyamba mlingo 1"

msgid "Introduction major title ending level 2"
msgstr "Mutu waukulu womaliza wa mawu oyamba mlingo 2"

msgid "Introduction end"
msgstr "Kutha kwa mawu oyamba"

msgid ""
"Optionally included to explicitly indicate the end of the introduction "
"material."
msgstr "Waphatikizidwa mwa kusankha kuti asonyeze momveka kutha kwa zinthu za mawu oyamba."

msgid "Major title"
msgstr "Mutu waukulu"

msgid "The main title of the book, if single level."
msgstr "Mutu waukulu wa buku, ngati pali mlingo umodzi."

msgid "Major title level 1"
msgstr "Mutu waukulu mlingo 1"

msgid "The main title of the book, level 1 if multiple levels."
msgstr "Mutu waukulu wa buku, mlingo 1 ngati pali milingo ingapo."

msgid "Major title level 2"
msgstr "Mutu waukulu mlingo 2"

msgid "The main title of the book, level 2."
msgstr "Mutu waukulu wa buku, mlingo 2."

msgid "Major title level 3"
msgstr "Mutu waukulu mlingo 3"

msgid "A secondary title, less important than the main title."
msgstr "Mutu wachiwiri, wocheperako kufunika kuposa mutu waukulu."

msgid "Major title level 4"
msgstr "Mutu waukulu mlingo 4"

msgid "A small secondary title sometimes occurring within parentheses."
msgstr "Mutu waung'ono wachiwiri womwe nthawi zina umakhala m'mabulaketi."

msgid "Major title at ending"
msgstr "Mutu waukulu kumapeto"

msgid ""
"The main title of the book repeated at the end of the book, if single level."
msgstr "Mutu waukulu wa buku wobwerezedwa kumapeto kwa buku, ngati pali mlingo umodzi."

msgid "Major title at ending level 1"
msgstr "Mutu waukulu kumapeto mlingo 1"

msgid ""
"The main title of the book repeated at the end of the book, if multiple "
"levels."
msgstr "Mutu waukulu wa buku wobwerezedwa kumapeto kwa buku, ngati pali milingo ingapo."

msgid "Major title at ending level 2"
msgstr "Mutu waukulu kumapeto mlingo 2"

msgid "A secondary title occurring before or after the ending main title."
msgstr "Mutu wachiwiri womwe umabwera pamaso kapena pambuyo pa mutu waukulu womaliza."

msgid "Major section heading"
msgstr "Mutu wa gawo lalikulu"

msgid "A major section division heading, level 1, if single level."
msgstr "Mutu wa kugawa gawo lalikulu, mlingo 1, ngati pali mlingo umodzi."

msgid "Major section heading level 1"
msgstr "Mutu wa gawo lalikulu mlingo 1"

msgid "A major section division heading, level 1, if multiple levels."
msgstr "Mutu wa kugawa gawo lalikulu, mlingo 1, ngati pali milingo ingapo."

msgid "Major section heading level 2"
msgstr "Mutu wa gawo lalikulu mlingo 2"

msgid "A major section division heading, level 2."
msgstr "Mutu wa kugawa gawo lalikulu, mlingo 2."

msgid "Major section reference range"
msgstr "Mtundu wa maumboni a gawo lalikulu"

msgid "The text reference range listed under a major section heading."
msgstr "Mtundu wa maumboni a mawu olembedwa pansi pa mutu wa gawo lalikulu."

msgid "Section heading"
msgstr "Mutu wa gawo"

msgid "A section heading, level 1, if single level."
msgstr "Mutu wa gawo, mlingo 1, ngati pali mlingo umodzi."

msgid "Section heading level 1"
msgstr "Mutu wa gawo mlingo 1"

msgid "A section heading, level 1, if multiple levels."
msgstr "Mutu wa gawo, mlingo 1, ngati pali milingo ingapo."

msgid "Section heading level 2"
msgstr "Mutu wa gawo mlingo 2"

msgid "A section heading, level 2."
msgstr "Mutu wa gawo, mlingo 2."

msgid "Section heading level 3"
msgstr "Mutu wa gawo mlingo 3"

msgid "A section heading, level 3."
msgstr "Mutu wa gawo, mlingo 3."

msgid "Section heading level 4"
msgstr "Mutu wa gawo mlingo 4"

msgid "A section heading, level 4."
msgstr "Mutu wa gawo, mlingo 4."

msgid "Section reference range"
msgstr "Mtundu wa maumboni a gawo"

msgid "The text reference range listed under a section heading."
msgstr "Mtundu wa maumboni a mawu olembedwa pansi pa mutu wa gawo."

msgid "Parallel passage references"
msgstr "Maumboni a ndime zofanana"

msgid "Parallel references."
msgstr "Maumboni ofanana."

msgid "Inline quotation references"
msgstr "Maumboni a mawu otchulidwa m'mawu"

msgid ""
"A cross-reference indicating the source text for the preceding quotation."
msgstr "Mawu olozera osonyeza mawu oyambirira a mawu otchulidwa apitawa."

msgid "Descriptive title or Hebrew subtitle"
msgstr "Mutu wofotokozera kapena mutu wachiwiri wa Chihebri"

msgid "A Hebrew text heading, to provide description, e.g. Psalms."
msgstr "Mutu wa mawu a Chihebri, wopereka kufotokoza, mwachitsanzo Masalimo."

msgid "Speaker"
msgstr "Wolankhula"

msgid "A heading to identify the speaker."
msgstr "Mutu wodziwitsa wolankhula."

msgid "Semantic division"
msgstr "Kugawa kwa tanthauzo"

msgid ""
"Vertical space used to divide the text into sections, in a manner similar to "
"the structure added through the use of a sequence of heading texts."
msgstr "Mpata woyimirira wogwiritsidwa ntchito kugawa mawu m'zigawo, m'njira yofanana ndi kapangidwe kowonjezeredwa ndi kugwiritsa ntchito mitu ya mawu motsatana."

msgid "Semantic division level 1"
msgstr "Kugawa kwa tanthauzo mlingo 1"

msgid "Semantic division level 2"
msgstr "Kugawa kwa tanthauzo mlingo 2"

msgid "Semantic division level 3"
msgstr "Kugawa kwa tanthauzo mlingo 3"

msgid "Semantic division level 4"
msgstr "Kugawa kwa tanthauzo mlingo 4"

msgid "Chapter number"
msgstr "Nambala ya mutu"

msgid "For the chapter number."
msgstr "Ya nambala ya mutu."

msgid "Alternate chapter number"
msgstr "Nambala ina ya mutu"

msgid ""
"Second or alternate chapter number. For coding dual versification. Useful "
"for places where different traditions of chapter breaks need to be supported "
"in the same translation."
msgstr "Nambala yachiwiri kapena ina ya mutu. Yolembera kugawa mavesi kwa mitundu iwiri. Yothandiza pa malo pomwe miyambo yosiyanasiyana ya kuswa mitu iyenera kuthandizidwa mu kumasulira komweko."

msgid "Chapter label"
msgstr "Cholembera cha mutu"

msgid ""
"Chapter label used for translations that add a word such as 'Chapter' before "
"chapter numbers, e.g. Psalms."
msgstr "Cholembera cha mutu chogwiritsidwa ntchito pa kumasulira komwe kumaonjezera mawu monga 'Mutu' pamaso pa manambala a mitu, mwachitsanzo Masalimo."

msgid "Published chapter character"
msgstr "Chilembo cha mutu chofalitsidwa"

msgid ""
"Published chapter number. This is a chapter marking that would be used in "
"the published text."
msgstr "Nambala ya mutu yofalitsidwa. Ichi ndi chizindikiro cha mutu chomwe chingagwiritsidwe ntchito mu mawu ofalitsidwa."

msgid "Chapter description"
msgstr "Kufotokoza kwa mutu"

msgid "For a brief description of the chapter content."
msgstr "Yofotokoza mwachidule zomwe zili mu mutu."

msgid "Verse number"
msgstr "Nambala ya vesi"

msgid "A verse number."
msgstr "Nambala ya vesi."

msgid "Alternate verse number"
msgstr "Nambala ina ya vesi"

msgid "Second or alternate verse number. For coding dual verse numeration."
msgstr "Nambala yachiwiri kapena ina ya vesi. Yolembera kuwerengera mavesi kwa mitundu iwiri."

msgid "Published verse marker"
msgstr "Chizindikiro cha vesi chofalitsidwa"

msgid ""
"Published verse marker. This is a verse marking that would be used in the "
"published text."
msgstr "Chizindikiro cha vesi chofalitsidwa. Ichi ndi chizindikiro cha vesi chomwe chingagwiritsidwe ntchito mu mawu ofalitsidwa."

msgid "Normal paragraph"
msgstr "Ndime yabwinobwino"

msgid "Paragraph text, with first line indent."
msgstr "Mawu a ndime, ndi kulowetsa mzere woyamba."

msgid "Continuation paragraph"
msgstr "Ndime yopitiriza"

msgid "Margin paragraph text, with no first line indent."
msgstr "Mawu a ndime ya m'mphepete, popanda kulowetsa mzere woyamba."

msgid "Paragraph opening an epistle"
msgstr "Ndime yotsegula kalata"

msgid "Paragraph opening an epistle or letter, without first line indent."
msgstr "Ndime yotsegula kalata, popanda kulowetsa mzere woyamba."

msgid "Right-aligned paragraph"
msgstr "Ndime yoikidwa kumanja"

msgid "Right-aligned paragraph text, without first line indent."
msgstr "Mawu a ndime yoikidwa kumanja, popanda kulowetsa mzere woyamba."

msgid "Closure of a letter"
msgstr "Kutseka kalata"

msgid "For a closure of an letter."
msgstr "Ya kutseka kalata."

msgid "Embedded text opening"
msgstr "Kutsegula mawu olowetsedwa"

msgid "For an embedded text opening."
msgstr "Ya kutsegula mawu olowetsedwa."

msgid "Embedded text paragraph"
msgstr "Ndime ya mawu olowetsedwa"

msgid "For an embedded text paragraph."
msgstr "Ya ndime ya mawu olowetsedwa."

msgid "Embedded text closing"
msgstr "Kutseka mawu olowetsedwa"

msgid "For an embedded text closing."
msgstr "Ya kutseka mawu olowetsedwa."

msgid "Embedded text refrain"
msgstr "Mawu obwerezabwereza a mawu olowetsedwa"

msgid "Embedded text refrain, e.g. Then all the people shall say, Amen!"
msgstr "Mawu obwerezabwereza a mawu olowetsedwa, mwachitsanzo Pamenepo anthu onse adzati, Ameni!"

msgid "Indented paragraph"
msgstr "Ndime yolowetsedwa"

msgid ""
"Paragraph text, level 1 indent if single level, with first line indent; "
"often used for discourse."
msgstr "Mawu a ndime, kulowetsa mlingo 1 ngati pali mlingo umodzi, ndi kulowetsa mzere woyamba; nthawi zambiri amagwiritsidwa ntchito polankhula."

msgid "Indented paragraph level 1"
msgstr "Ndime yolowetsedwa mlingo 1"

msgid ""
"Paragraph text, level 1 indent if multiple levels, with first line indent; "
"often used for discourse."
msgstr "Mawu a ndime, kulowetsa mlingo 1 ngati pali milingo ingapo, ndi kulowetsa mzere woyamba; nthawi zambiri amagwiritsidwa ntchito polankhula."

msgid "Indented paragraph level 2"
msgstr "Ndime yolowetsedwa mlingo 2"

msgid ""
"Paragraph text, level 2 indent if multiple levels, with first line indent; "
"often used for discourse."
msgstr "Mawu a ndime, kulowetsa mlingo 2 ngati pali milingo ingapo, ndi kulowetsa mzere woyamba; nthawi zambiri amagwiritsidwa ntchito polankhula."

msgid "Indented paragraph level 3"
msgstr "Ndime yolowetsedwa mlingo 3"

msgid ""
"Paragraph text, level 3 indent if multiple levels, with first line indent; "
"often used for discourse."
msgstr "Mawu a ndime, kulowetsa mlingo 3 ngati pali milingo ingapo, ndi kulowetsa mzere woyamba; nthawi zambiri amagwiritsidwa ntchito polankhula."

msgid "Indented flush left paragraph"
msgstr "Ndime yolowetsedwa yoikidwa kumanzere"

msgid ""
"Margin paragraph text, indented, with no first line indent, often used for "
"discourse."
msgstr "Mawu a ndime ya m'mphepete, yolowetsedwa, popanda kulowetsa mzere woyamba, nthawi zambiri amagwiritsidwa ntchito polankhula."

msgid "No break with previous paragraph"
msgstr "Popanda kupuma ndi ndime yapitayi"

msgid ""
"Paragraph text, with no break from previous paragraph text at chapter "
"boundary."
msgstr "Mawu a ndime, popanda kupuma kuchokera ku mawu a ndime yapitayi pa malire a mutu."

msgid "Centered paragraph"
msgstr "Ndime yoikidwa pakati"

msgid "Paragraph text, centered, for inscription."
msgstr "Mawu a ndime, oikidwa pakati, a zolembedwa pa chinthu."

msgid "Paragraph with hanging indent"
msgstr "Ndime yokhala ndi kulowetsa kwakulendewera"

msgid "Indented paragraph with hanging indent."
msgstr "Ndime yolowetsedwa yokhala ndi kulowetsa kwakulendewera."

msgid "Paragraph with hanging indent level 1"
msgstr "Ndime yokhala ndi kulowetsa kwakulendewera mlingo 1"

msgid "Indented paragraph with hanging indent, level 1 if multiple levels."
msgstr "Ndime yolowetsedwa yokhala ndi kulowetsa kwakulendewera, mlingo 1 ngati pali milingo ingapo."

msgid "Paragraph with hanging indent level 2"
msgstr "Ndime yokhala ndi kulowetsa kwakulendewera mlingo 2"

msgid "Indented paragraph with hanging indent, level 2."
msgstr "Ndime yolowetsedwa yokhala ndi kulowetsa kwakulendewera, mlingo 2."

msgid "Paragraph with hanging indent level 3"
msgstr "Ndime yokhala ndi kulowetsa kwakulendewera mlingo 3"

msgid "Indented paragraph with hanging indent, level 3."
msgstr "Ndime yolowetsedwa yokhala ndi kulowetsa kwakulendewera, mlingo 3."

msgid "Paragraph with hanging indent level 4"
msgstr "Ndime yokhala ndi kulowetsa kwakulendewera mlingo 4"

msgid "Indented paragraph with hanging indent, level 4."
msgstr "Ndime yolowetsedwa yokhala ndi kulowetsa kwakulendewera, mlingo 4."

msgid "Blank line"
msgstr "Mzere wopanda kanthu"

msgid ""
"May be used to explicitly indicate additional white space between "
"paragraphs. Poetry text stanza break."
msgstr "Ungagwiritsidwe ntchito kusonyeza momveka malo oyera owonjezera pakati pa ndime. Kupuma kwa ndime mu mawu a ndakatulo."

msgid "Poetic line"
msgstr "Mzere wa ndakatulo"

msgid "Poetry text, level 1 indent if single level."
msgstr "Mawu a ndakatulo, kulowetsa mlingo 1 ngati pali mlingo umodzi."

msgid "Poetry text, level 1 indent if multiple levels."
msgstr "Mawu a ndakatulo, kulowetsa mlingo 1 ngati pali milingo ingapo."

msgid "Poetry text, level 2 indent."
msgstr "Mawu a ndakatulo, kulowetsa mlingo 2."

msgid "Poetry text, level 3 indent."
msgstr "Mawu a ndakatulo, kulowetsa mlingo 3."

msgid "Right-aligned poetic line"
msgstr "Mzere wa ndakatulo woikidwa kumanja"

msgid "Commonly used for a poetic refrain."
msgstr "Nthawi zambiri amagwiritsidwa ntchito pa mawu obwerezabwereza a ndakatulo."

msgid "Centered poetic line"
msgstr "Mzere wa ndakatulo woikidwa pakati"

