msgstr "Ndemanga ya Chihebri yokhudza kuimba nyimbo yofanana mu zomwe zili ndi mitu yambiri ya Masalimo a Chihebri, koma yoikidwa kumapeto kwa gawo la ndakatulo."

msgid "List header"
msgstr "Mutu wa mndandanda"

msgid ""
"Some lists include an introductory and concluding remark. They are an "
"integral part of the list content, but are not list items. A list does not "
"require either or both of these elements."
msgstr "Mindandanda ina imaphatikizapo mawu oyamba ndi omaliza. Ndi gawo lofunika la zomwe zili mu mndandanda, koma si zinthu za mndandanda. Mndandanda sufuna chimodzi kapena zonse ziwiri."

