msgstr "Chinthu cha selo ya tebulo, mzati 3, choikidwa kumanja."

msgid "Right aligned table cell column 4"
msgstr "Selo ya tebulo yoikidwa kumanja mzati 4"

msgid "A table cell item, column 4, right aligned."
msgstr "Chinthu cha selo ya tebulo, mzati 4, choikidwa kumanja."

msgid "Footnote"
msgstr "Mawu a m'munsi"

msgid "A footnote text item."
msgstr "Chinthu cha mawu a m'munsi."

msgid "Endnote"
msgstr "Mawu omaliza"

msgid "An endnote text item."
msgstr "Chinthu cha mawu omaliza."

msgid "Footnote origin reference"
msgstr "Mawu olozera chiyambi cha mawu a m'munsi"

msgid "This is the chapter and verse or verses that note refers to."
msgstr "Ichi ndi mutu ndi vesi kapena mavesi omwe cholembacho chikulozera."

msgid "Footnote translation quotation"
msgstr "Mawu otchulidwa a kumasulira a mawu a m'munsi"

msgid ""
"A quotation from the current scripture text translation for which the note "
"is being provided."
msgstr "Mawu otchulidwa kuchokera ku kumasulira kwamakono kwa mawu a Malemba omwe cholembacho chaperekedwa."

msgid "Footnote alternate translation"
msgstr "Kumasulira kwina kwa mawu a m'munsi"

msgid ""
"Used to distinguish between a quotation of the current scripture text "
"translation, and an alternate translation."
msgstr "Kumagwiritsidwa ntchito kusiyanitsa pakati pa mawu otchulidwa a kumasulira kwamakono kwa mawu a Malemba, ndi kumasulira kwina."

msgid "Footnote keyword"
msgstr "Mawu ofunika a mawu a m'munsi"

msgid ""
"The specific keyword or term from the text for which the footnote is being "
"provided."
msgstr "Mawu ofunika enieni kapena mawu ochokera mu mawu omwe mawu a m'munsi aperekedwa."

msgid "Footnote label text"
msgstr "Mawu a chizindikiro cha mawu a m'munsi"

msgid ""
"Can be used for labeling word(s) which are used consistently across certain "
"types of translation notes, such as the words 'Or' in an alternative "
"translation note, 'Others', 'Heb.', 'LXX' etc."
msgstr "Angagwiritsidwe ntchito polemba mawu omwe amagwiritsidwa ntchito mofanana pa mitundu ina ya zolemba za kumasulira, monga mawu oti 'Kapena' mu cholemba cha kumasulira kwina, 'Ena', 'Heb.', 'LXX' ndi zina zotero."

msgid "Footnote witness list"
msgstr "Mndandanda wa mboni wa mawu a m'munsi"

msgid ""
"For distinguishing a list of sigla representing witnesses in critical "
"editions."
msgstr "Wosiyanitsa mndandanda wa zizindikiro zoimira mboni mu mabuku ofalitsidwa ofufuza."

msgid "Footnote additional paragraph"
msgstr "Ndime yowonjezera ya mawu a m'munsi"

msgid ""
"Use this marker to if you need to indicate the start of a new paragraph "
"within a footnote."
msgstr "Gwiritsani ntchito chizindikiro ichi ngati mukufunika kusonyeza kuyamba kwa ndime yatsopano mkati mwa mawu a m'munsi."

msgid "Footnote verse number"
msgstr "Nambala ya vesi ya mawu a m'munsi"

msgid "A verse number within the footnote text."
msgstr "Nambala ya vesi mkati mwa mawu a m'munsi."

msgid "Footnote text"
msgstr "Mawu a mawu a m'munsi"

msgid "The essential or explanatory text of the footnote."
msgstr "Mawu ofunika kapena ofotokoza a mawu a m'munsi."

msgid "Footnote Deuterocanonical content"
msgstr "Zomwe zili za Deuterokanoniko za mawu a m'munsi"

msgid ""
"Text between these markers is material to be included only in published "
"editions that contain the Deuterocanonical books."
msgstr "Mawu pakati pa zizindikiro izi ndi zinthu zoyenera kuphatikizidwa m'mabuku ofalitsidwa okhala ndi mabuku a Deuterokanoniko okha."

msgid "Footnote reference mark"
msgstr "Chizindikiro cholozera cha mawu a m'munsi"

msgid "An additional footnote marker location for a previous footnote."
msgstr "Malo owonjezera a chizindikiro cha mawu a m'munsi apitawo."

msgid "Cross reference"
msgstr "Mawu olozera"

msgid "A list of cross references."
msgstr "Mndandanda wa mawu olozera."

msgid "Cross reference origin reference"
msgstr "Mawu olozera chiyambi cha mawu olozera"

msgid ""
"This is the chapter and verse or verses that target references are being "
"provided for."
msgstr "Ichi ndi mutu ndi vesi kapena mavesi omwe maumboni ofikako akuperekedwa."

msgid "Cross reference keyword"
msgstr "Mawu ofunika a mawu olozera"

msgid ""
"A keyword from the scripture translation text which the target references "
"also refer to."
msgstr "Mawu ofunika ochokera mu mawu a kumasulira Malemba omwe maumboni ofikako amalozeranso."

msgid "Cross reference quotation"
msgstr "Mawu otchulidwa a mawu olozera"

msgid "A cross reference quotation from the scripture text."
msgstr "Mawu otchulidwa a mawu olozera kuchokera ku mawu a Malemba."

msgid "Cross reference target references"
msgstr "Maumboni ofikako a mawu olozera"

msgid "The cross reference target references."
msgstr "Maumboni ofikako a mawu olozera."

msgid "Target references added text"
msgstr "Mawu owonjezeredwa a maumboni ofikako"

msgid "Used for marking text added to the target references."
msgstr "Amagwiritsidwa ntchito polemba mawu owonjezeredwa ku maumboni ofikako."

msgid "Published cross reference origin text"
msgstr "Mawu a chiyambi cha mawu olozera ofalitsidwa"

msgid "Supplies the origin text intended for publishing."
msgstr "Amapereka mawu a chiyambi oyang'ana kufalitsidwa."

msgid "Cross reference Old Testament"
msgstr "Mawu olozera Chipangano Chakale"

msgid ""
"Content between these markers is for inclusion in editions that contain the "
"Old Testament books."
msgstr "Zomwe zili pakati pa zizindikiro izi ndi za kuphatikizidwa m'mabuku ofalitsidwa okhala ndi mabuku a Chipangano Chakale."

msgid "Cross reference New Testament"
msgstr "Mawu olozera Chipangano Chatsopano"

msgid ""
"Content between these markers is for inclusion in editions that contain the "
"New Testament books."
msgstr "Zomwe zili pakati pa zizindikiro izi ndi za kuphatikizidwa m'mabuku ofalitsidwa okhala ndi mabuku a Chipangano Chatsopano."

msgid "Cross reference deuterocanonical"
msgstr "Mawu olozera a deuterokanoniko"

msgid ""
"Content between these markers is for inclusion in editions that contain the "
"Deuterocanonical books."
msgstr "Zomwe zili pakati pa zizindikiro izi ndi za kuphatikizidwa m'mabuku ofalitsidwa okhala ndi mabuku a Deuterokanoniko."

msgid "Translator’s addition"
msgstr "Chowonjezera cha womasulira"

msgid ""
"A translator’s explanation - words added by the translator for clarity – "
"text which is not literally a part of the original language, but which was "
"supplied to make the meaning of the original clear."
msgstr "Kufotokoza kwa womasulira - mawu owonjezeredwa ndi womasulira kuti pakhale kumveka - mawu omwe si gawo lenileni la chilankhulo choyambirira, koma operekedwa kuti afotokoze tanthauzo la choyambirira."

msgid "Quoted book title"
msgstr "Mutu wa buku wotchulidwa"

msgid "For the quoted name of a book."
msgstr "Wa dzina lotchulidwa la buku."

msgid "Deuterocanonical"
msgstr "Deuterokanoniko"

msgid ""
"Deuterocanonical / LXX additions or insertions in the Protocanonical text."
msgstr "Zowonjezera kapena zolowetsedwa za Deuterokanoniko / LXX mu mawu a Protokanoniko."

msgid "Keyword"
msgstr "Mawu ofunika"

msgid "Keyword / keyterm."
msgstr "Mawu ofunika / mawu ofunika kwambiri."

msgid "Liturgical note"
msgstr "Cholemba cha kupembedza"

msgid ""
"A guide which tells the reader or worshipper that he should recite a prayer "
"or recitation etc."
msgstr "Chitsogozo chomwe chimauza wowerenga kapena wopembedza kuti ayenera kunena pemphero kapena kubwereza zina ndi zina."

msgid "Name of God"
msgstr "Dzina la Mulungu"

msgid "For name of God (name of Deity)."
msgstr "Ya dzina la Mulungu (dzina la Umulungu)."

msgid "Ordinal number ending"
msgstr "Mapeto a nambala ya motsatana"

msgid "For the text portion of an ordinal number."
msgstr "Ya gawo la mawu la nambala ya motsatana."

msgid "Proper name"
msgstr "Dzina la munthu kapena malo"

msgid "For a proper name."
msgstr "Ya dzina lenileni."

msgid "Geographic proper name"
msgstr "Dzina la malo"

msgid "For a geographic proper name."
msgstr "Ya dzina lenileni la malo."

msgid "Combined add and pn style"
msgstr "Kalembedwe kophatikiza ka add ndi pn"

msgid "Support for overlapping pn ...pn* and add ...add* occurrences."
msgstr "Kuthandizira kuphatikizana kwa pn ...pn* ndi add ...add*."

msgid "Quoted text"
msgstr "Mawu otchulidwa"

msgid "Old Testament quotations in the New Testament, or other quotations."
msgstr "Mawu otchulidwa a Chipangano Chakale mu Chipangano Chatsopano, kapena mawu ena otchulidwa."

msgid "Signature of the author"
msgstr "Siginecha ya wolemba"

msgid "Signature of the author of a letter or epistle."
msgstr "Siginecha ya wolemba kalata kapena epistole."

msgid "Secondary language source"
msgstr "Gwero la chilankhulo chachiwiri"

msgid ""
"Passage of text based on a secondary language or alternate text source."
msgstr "Ndime ya mawu yozikidwa pa chilankhulo chachiwiri kapena gwero lina la mawu."

msgid "Transliterated text"
msgstr "Mawu olembedwa ndi zilembo za chilankhulo china"

msgid "Transliterated or foreign word or text."
msgstr "Mawu kapena mawu olembedwa ndi zilembo za chilankhulo china kapena achilendo."

msgid "Words of Jesus"
msgstr "Mawu a Yesu"

msgid "For marking the words of Jesus."
msgstr "Polemba mawu a Yesu."

msgid "Emphasized text"
msgstr "Mawu otsindika"

msgid "For emphasizing a portion of text."
msgstr "Potsindika gawo la mawu."

msgid "Bold text"
msgstr "Mawu akuda"

msgid "For making a portion of text bold."
msgstr "Popanga gawo la mawu kukhala lakuda."

msgid "Italic text"
msgstr "Mawu opendekeka"

msgid "For putting some text in italics."
msgstr "Poika mawu ena opendekeka."

msgid "Bold-italic text"
msgstr "Mawu akuda opendekeka"

msgid "For putting some text in bold and italics."
msgstr "Poika mawu ena akuda ndi opendekeka."

msgid "Normal text"
msgstr "Mawu abwinobwino"

msgid ""
"May be used when a larger paragraph element is set in an alternate font "
"style, e.g. italic, and a selected section of text should be displayed in "
"normal text."
msgstr "Angagwiritsidwe ntchito pamene chinthu chachikulu cha ndime chakhazikitsidwa mu kalembedwe kina ka zilembo, mwachitsanzo kopendekeka, ndipo gawo losankhidwa la mawu liyenera kuwonetsedwa mu mawu abwinobwino."

msgid "Small-cap text"
msgstr "Mawu a zilembo zazikulu zazing'ono"

msgid "For putting some text in small capitals."
msgstr "Poika mawu ena mu zilembo zazikulu zazing'ono."

msgid "Superscript text"
msgstr "Mawu apamwamba"

msgid "Superscript text typically for use in critical edition footnotes."
msgstr "Mawu apamwamba nthawi zambiri ogwiritsidwa ntchito mu mawu a m'munsi a mabuku ofalitsidwa ofufuza."

msgid "Page break"
msgstr "Kupuma kwa tsamba"

msgid "Explicit page break."
msgstr "Kupuma kwa tsamba komveka."

msgid "Figure / illustration / map"
msgstr "Chithunzi / chiwonetsero / mapu"

msgid "Illustration [columns to span, height, filename, caption text]."
msgstr "Chiwonetsero [mizati yoti ifalikire, kutalika, dzina la fayilo, mawu a pamutu]."

msgid "Subject index entry"
msgstr "Cholowa cha mndandanda wa nkhani"

msgid ""
"Surround a word or words with this markup to indicate that it should appear "
"in the subject index."
msgstr "Zungulirani mawu kapena mawu ndi chizindikiro ichi kusonyeza kuti ayenera kuwonekera mu mndandanda wa nkhani."

msgid "Annotated base text"
msgstr "Mawu oyambira ofotokozedwa"

msgid "Used to mark the base text being annotated with ruby characters."
msgstr "Amagwiritsidwa ntchito polemba mawu oyambira omwe akufotokozedwa ndi zilembo za ruby."

msgid "Pronunciation annotation"
msgstr "Kufotokoza kwa matchulidwe"

msgid "For indicating pronunciation in CJK texts."
msgstr "Posonyeza matchulidwe m'mawu a CJK."

msgid "Wordlist entry"
msgstr "Cholowa cha mndandanda wa mawu"

msgid ""
"Surround words with this markup to indicate that it should appear in the "
"word list."
msgstr "Zungulirani mawu ndi chizindikiro ichi kusonyeza kuti ayenera kuwonekera mu mndandanda wa mawu."

msgid "Greek word list entry"
msgstr "Cholowa cha mndandanda wa mawu a Chigiriki"

msgid ""
"Surround words with this markup to indicate that it should appear in the "
"Greek word list."
msgstr "Zungulirani mawu ndi chizindikiro ichi kusonyeza kuti ayenera kuwonekera mu mndandanda wa mawu a Chigiriki."

msgid "Hebrew word list entry"
msgstr "Cholowa cha mndandanda wa mawu a Chihebri"

msgid ""
"Surround words with this markup to indicate that it should appear in the "
"Hebrew word list."
msgstr "Zungulirani mawu ndi chizindikiro ichi kusonyeza kuti ayenera kuwonekera mu mndandanda wa mawu a Chihebri."

msgid "Aramaic word list entry"
msgstr "Cholowa cha mndandanda wa mawu a Chiaramu"

msgid ""
"Surround words with this markup to indicate that it should appear in the "
"Aramaic word list."
msgstr "Zungulirani mawu ndi chizindikiro ichi kusonyeza kuti ayenera kuwonekera mu mndandanda wa mawu a Chiaramu."

msgid "Quotation start milestone"
msgstr "Chizindikiro cha kuyamba kwa mawu otchulidwa"

msgid "Typically used for indicating the speaker of the text."
msgstr "Nthawi zambiri chimagwiritsidwa ntchito posonyeza wolankhula mawu."

msgid "Quotation start milestone level 1"
msgstr "Chizindikiro cha kuyamba kwa mawu otchulidwa mlingo 1"

msgid "Quotation start milestone level 2"
msgstr "Chizindikiro cha kuyamba kwa mawu otchulidwa mlingo 2"

msgid "Quotation end milestone"
msgstr "Chizindikiro cha kutha kwa mawu otchulidwa"

msgid "Quotation end milestone level 1"
msgstr "Chizindikiro cha kutha kwa mawu otchulidwa mlingo 1"

msgid "Quotation end milestone level 2"
msgstr "Chizindikiro cha kutha kwa mawu otchulidwa mlingo 2"

msgid "Translator’s section start milestone"
msgstr "Chizindikiro cha kuyamba kwa gawo la womasulira"

msgid "For identifying a chunk of text suitable for translating at one time."
msgstr "Chozindikiritsa gawo la mawu loyenera kumasuliridwa nthawi imodzi."

msgid "Translator’s section end milestone"
msgstr "Chizindikiro cha kutha kwa gawo la womasulira"

msgid "Extended footnote"
msgstr "Mawu a m'munsi owonjezedwa"

msgid "Extended footnote element."
msgstr "Chinthu cha mawu a m'munsi owonjezedwa."

msgid "Extended cross reference"
msgstr "Mawu olozera owonjezedwa"

msgid "Extended list of cross references."
msgstr "Mndandanda wowonjezedwa wa mawu olozera."

msgid "Sidebar start"
msgstr "Kuyamba kwa mbali"

msgid "Beginning or opening of the sidebar content section."
msgstr "Kuyamba kapena kutsegula kwa gawo la zomwe zili mu mbali."

msgid "Sidebar end"
msgstr "Kutha kwa mbali"

msgid "End or closing of the sidebar content section."
msgstr "Kutha kapena kutseka kwa gawo la zomwe zili mu mbali."

msgid "Category tag"
msgstr "Chizindikiro cha gulu"

msgid "Extended note or sidebar category tag."
msgstr "Chizindikiro cha gulu la cholemba chowonjezedwa kapena mbali."

msgid "Peripheral"
msgstr "Zakunja"

msgid "Division for peripheral content."
msgstr "Gawo la zomwe zili zakunja."

msgid "Link text"
msgstr "Mawu a ulalo"

msgid ""
"Optionally used for associating linking attributes to a span of text when no "
"other character level markup is applied to the same span."
msgstr "Amagwiritsidwa ntchito mwasankho kugwirizanitsa makhalidwe a ulalo ndi gawo la mawu pamene palibe chizindikiro china cha mlingo wa chilembo chomwe chikugwiritsidwa ntchito pa gawo lomwelo."

