msgid ""
"To which city was Paul travelling when a light from heaven shone round about "
"him?"
msgstr "Paulo ankapita kumzinda uti pamene kuwala kochokera kumwamba kunamuzungulira?"

msgid "Damascus"
msgstr "Damasiko"

msgid ""
"And while he travelled, he came near Damascus; and suddenly a light from "
"heaven shone round about him."
msgstr "Ndipo pakuyenda iye, anayandikira Damasiko; ndipo mwadzidzidzi kuwala kochokera kumwamba kunamuzungulira."

msgid "What is the name of the brother of Aaron the high priest?"
msgstr "Kodi mbale wa Aroni, mkulu wa ansembe, dzina lake ndani?"

msgid "Moses"
msgstr "Mose"

msgid ""
"And the anger of Jehova was kindled against Moses, and he said: Is not Aaron "
"the Levite your brother?"
msgstr "Ndipo mkwiyo wa Yehova unayakira Mose, ndipo anati, Kodi Aroni Mlevi si mbale wako?"

msgid "What is the name of the city where Jesus was born?"
msgstr "Kodi mzinda umene Yesu anabadwiramo umatchedwa chiyani?"

msgid "Bethlehem"
msgstr "Betelehemu"

msgid ""
"When Jesus was born in Bethlehem of Judaea in the days of Herod the king, "
"behold, wise men from the east came to Jerusalem."
msgstr "Yesu atabadwira ku Betelehemu wa ku Yudeya m'masiku a mfumu Herode, taonani, anzeru ochokera kum'mawa anafika ku Yerusalemu."

msgid "What is the name of the island where John was sent to?"
msgstr "Kodi chilumba chimene Yohane anatumizidwako chimatchedwa chiyani?"

msgid "Patmos"
msgstr "Patimo"

msgid ""
"I, John, your brother and companion in the persecution, and in the kingdom "
"and endurance of Jesus Christ, was in the island called Patmos, because of "
"the word of God, and because of the testimony of Jesus Christ."
msgstr "Ine Yohane, mbale wanu ndi mnzanu m'masautso ndi mu ufumu ndi m'kupirira kwa Yesu Khristu, ndinali pa chilumba chotchedwa Patimo, chifukwa cha Mawu a Mulungu ndi umboni wa Yesu Khristu."

msgid "Who is the first person to acknowledge Jesus as the Christ?"
msgstr "Ndani anali woyamba kuzindikira Yesu kukhala Khristu?"

msgid "Simeon"
msgstr "Simeoni"

msgid ""
"There was Simeon. A just and devout man. The Holy Spirit told him that he "
"will see Christ before his death."
msgstr "Panali Simeoni. Munthu wolungama ndi wopembedza. Mzimu Woyera anamuuza kuti adzaona Khristu asanafe."

msgid "To whom was the Acts Of Apostles written?"
msgstr "Buku la Machitidwe a Atumwi linalembedwera ndani?"

msgid "Theophilus"
msgstr "Teofilo"

msgid ""
"The former treatise have I made, O Theophilus, of all that Jesus began both "
"to do and teach,"
msgstr "Buku loyamba ndinalemba, iwe Teofilo, la zonse zimene Yesu anayamba kuchita ndi kuphunzitsa,"

msgid "Where did Jesus met the woman from Samaria?"
msgstr "Kodi Yesu anakumana ndi mkazi wa ku Samariya kuti?"

msgid "Jacob's well"
msgstr "Chitsime cha Yakobo"

msgid ""
"Jesus being wearied by his journey, sat on Jacob's well. Then came a woman "
"from Samaria to get water."
msgstr "Yesu, wotopa ndi ulendo, anakhala pansi pa chitsime cha Yakobo. Kenako mkazi wa ku Samariya anabwera kudzatunga madzi."

msgid "Who was the father of Abraham?"
msgstr "Ndani anali atate wa Abrahamu?"

msgid "Terah"
msgstr "Tera"

msgid "And Terah took Abram his son,"
msgstr "Ndipo Tera anatenga Abramu mwana wake,"

msgid "Who was the son of Cush, the mighty hunter before the Lord?"
msgstr "Ndani anali mwana wa Kusi, mlenje wamphamvu pamaso pa Yehova?"

msgid "Nimrod"
msgstr "Nimrodi"

msgid "And Cush bore Nimrod. He was a mighty hunter before the Lord."
msgstr "Ndipo Kusi anabereka Nimrodi. Iye anali mlenje wamphamvu pamaso pa Yehova."

msgid "What is the name of Job's friend that answered him first?"
msgstr "Kodi bwenzi la Yobu amene anamuyankha poyamba dzina lake ndani?"

msgid "Eliphaz"
msgstr "Elifazi"

msgid "Then Eliphaz the Temanite answered and said to Job."
msgstr "Pamenepo Elifazi Mtemani anayankha, nati kwa Yobu."

msgid "What is the name of Ruth's husband?"
msgstr "Kodi mwamuna wa Rute dzina lake ndani?"

msgid "Boaz"
msgstr "Boazi"

msgid "So Boaz took Ruth as his wife."
msgstr "Choncho Boazi anatenga Rute kukhala mkazi wake."

msgid "Who taught Lemuel Proverbs chapter 31?"
msgstr "Ndani anaphunzitsa Lemueli Miyambo mutu 31?"

msgid "Lemuel's mother"
msgstr "Amayi a Lemueli"

msgid "The words of king Lemuel, the prophecy that his mother taught him."
msgstr "Mawu a mfumu Lemueli, mawu aulosi amene amayi ake anamphunzitsa."

msgid "Who is the chosen people of God in the Old Testament?"
msgstr "Ndani ndi anthu osankhidwa a Mulungu mu Chipangano Chakale?"

msgid "Israel"
msgstr "Israele"

msgid "Israel, you are the chosen people of the Lord your God."
msgstr "Iwe Israele, ndiwe anthu osankhidwa a Yehova Mulungu wako."

msgid "Where did God rescue Israel from?"
msgstr "Kodi Mulungu anapulumutsa Israele kuchokera kuti?"

msgid "Egypt"
msgstr "Igupto"

msgid "Then with his mighty arm, he rescued you from Egypt."
msgstr "Pamenepo ndi dzanja lake lamphamvu anakutulutsani mu Igupto."

msgid "Who's the father of Abimelech?"
msgstr "Kodi atate wa Abimeleki ndani?"

msgid "Gideon"
msgstr "Gideoni"

msgid "Abimelech the son of Gideon went to Shechem."
msgstr "Abimeleki mwana wa Gideoni anapita ku Sekemu."

msgid "Who's the father of Joshua the priest in the time of Ezra?"
msgstr "Kodi atate wa Yoswa wansembe m'nthawi ya Ezara ndani?"

msgid "Jozadak"
msgstr "Yozadaki"

msgid "The priest Joshua son of Jozadak."
msgstr "Wansembe Yoswa mwana wa Yozadaki."

msgid "Who's the king of Babylonia, that captures Israel?"
msgstr "Kodi mfumu ya Babulo imene inagwira Israele ndani?"

msgid "Nebuchadnezzar"
msgstr "Nebukadinezara"

msgid ""
"We were told that their people had made God angry, and he let them be "
"captured by Nebuchadnezzar, the king of Babylonia."
msgstr "Anatiuza kuti anthu awo anakwiyitsa Mulungu, ndipo analola kuti agwidwe ndi Nebukadinezara, mfumu ya Babulo."

msgid ""
"Who prospered in the reign of Darius, and in the reign of Cyrus the Persian?"
msgstr "Ndani anapindula muulamuliro wa Dariyo ndi muulamuliro wa Koresi Mperisiya?"

msgid ""
"So this Daniel prospered in the reign of Darius, and in the reign of Cyrus "
"the Persian."
msgstr "Choncho Danieli uyu anapindula muulamuliro wa Dariyo ndi muulamuliro wa Koresi Mperisiya."

msgid "Who's Abram's brother's son?"
msgstr "Kodi mwana wa mbale wa Abramu ndani?"

msgid "Lot"
msgstr "Loti"

msgid ""
"And they took Lot, Abram's brother's son, who dwelt in Sodom, and his goods, "
"and departed."
msgstr "Ndipo anatenga Loti, mwana wa mbale wa Abramu, amene anakhala ku Sodomu, ndi chuma chake, napita."

msgid "Who wrote Song of Songs?"
msgstr "Ndani analemba Nyimbo ya Solomo?"

msgid "Solomon"
msgstr "Solomo"

msgid "This is Solomon's most beautiful song."
msgstr "Iyi ndi nyimbo yokongola kwambiri ya Solomo."

msgid "Who's the father of Hosea?"
msgstr "Kodi atate wa Hoseya ndani?"

msgid "Beeri"
msgstr "Beeri"

msgid "I am Hosea son of Beeri."
msgstr "Ndine Hoseya mwana wa Beeri."

msgid "Username should be at least four characters long"
msgstr "Dzina la wogwiritsa ntchito liyenera kukhala ndi zilembo zosachepera zinayi"

msgid "The answer to the question is not correct"
msgstr "Yankho la funso siliri lolondola"

msgid "The username that you have chosen has already been taken."
msgstr "Dzina la wogwiritsa ntchito lomwe mwasankha lagwiritsidwa kale."

msgid "Please choose another one."
msgstr "Chonde sankhani lina."

msgid "The email address that you have chosen has already been taken."
msgstr "Adilesi ya imelo yomwe mwasankha yagwiritsidwa kale."

msgid "Signup verification"
msgstr "Kutsimikizira kulembetsa"

msgid "There is a request to open an account with this email address."
msgstr "Pali pempho lotsegula akaunti ndi adilesi ya imelo iyi."

msgid "Account opened"
msgstr "Akaunti yatsegulidwa"

msgid "Welcome!"
msgstr "Takulandirani!"

msgid "Your account is now active and you have logged in."
msgstr "Akaunti yanu tsopano ndi yogwira ntchito ndipo mwalowa."

msgid "Username should be at least two characters long"
msgstr "Dzina la wogwiritsa ntchito liyenera kukhala ndi zilembo zosachepera ziwiri"

msgid "Username or email address or password are not correct"
msgstr "Dzina la wogwiritsa ntchito kapena adilesi ya imelo kapena mawu achinsinsi siolondola"
